{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "high3r", "line": "My plug contact is Kim K I call him when I need Ye", "vault_lines": ["My plug contact is Kim K"], "meaning": "Weezy is referencing the former relationship of celebrity Kim Kardashian and her ex-husband Kanye West, who is commonly referred to as “Ye.”\n\n“Ye” is also slang for drugs, usually cocaine. So whenever Weezy is in need of drugs, he can hit up his dealer and have them right away.", "annotation_id": "32754758", "url": "https://genius.com/32754758", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
