{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "In the boot", "vault_lines": ["Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne hails from the Hollygrove neighborhood of New Orleans, Louisiana, as he has constantly repped in his music throughout his whole career.\n\nLouisiana, due to it’s iconic shape, has been nicknamed “The Boot”, because, well, see for yourself.", "annotation_id": "13469762", "url": "https://genius.com/13469762", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "If you survive these 50 shots, you was in God’s favor Big guns, I’mmma send your mom my condolences But if she with you when I hit you, you know how us niggas from New Orleans is Everybody get it, everybody gon’ feel it", "vault_lines": ["If you survive these 50 shots, you was in God’s favor"], "meaning": "Turk is describing a horrific drive by scene where he is going to park in front of your house and light it up with at least 50 bullets.\nIf you don’t get hit, you’re one lucky guy.\n\nIn a creative twist 50 shots of alcohol would probably put you in a coma, leaving you with little or no chance to survive.", "annotation_id": "3300363", "url": "https://genius.com/3300363", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "YNT,", "vault_lines": ["YNT gon’ be there first, y’all niggas thought we was gone?"], "meaning": "Young Turk’s label.", "annotation_id": "3135468", "url": "https://genius.com/3135468", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "What it cost to murk a snitch? Ho, that’s cheap labor", "vault_lines": ["What it cost to murk a snitch? Ho, that’s cheap labor"], "meaning": "A hit costs so little for him that a hitman is akin to a gardener or a factory worker. Snitches need to be dealt with, but Turk considers these sort of things beneath him", "annotation_id": "2271310", "url": "https://genius.com/2271310", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "We gon’ blame it on the system", "vault_lines": ["We gon’ blame it on the system"], "meaning": "This song is on Turk’s album Blame It On The System, which Turk name-drops here.\n\nTurk and Lil Wayne will blame their actions, particularly the illegal ones of dealing drugs and carrying weapons, on the government’s system, which has been accused by many rappers and African American activists of purposely targeting blacks to keep them in poverty through various laws.", "annotation_id": "1896842", "url": "https://genius.com/1896842", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "My bullets fat as a joint", "vault_lines": ["My bullets fat as a joint"], "meaning": "Imagine getting hit with a bullet that fat? (pause no homo, and that shit looks good as hell)\n\nNormally one would compare the joint to the bullet, not the bullet to the joint! Wayne must be smoking some major doobies.", "annotation_id": "1310997", "url": "https://genius.com/1310997", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Your bitch a blowfish, she swallow my fishing pole", "vault_lines": ["Your bitch a blowfish, she swallow my fishing pole"], "meaning": "Really good play on words.\n\n1) During fishing, fish (including blowfish) swallow the bait at the end of the fishing line attached to the pole\n\n2) Your girl gives Wayne a blow job, or oral sex and swallows his penis, which he compare to a fishing pole in length. Also note the play on “blowfish”, as in she gives blow jobs.\n\n\n\nVery clever, Wayne.", "annotation_id": "1310982", "url": "https://genius.com/1310982", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Money tall like Benjamin Franklin on tip-toes", "vault_lines": ["Money tall like Benjamin Franklin on tip-toes"], "meaning": "Although Benjamin Franklin wasn’t particularly very tall (he was supposedly 5 feet and 9 inches in height, or 1.75 meters), he would obviously be taller if he stood on the tips of his toes. Also, Wayne mentions Benjamin Franklin here because his face is on the United States' $100 bill. Wayne’s money is tall because he has lots of $100 bills stacked high. Yeah, Weezy is ballin'.", "annotation_id": "1310980", "url": "https://genius.com/1310980", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Okay I stick to the G code, you stick to the zip code", "vault_lines": ["Okay I stick to the G code, you stick to the zip code"], "meaning": "Gangstas do what gangstas do, Wayne, a self proclaimed gangsta, follows the “G-Code”, or the “gangsta code”, which means he doesn’t stop being gangsta.\n\nThe others, however, only deal with the area in which they live, their “zip code”.\n\nAlso, Wayne is playing off the title of the song and commanding the others to stick to the “zip code”, meaning they should zip it and keep their mouths shut.", "annotation_id": "1310969", "url": "https://genius.com/1310969", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "I’m sitting on the foot off the bed, gun by my feet", "vault_lines": ["I’m sitting on the foot off the bed, gun by my feet"], "meaning": "Even in his own bedroom, Lil Wayne keeps a firearm near him to protect himself in case somebody tries to come into the house and start something.", "annotation_id": "1310961", "url": "https://genius.com/1310961", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Show you what this street shit ’bout You in doubt? We’ll set fire to your house And murder everything running out", "vault_lines": ["Show you what this street shit ’bout"], "meaning": "Turk and Wayne are from the streets (the ghetto), so they have seen and likely experienced violence enough that they accept it, and even participate in it. Because of this, they will not hesitate to burn your house down and kill whoever tries to escape… that’s right, not even grandmas and babies are even safe.", "annotation_id": "1310950", "url": "https://genius.com/1310950", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "You niggas bluffing like snow", "vault_lines": ["You niggas bluffing like snow"], "meaning": "Possibly referring to the Netflix documentary “Snow On Tha Bluff” which is the story of Curtis Snow, a real Atlanta “robbery boy and crack dealer whose livelihood revolves around armed robbery and drug pushing.", "annotation_id": "1308660", "url": "https://genius.com/1308660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "YMCMB", "vault_lines": ["Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth"], "meaning": "Young Money Cash Money Billionaires, the name of the conglomerate of Lil Wayne’s group Young Money Entertainment and Birdman’s label Cash Money Records, of which Young Money Entertainment is an imprint. Turk was formerly signed to Cash Money Records, while Lil Wayne is currently part of Young Money Entertainment and Cash Money Records.", "annotation_id": "1302993", "url": "https://genius.com/1302993", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth Y’all niggas better zip it, better zip your mouth", "vault_lines": ["Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth"], "meaning": "Turk and Lil Wayne are warning those who slander and insult them: if they don’t want to be killed in the sense laid out in the next few lines, they better keep their mouths closed.\n\nTurk could also be threatening snitches to shut their mouths here, as he would not want anybody informing authorities of his illegal actions.", "annotation_id": "1302988", "url": "https://genius.com/1302988", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "Since a pussy got lips, I guess you niggas could speak", "vault_lines": ["Since a pussy got lips, I guess you niggas could speak"], "meaning": "He can’t change the fact that pussies have lips so anyone who is a pussy can talk with “their” lips", "annotation_id": "1302976", "url": "https://genius.com/1302976", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "The dick was too good, the bitch still asleep", "vault_lines": ["The dick was too good, the bitch still asleep"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne recently finished having sex with a female. He apparently sexed her so well that she likely climaxed, or had an orgasm. After orgasms, it is very common for people to fall asleep as a way to regain energy used during the climax. Lil Wayne gave the woman at least one good orgasm, causing her to fall asleep immediately afterward.", "annotation_id": "1302973", "url": "https://genius.com/1302973", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Zip It", "line": "One number, three letters, 9, AK Y’all niggas better zip it like YKK", "vault_lines": ["Y’all niggas better zip it, nigga better zip your mouth"], "meaning": "One of the world’s largest zipper manufacturers. Which can also be found on a Nike jacket. So look on the back of the zipper and it’s there!", "annotation_id": "1292125", "url": "https://genius.com/1292125", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
