{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Your Smile", "line": "Like a desert before the rain My existence feels so in vain", "vault_lines": ["Like a desert before the rain"], "meaning": "A large blast of land that been all but deserted: a desert. Not used for grazing, useless for crops, deserts are nothing but terrestrial obstacles, existing in vain.\n\n\n\nOne that lives as a desert exists is either a drain on others; a pariah, or living a purposeless existence.", "annotation_id": "1956103", "url": "https://genius.com/1956103", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
