{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Playa", "line": "Play with me boy I give you cancer like menthol", "vault_lines": ["Play with me boy I give you cancer like menthol"], "meaning": "Menthol is a synthetic or obtained organic compound from corn mint, peppermint, or other mints oils.  Menthol is commonly found in cigarettes and cigarettes have been linked to lung cancer.\n\n\n\nCancers linked to tobacco make up 40% of cancers diagnosed in the United States.", "annotation_id": "17152810", "url": "https://genius.com/17152810", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Playa", "line": "Plus I got the, boom boom, surround sound Don’t hate on me boy if you do, pow, get down", "vault_lines": ["Don't hate on me boy if you do, pow, get down"], "meaning": "Wayne’s has some good subwoofers in his car, which increase the bass in songs(as seen in the onomatopoeia of “boom boom”). This could also be a double meaning to say he’s got “base” in his car. “Base” is slang for crack which Wayne often talks about selling.\n\n\n\n\n\nDon’t hate on Wayne by the way, if you cause problems then he isn’t afraid to shoot you down whenever he catches you.", "annotation_id": "7771671", "url": "https://genius.com/7771671", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Playa", "line": "I’m a young playa nigga (What)", "vault_lines": ["I'm a young playa nigga (What)"], "meaning": "Tha Block is hot dropped when Wayne was only 17.\n\nWayne’s been rapping since he was 9!", "annotation_id": "3255833", "url": "https://genius.com/3255833", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
