{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Catch a flight to J-ville, can’t miss the Super Bowl", "vault_lines": ["Catch a flight to J-ville, can't miss the Super Bowl"], "meaning": "In 2005, the year of this mixtapes release, the Superbowl was hosted in Jacksonville, Florida.\n\nThe Patriots beat the Eagles 24-21 and Deion Branch won MVP.", "annotation_id": "40833241", "url": "https://genius.com/40833241", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "But no I ain’t Dale, I ain’t tryna hit the wall", "vault_lines": ["But no I ain't Dale, I ain't tryna hit the wall"], "meaning": "Going with the line above, Dale Earnhardt was killed in 2001 during the final lap of a race in a three car collision, hitting the wall head on.", "annotation_id": "40833235", "url": "https://genius.com/40833235", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Better find Noah’s Ark, bout to flood the streets", "vault_lines": ["Better find Noah's Ark, bout to flood the streets"], "meaning": "The Product Saturation Protocol\n\nMack Maine is describing a market saturation protocol. “Flooding the streets” means moving such a massive volume of narcotics into the ecosystem that the supply becomes unavoidable, effectively drowning out the competition.\n\nThe Noah’s Ark reference warns others to find a way to survive the “flood” of product, as he is about to dominate the entire local economy with an overwhelming inventory.", "annotation_id": "39649426", "url": "https://genius.com/39649426", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Leave the scene with out a trace at a Earnhardt pace", "vault_lines": ["Leave the scene with out a trace at a Earnhardt pace"], "meaning": "Think this one says Earnhardt, as in Dale Earnhardt, famous race car driver", "annotation_id": "17439819", "url": "https://genius.com/17439819", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "All over, putting up posters Like you got an album about to drop", "vault_lines": ["All over, putting up posters"], "meaning": "Usually when you wanna promote your album thats about to drop, you put up news about it on billboards, radio shows, tv advertisements, and posters\n\nThe Cops are desperate to find Curren$y and have started putting up posters in hope that someone recognizes him and reports him to them", "annotation_id": "4525230", "url": "https://genius.com/4525230", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Cops tryna send me off to camp like Ernest", "vault_lines": ["Cops tryna send me off to camp like Ernest"], "meaning": "In reference to the 1987 movie, Ernest Goes to Camp. Of course this camp is is indoors and behind bars, no freedom to explore in here.", "annotation_id": "4525214", "url": "https://genius.com/4525214", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Young Ozzy Osbourne floating like the cloud boy", "vault_lines": ["Young Ozzy Osbourne floating like the cloud boy"], "meaning": "Ozzy Osbourne is an extremely famous rock star, known for his insane antics such as biting the head off of a bat.\n\nBy adding this nickname to his huge pool, Wayne illustrates just how crazy and rock-star-esque he really is.\n\nAdding on the previous line about being born in the sky, Tune makes sure we know he’s still high as fuck, as if he were a cloud himself.", "annotation_id": "3040752", "url": "https://genius.com/3040752", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Tryna see red skin", "vault_lines": ["Tryna see red skin"], "meaning": "Redskins were the arch rivals of the cowboys, Lil Wayne plays with that and says he wants to make sure you’re dead by seeing red skin by shooting you with an AR-33 (Tony Dorset).", "annotation_id": "2768123", "url": "https://genius.com/2768123", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "I ain’t got the Emmitt Smith bitch I got the Dorset AR-33 shooting like a Cowboy", "vault_lines": ["I ain't got the Emmitt Smith bitch I got the Dorset"], "meaning": "Tony Dorset is an overlooked runningback sometimes but he is just as good as Emit Smith. Dorset has a superbowl MVP and is a hall of famer but so is Smith. Lil wayne says he has the AR-33 gun like Dorset who wore number 33.", "annotation_id": "2768107", "url": "https://genius.com/2768107", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Property", "line": "Tryna land me a spot at the Roc And my city got word of that Niggas want me to hook them up with Fox", "vault_lines": ["Tryna land me a spot at the Roc"], "meaning": "When everyone found out that Wayne was possibly going to sign with Jay Z, people wanted them to hook them up with Foxy Brown who is affiliated with Jay Z.", "annotation_id": "2768065", "url": "https://genius.com/2768065", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
