{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young Money Hospital", "line": "And I’ma shoot that if I aim this And I ain’t talkin’ ‘bout no motherfuckin’ sidekick", "vault_lines": ["And I'ma shoot that if I aim this"], "meaning": "Referring to the above line’s “AIM this”, he’s not talking about AOL instant messaging on a Sidekick, a popular phone of the past.\n\n\n\nSo he must be talking about a gun!", "annotation_id": "1245160", "url": "https://genius.com/1245160", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
