{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young", "line": "If she ask me for advice and I igged her But she know it wasn’t me, it was the sizzurp", "vault_lines": ["If she ask me for advice and I igged her"], "meaning": "Sizzurp is also known as purple drank or lean. It is a drink made of cough syrup (containing painkiller codeine) and pop soda. Can be used as a drug.\n\nWayne alledges here that it is the workings of the drug lean he’s under the influence of, that will prompt him to blow his girl of when she asks for advice, and thus not him if he were sober\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple_drank", "annotation_id": "16565007", "url": "https://genius.com/16565007", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young", "line": "I sipped a lake of that grape, thirst quencher, oh", "vault_lines": ["I sipped a lake of that grape, thirst quencher, oh"], "meaning": "Wayne refers hear to ‘lean’. A drink made of cough syrup (containing painkiller codeine) and pop soda. Can be used as a drug.\n\nFind out more about lean (i.e. purple drank, sizzurp):\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple_drank\nFind out more about Lil Wayne’s love for the drug:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=daTzPeCOOrs", "annotation_id": "16564893", "url": "https://genius.com/16564893", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
