{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young", "line": "Ayo, Stunna nigga need his money You heard somethin’ Da-Da-Da-Da-Da-Da, ooh", "vault_lines": ["Ayo, Stunna nigga need his money"], "meaning": "Once again, Weezy calls out Birdman, who he used to call “father”, for not giving him his money. This issue has been going on since late 2014, where Wayne decided to sue Birdman and Cash Money Records for not paying him for his music, Tha Carter V specifically.", "annotation_id": "13365864", "url": "https://genius.com/13365864", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Young", "line": "And I lied about my height on Tinder", "vault_lines": ["And I lied about my height on Tinder"], "meaning": "Tinder is an application used for dating and hooking up.\n\nWeezy stands at 5'5\", which is considered below average for a man’s height. A survey showed that women find height range 5'10\" to 6'1\" the most attractive in men.", "annotation_id": "13365737", "url": "https://genius.com/13365737", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
