{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Want War", "line": "Took one to tha chest, I never die, I’m tha same brotha Jump out and shoot K’s, let ’em fly, I’m tha same brotha", "vault_lines": ["Took one to tha chest, I never die, I'm tha same brotha"], "meaning": "Wayne shot himself at the age of 12 accidentally. He is saying that incident hasn’t changed him, he still gets involved with guns.", "annotation_id": "936448", "url": "https://genius.com/936448", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
