{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "Caitlyn Jenner, man, these niggas changin’ faces", "vault_lines": ["Caitlyn Jenner, man, these niggas changin' faces"], "meaning": "Caitlyn Jenner was once Bruce Jenner, a famous Olympian. Jenner underwent a gender transition in April of 2015. Turk uses that transition to call out people around him accuses of being “two-faced.”", "annotation_id": "6769315", "url": "https://genius.com/6769315", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "Hot boy don’t want no problem, I just want my cash", "vault_lines": ["Hot boy don't want no problem, I just want my cash"], "meaning": "Turk also sued Cash Money Records, and specifically label head Birdman, for unpaid royalties. Birdman “didn’t respond in time” and was forced to pay the full amount of $1.3 million.", "annotation_id": "6768797", "url": "https://genius.com/6768797", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
