{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "My niggas move weight like Kelly Clarkson, they awesome Never let the feds get close like a scorpion", "vault_lines": ["My niggas move weight like Kelly Clarkson, they awesome"], "meaning": "Kelly Clarkson put on weight over the last year and was put on blast by a British journalist for her rapid weight gain.\n\n\n\nSimilar to the Oprah interpretation, Wayne’s moving serious amounts of narcotics. Despite this, the police are kept at arms length by Wayne and his crew, in the same way one would treat a Scorpion.", "annotation_id": "6768616", "url": "https://genius.com/6768616", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "I’m in this bitch with Turk, we yellin’, “Free Christopher Dorsey”", "vault_lines": ["I'm in this bitch with Turk, we yellin', \"Free Christopher Dorsey\""], "meaning": "As previously noted, Wayne and Turk used to be part of a rap group The Hot Boys.  Christopher Dorsey aka B.G. was also apart of the group. He is currently serving a 14 year sentence for gun possession and witness tampering.", "annotation_id": "6768588", "url": "https://genius.com/6768588", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "Martian, haters make me nauseous", "vault_lines": ["Martian, haters make me nauseous"], "meaning": "One of the many nicknames Weezy has given himself. He refers to himself as not human.\n\n“We are not the same I am a martian”.", "annotation_id": "6768585", "url": "https://genius.com/6768585", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Mad Yet?", "line": "I’m that hot boy Tunechi, I’m a martian", "vault_lines": ["I'm that hot boy Tunechi, I'm a martian"], "meaning": "When Lil Wayne’s career began, he was part of a rap group known as the Hot Boys.  It featured Wayne, Turk, also featured on this track, as well as B.G. and Juvenile.", "annotation_id": "6768538", "url": "https://genius.com/6768538", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
