{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Know What", "line": "Like Mutombo", "vault_lines": ["Little but he put his thing down like Mutombo"], "meaning": "Dikembe Mutombo was a centre for the Houston Rockets when this song was released. He is best known for his time with the Denver Nuggets. The lyric is saying that he “puts it down” just like him.", "annotation_id": "34122153", "url": "https://genius.com/34122153", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
