{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Know What", "line": "Yeah - fresh off the G-4", "vault_lines": ["Yeah - fresh off the G-4"], "meaning": "G-4 is short for Gulfstream IV, a family of advanced business jet aircraft.\n\n\n\nFresh indeed.", "annotation_id": "3414703", "url": "https://genius.com/3414703", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Know What", "line": "Weezy baby nympho", "vault_lines": ["I, I got somethin to tell ya girl"], "meaning": "Sorry, Wayne. A nymphomaniac is a woman who is addicted to sex. On the other hand, if a little role-play is what you’re hinting at, then I guess you can be a nympho for the night.", "annotation_id": "3414694", "url": "https://genius.com/3414694", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Know What", "line": "It’s hard to keep in touch when you’re off in school But now you’re right here we can do what we do", "vault_lines": ["It's hard to keep in touch when you're off in school"], "meaning": "Avant barely communicates with this girl as she has commitments to attend to and this make it hard for them to talk since she is still in education…\n\nAlso explains the dirty things Avant wants to do to her , he doesn’t get to see her very often.", "annotation_id": "2554153", "url": "https://genius.com/2554153", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
