{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Don’t Know Weezy", "line": "The bigger your mouth, the bigger the hole, yeah", "vault_lines": ["The bigger your mouth, the bigger the hole, yeah"], "meaning": "Double entendre\n\nMeaning 1: The more you open your mouth, the bigger the hole between your lips will be. So, the bigger the mouth, the bigger the hole, literally.\n\nMeaning 2: Someone who has a big mouth is someone who can’t keep a secret and often talks about other people’s business. Here, Wayne is saying that the more you run your mouth, the bigger the hole you get from his bullets will be, because he’ll shoot you with more bullets (or bigger and more powerful bullets) to leave a bigger hole in your body.", "annotation_id": "37103881", "url": "https://genius.com/37103881", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Don’t Know Weezy", "line": "Still rock too much ice, should’ve got you a visor", "vault_lines": ["Still rock too much ice, should've got you a visor"], "meaning": "Maybe a visor would protect you from the blinding light of Wayne’s diamonds.", "annotation_id": "27307173", "url": "https://genius.com/27307173", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Don’t Know Weezy", "line": "Yes, I do, and I do it better than most My competitive drive knock a nigga off the road, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yes, I do, and I do it better than most"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is  one of the most prolific rappers, no doubt. Though some people don’t like some  of his lyrics, he still does it better than most rappers. Remixing your song makes it his, thus his competition drive or urge will lower your confidence, knock you off the road", "annotation_id": "26330465", "url": "https://genius.com/26330465", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
