{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "My money don’t folds nor bends", "vault_lines": ["My money don't folds nor bends"], "meaning": "Could mean that he has a lot of investments in jewelry and not just as cash, which you can fold, or in card, which you can bend.", "annotation_id": "36316499", "url": "https://genius.com/36316499", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "My wrist look like frozen Poland Spring water", "vault_lines": ["My wrist look like frozen Poland Spring water"], "meaning": "Straight up: he’s saying his watch or jewelry is icy clear and flooded with diamonds—like frozen Poland Spring water (which is super clear). Just flexing how clean and expensive his wrist looks. As a Polish Person i dont know a lot bout the “ Poland Spring Water” Brand. As it might be only sold in usa, ive never seen it in Poland", "annotation_id": "35601914", "url": "https://genius.com/35601914", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Fuck your city and your town, I state facts", "vault_lines": ["Fuck your city and your town, I state facts"], "meaning": "Wayne says ‘city and town’ but then uses State to ‘state facts’, playing on the city/town/state flow. Instead of using ‘state’ as one of the 50 states.", "annotation_id": "34534979", "url": "https://genius.com/34534979", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "I stick toothpicks (Where?) in y’all hors d’oeuvres (Listen)", "vault_lines": ["I stick toothpicks (Where?) in y'all hors d'oeuvres (Listen)"], "meaning": "Hors d'oeuvres are appetizers. Most often, appetizers such as shrimp, lobster, pork etc. This line is suggesting that he will stick a toothpick through you like hors d'oevres.\n\n\n\nSticks are also known as guns and, this might be a stretch but I think the toothpicks are the bullets to the (gun) stick and he will stick them through you.", "annotation_id": "24069043", "url": "https://genius.com/24069043", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Loso, street fi-di-di-di-dam (Yes)", "vault_lines": ["Loso, street fi-di-di-di-dam (Yes)"], "meaning": "‘Loso!’ is a nickname fab uses, and “Street” is a reference to his gang, Street Family.", "annotation_id": "24067560", "url": "https://genius.com/24067560", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Octopus (What else?) Oysters (Huh) Chump", "vault_lines": ["Octopus (What else?) Oysters (Huh)"], "meaning": "Both octopuses and oysters are sharks prey, finishing off the previous line and topping it off with “Chump!” which can be:\n\n\nCalling you foolish and a sucker because you’re smaller than him.\nA play on chump and chomp (onomatopoeia used to describe shark bites), sounding similar.", "annotation_id": "24067492", "url": "https://genius.com/24067492", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Kermit, you better think before you ribbit", "vault_lines": ["Kermit, you better think before you ribbit"], "meaning": "Kermit is a frog from the muppets. A Ribbit is a noise a frog makes. Fabolous is saying to think before you speak, but using the frog analogy to match with the previous line.", "annotation_id": "24067343", "url": "https://genius.com/24067343", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Deezle, uh, I’m gettin’ money like a motherfucker", "vault_lines": ["Deezle, uh, I'm gettin' money like a motherfucker"], "meaning": "Deezle is the co-producer for Lil Wayne’s hit single (from this same album) titled ‘Lolipop’.", "annotation_id": "24006558", "url": "https://genius.com/24006558", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "I pop up like Xzibit, but given I’m at your crib, it’s (Yeah, yeah) Not to put no fucking fish tanks in your Civic (Nah) Fuck gettin’ your ride pimped, you’ll get hog-tied, wimp", "vault_lines": ["Not to put no fucking fish tanks in your Civic (Nah)"], "meaning": "Fabolous will pop up at your crib the same way Xzibit would “pop up” to his “customers” on the popular MTV series Pimp My Ride, hence the following line.\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pimp_My_Ride\nIn an episode of Pimp My Ride, they put a fish tank in someone’s civic. Fabolous then proceeds to say “fuck getting your ride pimped” restating for the third time that he pops up like Xzibit, but isn’t Xzibit, and that he will hog-tie\nyou like a wimp.\nhttps://g.co/kgs/u33PT3", "annotation_id": "24006432", "url": "https://genius.com/24006432", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "Weezy, I’m at the top, foot up in your bottom", "vault_lines": ["Weezy, I'm at the top, foot up in your bottom"], "meaning": "I think Wayne said boot up in your bottom representing Louisiana.", "annotation_id": "22183000", "url": "https://genius.com/22183000", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "It’s Weezy F-U, now, you gotta have a baby", "vault_lines": ["It's Weezy F-U, now, you gotta have a baby"], "meaning": "Double entendre:\n\n\nHe says “Weezy F U” to say that he just fucked you, and you’re now more than likely going to get pregnant, so you gotta have a baby.\nSecondly, in a lot of his songs he tells you that if you’re gonna say the Weezy part of his name, you have to say the Baby too, basically saying that you have to say his whole name if you’re gonna say it at all. He even has a song dedicated to this rule. He already said the “Weezy F” for you, so now you need to add the “Baby.”", "annotation_id": "13873518", "url": "https://genius.com/13873518", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "I’m a shark, y’all just koi fish (What else?)", "vault_lines": ["I'm a shark, y'all just koi fish (What else?)"], "meaning": "Koi fish are a small harmless species of fish that are usually used in Koi Ponds as a form of decoration.\n\n\n\nSharks are a much bigger species of fish known for terrorizing the ocean.\n\nInterestingly this is very similar to another line on Lil Wayne’s song “Tha Mobb” which featured on the previous entry of Tha Carter series.\n\nIt’s my ocean baby, y'all niggas is tuna", "annotation_id": "13329759", "url": "https://genius.com/13329759", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "My Little Man is on you, Marlon and Shawn you (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["My Little Man is on you, Marlon and Shawn you (Yeah)"], "meaning": "https://players.brightcove.net/4863540648001/HklmClHkx_default/index.html?videoId=5237852070001", "annotation_id": "1417652", "url": "https://genius.com/1417652", "state": "verified", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "You Ain’t Got Nuthin", "line": "I get money out the ass, that’s some expensive shit (Ew)", "vault_lines": ["I get money out the ass, that's some expensive shit (Ew)"], "meaning": "https://players.brightcove.net/4863540648001/HklmClHkx_default/index.html?videoId=5237850069001", "annotation_id": "1409059", "url": "https://genius.com/1409059", "state": "verified", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
