{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yes", "line": "Type of nigga go and get his hood ’cross his abdominal", "vault_lines": ["Type of nigga go and get his hood 'cross his abdominal"], "meaning": "According to this page about Wayne’s tats, the 17 on his tummy is “for his hometown 17th Ward Of New Orleans”.\n\n\n\n“Type of” can be heard as “Typo”, which the previous line is sort of like.", "annotation_id": "26799418", "url": "https://genius.com/26799418", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yes", "line": "New Orleans baller—ask ESPN", "vault_lines": ["New Orleans baller—ask ESPN"], "meaning": "ESPN sometimes plays basketball on its TV channel. New Orleans has a basketball team in the pro leagues called the Pelicans, and Lil Wayne is from New Orleans.\n\nBalling is hip-hop slang for spending a lot of money, so he’s saying he has a lot of money.", "annotation_id": "17223891", "url": "https://genius.com/17223891", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yes", "line": "All my niggas scaring you, all your niggas scarier Scarier than a cat in a cage with a terrier Pet cemetery—Wayne, are you the veterinarian?", "vault_lines": ["All my niggas scaring you, all your niggas scarier"], "meaning": "This is a reference to a number of things:\n1, Stephen King’s masterful novel ‘Pet Sematary’ where an ancient Micmac burial ground has powers to resurrect humans and animals from death. Yet they come back possessed by demons and have seen Hell.\n2, Dr. Carter, a popular Lil ‘Weezy’ Wayne song where he calls himself a doctor and cures poor rappers from their ‘Wackidiness’.", "annotation_id": "15906139", "url": "https://genius.com/15906139", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yes", "line": "Riding by myself in that all-red Enzo Smoke make it look like I got tinted windows", "vault_lines": ["Riding by myself in that all-red Enzo"], "meaning": "The Enzo Ferrari, also sometimes known as the Ferrari Enzo, is a car made by Ferrari produced from 2003 to 2004. Buying one could cost over $700,000 when they were being produced and as of 2018 buying one used can range from $1,500,000 to $3,500,000.", "annotation_id": "15776567", "url": "https://genius.com/15776567", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yes", "line": "Camo shorts, no socks, with the red Bapes Walk into my closet, fuck around and get a headache", "vault_lines": ["Camo shorts, no socks, with the red Bapes"], "meaning": "Since Wayne is affiliated with the bloods, his wardrobe is filled with the color red to rep his gang.\n\n\n\nRed is a bright color and more light is reflected by bright colors, resulting in excessive stimulation of the eyes which can induce headaches, so Weezy is warning you that just by walking into his closet you can get a headache.", "annotation_id": "3998138", "url": "https://genius.com/3998138", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
