{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yellow Tape", "line": "Call me Joey I’m a Bada$$,", "vault_lines": ["Call me Joey I'm a Bada$$,"], "meaning": "A$AP Rocky references famous Harlem MC Joey Bada$$, who he is famously friends with. The two rappers proudly come from New York City, which Rocky likens to a war zone due to the high crime rate and difficult living situations.\n\nRocky has alluded to Harlem as the dangerous Iraqi City before, perhaps most notably on his track, “Multiply”:\n\nminute\nCome to Harlem if you never seen Baghdad\nFirst place I seen a nigga sell crack at\nWhere the hustlers don’t sleep, take cat naps\n\n  \n\n\nAs of 2019, the two rappers have collaborated three times, on 2011’s “1Train,” 2017’s “What Happens,” and 2019’s “Too Many Gods.”", "annotation_id": "17648737", "url": "https://genius.com/17648737", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yellow Tape", "line": "Coke Boy", "vault_lines": ["Work, I got it... I got it, WHOOOO..."], "meaning": "French Montana is the founder of Coke Boys Records, and its predecessor, Cocaine City Records. His 2010 mixtape was also called Coke Boys.", "annotation_id": "13175497", "url": "https://genius.com/13175497", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yellow Tape", "line": "Copped work from Saint Nick (haah)", "vault_lines": ["Copped work from Saint Nick (haah)"], "meaning": "Saint Nicholas Avenue is a street in NYC which runs through Washington Heights, Harlem and Inwood.\n\nAsap Rocky who is also on this track happens to come from there.\n\nSaint Nicholas (Santa Clause) would be doing his work in the snow. The work that he copped was probably cocaine, which is also called snow.", "annotation_id": "1543582", "url": "https://genius.com/1543582", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
