{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yellow Tape", "line": "I’ll be there, Five Jacksons", "vault_lines": ["Wrote the dope had my dough, I'll be there, Five Jacksons"], "meaning": "Obviously a reference to these guys.\n\nBut he is also using a play on words with the $20 dollar bill. 5 Andrew Jacksons = 100 dollars (100 is a slang term for good bye), He’ll be there to get what he gets then he’s gone.", "annotation_id": "1178391", "url": "https://genius.com/1178391", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yellow Tape", "line": "Got eight chicks on eight molly’s and they about to take eight trips", "vault_lines": ["Got eight chicks on eight molly's and they about to take eight trips"], "meaning": "Molly is the slang term for the purest form of ecstasy, MDMA\n\nWhen you take certain drugs, you go on “trips” , which is the experience of being high.", "annotation_id": "1178389", "url": "https://genius.com/1178389", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
