{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "I Run DMC’s in this bitch in my Adidas", "vault_lines": ["I Run DMC’s in this bitch in my Adidas"], "meaning": "Run-DMC were a popular rap group consisting of Run, DMC and Jam-Master Jay. One of their hit singles was a song called “My Adidas”. They were also well known for wearing Adidas clothing.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dA8DsUN6g_k", "annotation_id": "804969", "url": "https://genius.com/804969", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "I stepped out the Rolls, my game rose like Easter", "vault_lines": ["I stepped out the Rolls, my game rose like Easter"], "meaning": "Easter celebrates the day Jesus rose from the dead. so, david banner is saying that as soon as he steps out of such a vehicle as fly as a Rolls Royce, his game rises like Jesus from the dead.\n\nNote the sound similarity between Rose and Royce.", "annotation_id": "799976", "url": "https://genius.com/799976", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "And bitch, I’m tall as Yao Ming And bitch, I’m tall as Yao Ming Look at my daddy, look at my daddy Look at my daddy, look at my daddy, Yao Ming Look at my daddy, look at my daddy Look at my daddy, look at my daddy", "vault_lines": ["And bitch, I’m tall as Yao Ming"], "meaning": "Yao Ming is a retired NBA player who, while he was active, was the tallest player in the entire league, at 2.29 m (7 ft 6 in). He remains tied for the fourth tallest NBA player of all time.\n\nIn this song they relay the message that Yao Ming has a similarity of “All big everything” with an exaggerated pride and confidence – Their money, their spending, their bitches, their social status, their drug consumption (“I’m so high I won’t come down”), their fame… might even be talking about they’re dicks (“Look at my daddy, And bitch I’m tall as Yao Ming”)", "annotation_id": "540358", "url": "https://genius.com/540358", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "Life a beach, I done danced with her, all up in the sand with her", "vault_lines": ["Life a beach, I done danced with her, all up in the sand with her"], "meaning": "Tweaking the proverbial statement from Nas' “Life’s A Bitch”\n\n2-Chainz is more carefree about life, dancing with sweet honeys in the sand.", "annotation_id": "540351", "url": "https://genius.com/540351", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "Bitch, Cash Money is a army, hoorah", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, Cash Money is a army, hoorah"], "meaning": "Hooah is a spirited cry common to the Army.  It is most commonly used as an acknowledgement to a response.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obeP6D3wZjE", "annotation_id": "507900", "url": "https://genius.com/507900", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Yao Ming", "line": "I’m forever young, forever Young Mula", "vault_lines": ["I’m forever young, forever Young Mula"], "meaning": "Shout out to Alphaville, and their song forever young. http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RHIIATt0BaM\n He also shouts out his record company, Young Money.", "annotation_id": "507889", "url": "https://genius.com/507889", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
