{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ya Heard Me", "line": "N.O. on my fitted, committed to my city Anything I will commit it, just to show that I’m committed", "vault_lines": ["N.O. on my fitted, committed to my city"], "meaning": "Wayne is very committed to his city – New Orleans. After Katrina hurricane he helped rebuild a park that was damaged by donating 200,000$. He is also involved every year by giving out turkeys for Thanksgiving in N.O..\n\nHere is a list of all good deeds by Lil Wayne, many of them are for his city:\nhttps://www.lilwaynehq.com/good-deeds/", "annotation_id": "14588786", "url": "https://genius.com/14588786", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
