{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "I get loaded til I motherfucking overload", "vault_lines": ["I get loaded til I motherfucking overload"], "meaning": "Weezy gets fucked up (codeine, marijuana, alcohol, etc.) and the only thing that could stop him is something drastic, such as having a seizure.\n\n\n\nNotice how Wayne uses compound words in succession: mother-fucking and over-load. He could have very easily left the mother out but to add emphases to the fact that he just added a word to the direct object, loaded.\n\nSome grammar lessons for you boys", "annotation_id": "2668292", "url": "https://genius.com/2668292", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "Keep em floating like both of the levees breached", "vault_lines": ["Keep em floating like both of the levees breached"], "meaning": "After the levees in New Orleans were breached during Hurricane Katrina, there was a lot of shit floating in the water. Thugga keeps dope and ex floating like that.", "annotation_id": "2024854", "url": "https://genius.com/2024854", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "Call me Mr. Still Smoking, smoke it in a paper", "vault_lines": ["Call me Mr. Still Smoking, smoke it in a paper"], "meaning": "‘Still Smokin’ is the name of the mixtape of his group “The Flamez” He’s the main artist of the clique.\n\n\n\nSince Flow is “Mr. Still Smoking”, I guess he though he should share with us what his preferred method of smoking is, and it turns out it’s joints (paper).", "annotation_id": "422037", "url": "https://genius.com/422037", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "They back it up like Sonny drive in Bronx Tale, Calogero", "vault_lines": ["They back it up like Sonny drive in Bronx Tale, Calogero"], "meaning": "A Bronx Tale is a movie starring and directed by Robert DeNiro. The main character in the movie, Robert DeNiro’s character’s son, is named Calogero.\n\nThere is a scene in the movie where a character named Sonny, played by Chazz Palminteri, drives his car completely in reverse for several blocks to get to his destination. Hence, they back it up like Sonny drives.\n\n\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5mLqshL0WEk", "annotation_id": "279228", "url": "https://genius.com/279228", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
