{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "Kill a nigga, have him thinking that he planking", "vault_lines": ["Kill a nigga, have him thinking that he planking"], "meaning": "“Planking” is a fad where someone mimics a plank by laying flat on their stomach, putting thei rhands on their side, and most likely in an unusual place.\n\n\n\nFlow will kill someone but no one will think they’re dead, they’ll think their just planking!", "annotation_id": "278264", "url": "https://genius.com/278264", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "I got ten up on my pinky ring and twenty on my bracelet", "vault_lines": ["I got ten up on my pinky ring and twenty on my bracelet"], "meaning": "10 and 20 carats, can refer to the mass of a gemstone or pearl or purity of gold. Used here to reference the purity of gold most likely.", "annotation_id": "276975", "url": "https://genius.com/276975", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "Sitting back strapped, cocked Plotting on your man next Jack a nigga for his work", "vault_lines": ["Sitting back strapped, cocked"], "meaning": "Being “strapped” refers to having a gun on oneself, and “cocked” refers to it being loaded.\n\n\n\n“Plotting”, would refer to planning to do something to someone, since Thugga follows up with saying “Jack a nigga for his work”, that means he’s setting up a robbery, most likely for another man’s drugs (work).", "annotation_id": "276949", "url": "https://genius.com/276949", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YM Inkredible", "line": "Bitch, I’m a Ninth Ward nigga", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm a Ninth Ward nigga"], "meaning": "Geographically, “9th Ward” refers to the largest of the 17 Wards of New Orleans, Louisiana. The wards are divided into precints used for voting elections.\n\n\n\nPicture of the Ninth Ward", "annotation_id": "276924", "url": "https://genius.com/276924", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
