{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "YFS (Young, Fresh, Shameless)", "line": "I stay armed like a cowboy Troy Aikman", "vault_lines": ["I stay armed like a cowboy"], "meaning": "Back in the good old dueling days all cowboys were strapped, both in the saloons and on their horses. You never knew when you’d happen upon a damsel in distress or a wild Indian scalping the local butcher and need to save the day.\n\nTroy Aikman is a former 3X Super Bowl champion Dallas Cowboys' quarterback. He played all throughout the 90’s and was elected into the Pro Football Hall of Fame in 2006.\nWith Wayne being from the south he grew up hearing all about Troy Aikman. It’s no surprise Wayne is using another sports reference…we all know he’s a sports addict!", "annotation_id": "12750303", "url": "https://genius.com/12750303", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
