{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "[Chorus: Lil Wayne] I ain’t gotta say this all the time, nigga They know I’m the greatest of all time, nigga, yeah So fuck that nigga if I ain’t that nigga, uh So fuck that nigga if I ain’t that nigga, uh If you love that nigga, better blame that nigga, uh I’m up there, nigga, where you ain’t at, nigga, yeah Fuck that nigga if I ain’t that nigga, girl Don’t fuck that nigga if I ain’t that nigga She say, “Wayne that nigga”", "vault_lines": ["I ain't gotta say this all the time, nigga"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne after nearly 30 years in the game, 9 platinum albums, over 35 platinum hits and 5 Grammy wins, he believes he’s the greatest to ever touch a mic.\n\nNot to mention, his influence over hiphop over the last two decades, whether it be in fashion or music. He’s influenced artists ranging from Kendrick Lamar, Drake, Future, Playboi Carti, Young Thug and others, who have in turn also influenced other artists.\n\nWayne also tells one of his women to not sleep with any other man, due to the other man not being in as high of a position of him or having as much money or influence.", "annotation_id": "35838354", "url": "https://genius.com/35838354", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Big time, nigga, no tick-tock, just bombs, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Big time, nigga, no tick-tock, just bombs, nigga"], "meaning": "If Wayne is gonna come at you, he’s going instant, no build-up, no tick-tock, no nothing. Just straight murder!", "annotation_id": "35824258", "url": "https://genius.com/35824258", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "You could get the shady .45, nigga", "vault_lines": ["You could get the shady .45, nigga"], "meaning": "Double entendre here. On one level, “.45” refers to a .45 caliber handgun. Additionally, “Shady 45” is a nod to Eminem’s SiriusXM radio station, Shade 45, which is named after Eminem’s alter ego, Slim Shady.", "annotation_id": "35821618", "url": "https://genius.com/35821618", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "This is not a bakery, don’t ask me for no cake and shut your pie hole", "vault_lines": ["This is not a bakery, don't ask me for no cake and shut your pie hole"], "meaning": "Wayne uses one of the many slangs for money (“cake”), and follows up using a metaphor for mouth (“pie hole”).\n\nCakes and pies are extremely common to find at bakeries.", "annotation_id": "35819751", "url": "https://genius.com/35819751", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
