{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Homey box office, HBO, cable, nigga I’m unstable, nigga, at the dinner table, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Homey box office, HBO, cable, nigga"], "meaning": "Here, Lil Wayne is referencing the box office, as he has starred in a few movies himself, such as “Hurricane Season” and “Who’s Your Caddy?”\n\nHe also drops a reference to the cult classic TV show “The Sopranos” which aired on HBO from 1999 to 2007. Weezy compares himself to the main character Tony Soprano, who often got angry at the dinner table, whether it was because of his family or his line of work\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/b566ea443f321e78bd5cdfb37a51ea425b1c6e13f78d6052267ff4ba3459f5ba%2F4cx63ez8khd", "annotation_id": "35819604", "url": "https://genius.com/35819604", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Eat the cake, never beat a woman for Ms. Cita’s sake", "vault_lines": ["Eat the cake, never beat a woman for Ms. Cita's sake"], "meaning": "Ms. Cita is Lil Wayne’s mother, and he has consistently expressed his deep, loving relationship with her.\n\nEarlier in the album, on “Maria,” he rapped, “My daddy a heathen, he beat on my mama.”", "annotation_id": "35819122", "url": "https://genius.com/35819122", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "All I eat is rappers, I might have to Flavor Flav a nigga", "vault_lines": ["All I eat is rappers, I might have to Flavor Flav a nigga"], "meaning": "Wayne’s playing directly off the “eating” imagery, using the name “Flavor Flav” implying he’d add his own unique “flavor” or spice to another rapper.", "annotation_id": "35819116", "url": "https://genius.com/35819116", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Look in the mirror and say “Carter” six times, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Look in the mirror and say \"Carter\" six times, nigga"], "meaning": "Likely in reference to the Bloody Mary legend. Presumably, in this case summoning Lil Wayne.\n\nAlso may be a shot at Kendrick Lamar, who refers to himself as the boogeyman and even called himself the Candyman on 2017’s, ELEMENT.\n\n‘'Just say his name, and I promise that you’ll see candyman’'\n\nWayne and Kendrick have a complicated relationship. While the two collaborated in 2014 for Mona Lisa (which would drop in 2018 on Carter 5), they’ve been on shaky terms since Kendrick was chosen to perform at the Superbowl halftime show this year. Kendrick also infamously beefed with Lil Wayne’s close friend and former labelmate Drake, so it makes sense why he wouldn’t be so happy with him.", "annotation_id": "35814797", "url": "https://genius.com/35814797", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Bust a nigga grape like I’m a wino", "vault_lines": ["Bust a nigga grape like I'm a wino"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne delivers the line: “Bust a nigga grape like I’m a wine-o,” employing a layered wordplay centered around the term “wine-o.” The phrase cleverly intertwines multiple meanings:\n\n“Wine” is derived from grapes, making “busting a grape” a vivid metaphor for violence.\n“Wino” (phonetically identical to “wine-o”) is slang for someone who excessively drinks alcohol, often wine.\nAdditionally, the “grape” itself, being round, visually mirrors the letter “O” in “wine-o,” adding a subtle visual pun to the wordplay.\nThis line blends imagery, phonetics, and street vernacular to deliver a compact and impactful metaphor with both humor and aggression.", "annotation_id": "35811216", "url": "https://genius.com/35811216", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
