{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "[Intro: Muhammad Ali] And I’m better now than I was when you saw that twenty-two-year-old undeveloped kid runnin’ from Sonny Liston I’m experienced now, professional, jaw’s been broke, been lost Knocked down a couple times, bad Been choppin’ trees, I done somethin’ new for this fight I done wrastled with an alligator, that’s right I have wrastled with an alligator, I done tussled with a whale I done handcuffed lightnin’, throwed thunder in jail, that’s bad Bad dude, bad, fast, fast I know you got him picked, but the man’s in trouble I’ma show you how great I am", "vault_lines": ["I'ma show you how great I am"], "meaning": "This sample of former professional boxer Muhammad Ali is from a speech from the New York Waldorf Astoria Hotel in September 1974. It was spoken before fighting Sonny Liston for the second time.", "annotation_id": "35810241", "url": "https://genius.com/35810241", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Written History", "line": "Great like Nick Saban, Roll Tide, nigga I’m like Coach Prime, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Great like Nick Saban, Roll Tide, nigga"], "meaning": "Weezy references two famous college football coaches; Nick Saban who most notably coached the Alabama Crimson Tide from 2007 – 2023, and former NFL superstar turned coach Deion “Coach Prime” Sanders who currently coaches the Colorado Buffaloes.", "annotation_id": "35810118", "url": "https://genius.com/35810118", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
