{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wowzers", "line": "I French kiss that pussy, like muah", "vault_lines": ["I French kiss that pussy, like muah"], "meaning": "“Muah!” is a double-entendre, first illustrating Wayne’s kissing and, second, emphasizing Wayne’s pride in performing oral sex.\n\nIn English, “Muah!” is an onomatopoeia representing the sound of a kiss. A kiss resulting in a “muah” sound is far more vigorous and intense than a smooch, or light kiss.\n\nIn French, “Moi” means “Me.” Wayne is emphasizing that he is French kissing that pussy, and demonstrating his pride in doing so:\n\n“I French kiss that pussy—[Me!]”", "annotation_id": "37078442", "url": "https://genius.com/37078442", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wowzers", "line": "I hope that pussy warmer than luke and sweet as Godiva", "vault_lines": ["I hope that pussy warmer than luke and sweet as Godiva"], "meaning": "Wayne is using two analogies here to describe the qualities he wants pussy to have. Lukewarm is a common term meaning slightly warm, and Godiva is a brand of luxury chocolates. Wayne hopes for the pussy to be very warm, not just slightly, and he wants it to as sweet as fancy chocolates.", "annotation_id": "21173673", "url": "https://genius.com/21173673", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wowzers", "line": "Before I eat that pussy, I say my grace", "vault_lines": ["Before I eat that pussy, I say my grace"], "meaning": "Saying grace is a Christian tradition of praying and expressing gratitude before eating a meal. Lil Wayne is making a joke that he will treat eating pussy like an actual meal by saying his grace before beginning.", "annotation_id": "21173651", "url": "https://genius.com/21173651", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
