{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wowzers", "line": "Got a sweet tooth, candy-yam pussy", "vault_lines": ["Got a sweet tooth, candy-yam pussy"], "meaning": "The expression sweet tooth is used to describe one who has a strong liking or a craving for sweets, while candied yams are a traditional Thanksgiving side dish in the South of the U.S, especially in Mississippi and Louisiana.\n\n\n\nSo, if the pussy is made of candied yam and Weezy has a sweet tooth, guess what is going to happen to the pussy.", "annotation_id": "3230726", "url": "https://genius.com/3230726", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wowzers", "line": "She say “Tunechi go slower” and Tunechi went faster", "vault_lines": ["She say \"Tunechi go slower\" and Tunechi went faster"], "meaning": "Tunechi is Lil Wayne’s twitter name.  Also, while having sex, the girl is asking for Wayne to slow down while Wayne is speeding up to  get an orgasm and finish.\n\nFun Fact:\nLil Wayne got the name Tunechi from\n\nMy nickname is Lil Tune — my grandmother named me that. She’s passed. My grandmother, her name was Mercedes Carter. She named me Lil Tune. We just threw the ‘Chi’ on there. Like Gucci, I say ‘Tunechi!’", "annotation_id": "1629993", "url": "https://genius.com/1629993", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
