{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "I got my 3-5-7 and my 501's In a Lear 55 wit my Air Force Ones", "vault_lines": ["I got my 3-5-7 and my 501's"], "meaning": "Yo Gotti keeps:\n\n\n\nPistols- .357 Magnum\n\nFresh Jeans – Levi’s 501’s\n\n\nA Private Jet – Learjet 55\n\n\nFresh Sneakers – Air Force Ones\n\n\n\n\nWordplay!\n\n\nConstant use of numbers: 357, 501, 55, and 1.\nReferences a ‘plane’ and shoes named after the president of the United States' plane.", "annotation_id": "2680770", "url": "https://genius.com/2680770", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "Women lie, men lie, women lie, men lie (Lie, lie) Women lie, men lie, numbers don’t lie", "vault_lines": ["Women lie, men lie, women lie, men lie (Lie, lie)"], "meaning": "An idiom that:\n\n\nQuestions human nature by admitting that everyone lies.\nSets men and women as equals, at least morally.\nStates the accuracy of numbers and stats.\nAnd of course….. let’s Yo Gotti and Weezy brag.\n\n\n\nCelebrity Net Worth states Gotti’s net worth is a hefty $1.5Million (that excludes nontaxable income.\n\nThe same source states Lil Tunechi’s at a staggering $135Million.", "annotation_id": "2680706", "url": "https://genius.com/2680706", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "I be sipping on Patron when I’m jumping out Ferrari’s I be rocking Gucci, sometimes Louis, I’m retarded And the rims by Asanti, but the shades by Bulgari", "vault_lines": ["I be sipping on Patron when I'm jumping out Ferrari's"], "meaning": "Some fine luxury brand-name braggadocio by ya'boy Yo Gotti:\n\n Patron – Tequila\n\n Ferrari – Car\n\n Gucci – Clothing (among other things)\n\n Louis Vuitton – Clothing (among other things)\n\n Asanti – Wheels\n\n Bulgari – Watches", "annotation_id": "2680671", "url": "https://genius.com/2680671", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "And a 5 star wit me and I met her in the lobby", "vault_lines": ["And a 5 star wit me and I met her in the lobby"], "meaning": "Gotti picks the finest females up effortlessly. This is displayed by the fact that he just got one on his way out of the club.\n\nThis line also references his song “5 Star Chick”.", "annotation_id": "2680630", "url": "https://genius.com/2680630", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "Zip code on my wrist, phone number in the bank", "vault_lines": ["Zip code on my wrist, phone number in the bank"], "meaning": "Yo Gotti uses different numbers to describe how much money he has.\n\nZip Codes have 5 digits, meaning Gotti spends anywhere from $10,000-$99,999 on his watches/bracelets.\n\nPhone numbers in the US generally have 10 digits, 7 if you don’t count the area code.\n\nBy bank he means “total income”, not literally in the bank: He’s a drug dealer.\n\nIt’s more likely that he has under $10million (7 digits), but there’s no proof that he doesn’t have $100million+ (10 digits) since most of his money comes from selling drugs and he doesn’t have to pay taxes on that income.", "annotation_id": "2615090", "url": "https://genius.com/2615090", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Women Lie, Men Lie", "line": "Got the swagger through the roof, I was born just to flex", "vault_lines": ["Got the swagger through the roof, I was born just to flex"], "meaning": "Flex is another word to show off", "annotation_id": "1237174", "url": "https://genius.com/1237174", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
