{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "With You", "line": "And with her brain she should make the honor roll", "vault_lines": ["And with her brain she should make the honor roll"], "meaning": "Another in a long line of Weezy wordplay on “brain,” which is slang for fellatio. Wayne is extolling his girl’s skill at giving head, not her “book smarts.”\n\nShe give me good brain like she studied at Cambridge\n- “Ice Cream,” No Ceilings", "annotation_id": "14274016", "url": "https://genius.com/14274016", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "With You", "line": "Ms. Cita, I took your advice", "vault_lines": ["Ms. Cita, I took your advice"], "meaning": "“Cita” is Wayne’s nickname for his mother.\n\nHe mentions her on “Playing With Fire”:\n\nMomma named Cita, I love you Cita\n‘Member when your pussy second husband tried to beat ya?\nRemember when I went into the kitchen, got the cleaver?\nHe ain’t give a fuck, I ain’t give a fuck neither\nHe could see the devil, see the devil in my features\nHe could smell the ether, you can see Cita\nYou can see the Cita, see the Cita in my features\nAnd she don’t play neither\n\nOn “Momma Taught Me” he raps:\n\nMomma gave me the swag, I walk like the President\nTalk about only dead presidents and big settlements\n…\nMomma ain’t teach me no better but to get this cheddar\nAnd that I do and for it I get at you", "annotation_id": "13503938", "url": "https://genius.com/13503938", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "With You", "line": "See you with your girls, they probably telling you that he ain’t right Bet they be the same bitches at the wedding throwing rice", "vault_lines": ["See you with your girls, they probably telling you that he ain't right"], "meaning": "Weezy thinks this girl’s friends are telling her that he’s not the right one. Despite this, Wayne bets these same friends will be throwing rice at their wedding.\n\nPelting newlyweds with uncooked starchy vegetables is a time-honored tradition meant to shower the new couple with prosperity, fertility and, of course, good fortune.", "annotation_id": "13503917", "url": "https://genius.com/13503917", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "With You", "line": "She got Indian in her family, Seminole", "vault_lines": ["She got Indian in her family, Seminole"], "meaning": "The Seminoles are a Native American Tribe that originated from Florida (and hence the Florida State University mascot\n\n\n\nWeezy may be indicating that the girl has a Redbonish look to her (which he really likes)", "annotation_id": "40493", "url": "https://genius.com/40493", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
