{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wit My Left", "line": "Seen more white girl than bourbon", "vault_lines": [", seen more white girl than bourbon"], "meaning": "“White girl” is a slang term for white cocaine. Wayne also has this user-favorite in stock, and he has a large amount of it, because he sees more white cocaine than a white American woman sees bourbon whiskey.", "annotation_id": "33664867", "url": "https://genius.com/33664867", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wit My Left", "line": "I seen more sand than turbans", "vault_lines": ["I seen more sand than turbans"], "meaning": "“Sand” is another slang term for brown cocaine. Wayne thinks you haven’t gotten the message yet—he has a TON of it, because he sees more brown cocaine than a turban sees sand.\n\nA turban is a religious and cultural headwear which Americans usually associate with the peoples of the Middle East, a desert region.", "annotation_id": "33664846", "url": "https://genius.com/33664846", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wit My Left", "line": "We got more tan than surfers", "vault_lines": ["We got more tan than surfers"], "meaning": "“Tan” is a slang term for brown cocaine. Wayne apparently has a ton of it, because he has more brown cocaine than a surfer has tan on his skin.", "annotation_id": "33664806", "url": "https://genius.com/33664806", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wit My Left", "line": "Only the money is verbal", "vault_lines": [", only the money is verbal"], "meaning": "Wayne is saying that “money talks,” while words from people are oftentimes empty and worthless to the extent that “only the money is verbal.”", "annotation_id": "33664800", "url": "https://genius.com/33664800", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wit My Left", "line": "Red syrup, that’s not gon’ help ’Cause I need that yurple", "vault_lines": ["'Cause I need that yurple"], "meaning": "Red lean, which is created using the Hi-Tech brand of promethazine and codeine prescription cough syrup, is viewed by users as lesser-quality than purple lean, which is created using the Wockhardt brand of the same concoction.", "annotation_id": "33664781", "url": "https://genius.com/33664781", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
