{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "Well, since you act like a dog, I’ma fuck you like one", "vault_lines": ["Well, since you act like a dog, I'ma fuck you like one"], "meaning": "This line goes with the line before when he says “then she stuck out her tongue”. Dogs stick out their tongue repeatedly throughout the day. Since she is acting like a dog by sticking out her tongue, he is going to treat her like one by fucking her doggy style\n\n\n\nA female dog can also be referred to as a bitch, so if Wayne’s girl is acting like a dog, then that means she’s acting like a bitch.", "annotation_id": "1276401", "url": "https://genius.com/1276401", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "I see you niggas hatin’, with ya hatin’ ass", "vault_lines": ["I see you niggas hatin', with ya hatin' ass"], "meaning": "This is an alteration on a similar line from his song “John” which was also borrowed from Young Jeezy in his song “And Then What”. In this line, he’s simply saying that he’s aware of Pusha T (or anyone else hating) hating on him… with his hating ass.", "annotation_id": "1060029", "url": "https://genius.com/1060029", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "Yellowbone pussy, uh, lemon squeeze", "vault_lines": ["Yellowbone pussy, uh, lemon squeeze"], "meaning": "A Yellow Bone is the lightest type of light skinned black female. They can often be very rare to see in comparison to other blacks because there are not as many of them in the general black population. “Lemon squeeze”, hes reffering to the yellow in “Yellowbone”, and hes squeezing her pussy.", "annotation_id": "1043173", "url": "https://genius.com/1043173", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "These niggas must be nuts, I castrate these niggas (pause)", "vault_lines": ["These niggas must be nuts, I castrate these niggas (pause)"], "meaning": "Castration is a surgical process usually used on animals to remove their testes. He claims the others niggas are nuts so he’ll have to chop em!\n\nWayne realises this line could be misinterpreted, so he throws in a pause as a way of acknowledging the innuendo.", "annotation_id": "1042553", "url": "https://genius.com/1042553", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "I like her pussy tighter than my fucking schedule", "vault_lines": ["I like her pussy tighter than my fucking schedule"], "meaning": "Referring to how busy he is balancing life, business, rap and skateboarding! But, it could also mean that he is referring to his “fucking(verb) schedule” as in his schedule of the women he is going to have sex with, who are presumably tight.", "annotation_id": "1042546", "url": "https://genius.com/1042546", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wish You Would (Dedication 4)", "line": "We on that good, nigga, we ain’t no G.O.O.D niggas You niggas stand under me, understood, nigga?", "vault_lines": ["We on that good, nigga, we ain't no G.O.O.D niggas"], "meaning": "Pusha T(Of G.O.O.D. Music) recently came at the YMCMB Crew with his song “Exodus 23:1”, and Lil Wayne replied with “Goulish”. Now he is saying “we a'int no G.O.O.D. niggas” dissing them back again and saying they are below him.", "annotation_id": "1042539", "url": "https://genius.com/1042539", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
