{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wild Dogs", "line": "I’ma bust down the Perpetual Look at it too hard, it’s gon’ bust your retina With diamonds that’s covered like eczema", "vault_lines": ["With diamonds that's covered like eczema"], "meaning": "Wayne is saying he will take a Rolex Oyester perpetual. Bust it down, meaning cover it in diamonds akin to the skin condition Eczema, the quality of which will be so high that looking at it too hard may cause blindness.", "annotation_id": "18978658", "url": "https://genius.com/18978658", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
