{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wild Dogs", "line": "Shoot out like cowboys, Dak Prescott, boy", "vault_lines": ["Shoot out like cowboys, Dak Prescott, boy"], "meaning": "Here Wayne plays on the term cowboy to mean both the literal cowboys of the Wild West and the Dallas Cowboys football team, which Dak Prescott plays for.", "annotation_id": "18956557", "url": "https://genius.com/18956557", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wild Dogs", "line": "We gon’ go hard just like DMX and them (Ruff)", "vault_lines": ["We gon' go hard just like DMX and them (Ruff)"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the DMX song We go hard, which has the hook start with DMX rapping\n\nUhh, we go hard!\n\nDMX’s signature adlibs are barking and growling, which connects to the dog theme of this chorus.\n\nThe ad-lib is an homage to DMX’s signature ad-libs which include frequent barking and growling. The dog imagery also pays regard to the cover of that album that the aforementioned DMX song is on, titled Grand Champ and released in 2003.", "annotation_id": "18955636", "url": "https://genius.com/18955636", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wild Dogs", "line": "With diamonds that’s covered like eczema", "vault_lines": ["With diamonds that's covered like eczema"], "meaning": "Eczema is a skin condition that covers the top layer of the skin and results in itching and scratching. https://g.co/kgs/7Rxaqw\nLil Wayne states the diamonds are covering himself, using eczema as an adjective to describe the amount of diamonds on his body. Another option is that the diamonds are covering his Tesla.", "annotation_id": "18953821", "url": "https://genius.com/18953821", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wild Dogs", "line": "Bitch, I’m... Bitch, I’ma ball and dunk on whoever Bitch, I’m, bitch, I’ma ball and... Bitch, I’ma ball and dunk on whoever I feel just like Russell Westbrook Bitch, I’ma ball and dunk on whoever I feel just like Russell Westbrook", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'ma ball and dunk on whoever"], "meaning": "Russell Westbrook is an NBA player who, at the time of this track’s release, plays for the Houston Rockets. He is best known for his 11-year tenure on the Oklahoma City Thunder, where he broke the record for triple-doubles in a season and was a NBA All-Star eight times.\n\nA “dunk” in basketball is a highly-athletic play where a player jumps and slams the ball through the rim to score. “Dunking on someone” is considered embarrassing and almost disrespectful to whoever you do it to, with Wayne saying he would embarrass anyone who get in his way.", "annotation_id": "18946914", "url": "https://genius.com/18946914", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
