{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Why I Do It", "line": "It ain’t hard to find me ‘cause nigga I’m shinin’ I ain’t got to tell these boys, they know I’m shinin’", "vault_lines": ["Don't tell me to prove it, 'cause I might lose it"], "meaning": "Wayne knows he’s a star; and he doesn’t have the need to tell anyone else because they know too. Being how his career is coming back strong with Tha Carter V and Dedication 6, both being quite anticipated by fans. He doesn’t need to tell anyone about his upcoming projects because he’s gonna make his solo career go out in style.", "annotation_id": "7843293", "url": "https://genius.com/7843293", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Why I Do It", "line": "Ridin’ through the city with a bad bitch with me", "vault_lines": ["Ridin' through the city with a bad bitch with me"], "meaning": "Well,Well ladies i think Mr.Alsina is off of the market. This past week he have been spotted with the beautiful instagram model Miracle Watts . The Bad bitch that is Ridin through the city with him is indeed her.As you can see in her snapchat picture she is ridin through the passenger seat that is customized to be red and black just like the picture on the left when august announced to the world he just got his range rover", "annotation_id": "7704114", "url": "https://genius.com/7704114", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Why I Do It", "line": "Get off my dick, let me do me That’s a million bucks, every two weeks", "vault_lines": ["Get off my dick, let me do me"], "meaning": "Wayne been on a Sorry 4 The Wait 2 mixtape release party tour, it began early this year, in March. He has been making a lot of money off it, TMZ stated that he makes $110,000 per a show.. In fact, MTV even did the math and counted how much money he makes per word.", "annotation_id": "7701473", "url": "https://genius.com/7701473", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Why I Do It", "line": "I woke up this mornin’, dick rock hard", "vault_lines": ["I woke up this mornin', dick rock hard"], "meaning": "Weezy often likes to refer to his throwbacks in his new music, first time he said this line was on Abortion, track 10 off his Tha Carter IV album, which was released in 2011. Second time, he said it was on UOENO track 22 off his Dedication 5 mixtape, which was released in 2013.", "annotation_id": "7701408", "url": "https://genius.com/7701408", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Why I Do It", "line": "I’m fuckin’ on an actress, we makin’ movies I’m pullin’ out my camera, we shootin’ new scenes", "vault_lines": ["I'm fuckin' on an actress, we makin' movies"], "meaning": "Wayne is currently dating the actress and singer, Christina Milian. The couple are making a lot of sex tapes together.. And doing their favorite sex position of course.\n\n\n\nYou would know if you have listened to Drunk In Love.", "annotation_id": "7701286", "url": "https://genius.com/7701286", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
