{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Whip It", "line": "Onions, I’ma cry", "vault_lines": ["And if the weed man ain't got no more onions, I'ma cry"], "meaning": "onions make people cry. Onion is a slang term for ounce. Ounce referring to an ounce of marijuana.", "annotation_id": "547080", "url": "https://genius.com/547080", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Whip It", "line": "And I ain’t Santa Claus, but I make it rain, dear", "vault_lines": ["And I ain't Santa Claus, but I make it rain, dear"], "meaning": "Clever wordplay, a reindeer is known to be animal which flies Santa’s sleigh but Weezy doesn’t mean the animal, he means he can make it ‘rain’ with money, dear.", "annotation_id": "419179", "url": "https://genius.com/419179", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
