{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "When They Come For Me", "line": "Protection off safety I look straight ahead “I got them niggas, Weezy” That’s what the .380 said", "vault_lines": ["I look straight ahead"], "meaning": "Wayne paints a vivid image of a cold blooded killer, calmly switching his pistol to ‘Fire’ mode.\n\n.380 ACP is a popular handgun cartridge.\n\nhttp://imgur.com/gallery/ueme3", "annotation_id": "10978115", "url": "https://genius.com/10978115", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
