{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "When I Sleep", "line": "Now I’m in the club: watch me make this bitch precipitate", "vault_lines": ["Now I'm in the club: watch me make this bitch precipitate"], "meaning": "Now I’m in the club: watch me make this bitch (rain)-\n\nA common term of throwing bills in the air into the crowd! He is making a contrast between being poor on the streets watchin' it rain to being rich and actually making it rain dollars!", "annotation_id": "313859", "url": "https://genius.com/313859", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
