{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "When I Sleep", "line": "No homo: I put your dick in the dirt", "vault_lines": ["No homo: I put your dick in the dirt"], "meaning": "If you fuck around with Wayne, he’ll:\nA)bury you, or\nB)go Lorena Bobbit on your ass\ndepending on which interpretation scares you more.\nOne of the rare instances of rap lines ending with “no homo” that actually required a no homo…good call, Weezy! (no homo…)", "annotation_id": "312172", "url": "https://genius.com/312172", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
