{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What’s Next", "line": "The system of a down, and it’s been up and down", "vault_lines": ["The system of a down, and it's been up and down"], "meaning": "A reference to the Armenian-American metal band, System of a Down. Wayne also continues the reference even further in the next line by cleverly mentioning the title of one of the band’s popular songs, “Psycho,” which talks about groupies and drug addiction.", "annotation_id": "14347712", "url": "https://genius.com/14347712", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
