{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "And if you feelin’ froggy leap, I’m kidnapping yo tadpoles", "vault_lines": ["And if you feelin' froggy leap, I'm kidnapping yo tadpoles"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the game “Frogger 2: Swampy’s Reference” released in the year 2000. In the game Swampy kidnaps Froggers kids, what wayne will do, if you act ‘Froggy’ or ‘testy’", "annotation_id": "18638603", "url": "https://genius.com/18638603", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’ma get the white and put it out; Em & Dre", "vault_lines": ["I'ma get the white and put it out; Em & Dre"], "meaning": "This line plays off of “white” meaning cocaine being sold for high prices during the drug drought mentioned in the line prior. Weezy references how Dr. Dre signed Eminem and put out his first big album, making him a superstar.", "annotation_id": "16991819", "url": "https://genius.com/16991819", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "Write my name on my cups, so nigga know not to touch", "vault_lines": ["Write my name on my cups, so nigga know not to touch"], "meaning": "The cups could be refer to two things:\n- Wayne has a spot for lean (promethazine/dirty sprite), the drink is often contained in a double cup.\n\n\n\n\nThe trophy, which implies that he’s the champion and none should ever chalenge him.", "annotation_id": "7804100", "url": "https://genius.com/7804100", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’m about to bust a rhyme; nod yo head and break ya neck", "vault_lines": ["I'm about to bust a rhyme; nod yo head and break ya neck"], "meaning": "Wayne continues his homage to Busta Rhymes, playing on his name to describe exactly what he does in the verse.\n\nOne of Busta’s biggest hits was “Break Ya Neck”, and as Wayne busts rhymes you can’t help but nod along so violently you will in fact do that.", "annotation_id": "7775870", "url": "https://genius.com/7775870", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "They respect all my artistry like Hemingway", "vault_lines": ["They respect all my artistry like Hemingway"], "meaning": "Ernest Hemingway was an American author and journalist. He was respected by a majority of people who knew him because his economical and understated style had a strong influence on the 20th-century. Similarly, Wayne has had a strong influence & impact on hip-hop, especially in his prime. New school rappers, including the most popular ones (like Drake & Kendrick) have been influenced by him as well.", "annotation_id": "7771979", "url": "https://genius.com/7771979", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "Niggas ain’t paying so I just been laying low", "vault_lines": ["Niggas ain't paying so I just been laying low"], "meaning": "Weezy has sued Cash Money Records/Birdman for $51M  because they didn’t pay him for his highly-anticipated album Tha Carter V. It seems like they still haven’t paid him for it.\n\nNow I don’t want no problems, I just want my money", "annotation_id": "7771940", "url": "https://genius.com/7771940", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "Little nigga dreadlocks with a dick with an afro", "vault_lines": ["Little nigga dreadlocks with a dick with an afro"], "meaning": "We all know Wayne is short––he’s only 5'5––but he is a big tipper who also got his hair dreaded in 2002.\n\n\n\nAnd well, we aren’t going to talk about his dick…because it’d be a long story.", "annotation_id": "7771892", "url": "https://genius.com/7771892", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "Shimmy shimmy ya shimmy yay", "vault_lines": ["Shimmy shimmy ya shimmy yay"], "meaning": "A reference to an old classic hit by Ol' Dirty Bastard, “Shimmy Shimmy Ya”.\n\nThat’s how he started his verse too:\n\nShimmy shimmy ya, shimmy yam, shimmy yay", "annotation_id": "7771866", "url": "https://genius.com/7771866", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "Long hair, don’t care, no shirt like Fabio", "vault_lines": ["Long hair, don't care, no shirt like Fabio"], "meaning": "Both Wayne and the Italian model/actor Fabio Lanzoni have long hair, and they are both shirtless most of them time.\n\n\n\nAlso, it’s worth a mention that this is not the first time Wayne says the “long hair don’t care” line––he said it once on “Mr. Carter”:\n\nI suck a pussy, fuck a pussy leave it there\nLong hair, don’t even care\n\nHe also referenced it on No Ceilings'‘ intro, “Swag Surf”:\n\nStill long hair, don’t care, like a Navajo", "annotation_id": "7771802", "url": "https://genius.com/7771802", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "When I say my cash low, I’m just telling a bad joke", "vault_lines": ["When I say my cash low, I'm just telling a bad joke"], "meaning": "Weezy often likes to brag about his money, so when he says he doesn’t have a lot, he isn’t being serious. He’s worth 140 mil!\n\nAnd here’s my most funniest joke: I’m broke\n\nSo is it funny or bad, Wayne?", "annotation_id": "7771788", "url": "https://genius.com/7771788", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’ma lose the weight in the drought; Ricki Lake", "vault_lines": ["I'ma lose the weight in the drought; Ricki Lake"], "meaning": "Ricki Lake is well known for losing about 140 pounds. Like her, Wayne is going to shed off his “weight.” In this case, it’s more likely referring to people or things (like his former label Cash Money, who he just dropped) that are making him angry instead of actual weight. He can just shake them off.", "annotation_id": "7771787", "url": "https://genius.com/7771787", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’ma stick a semi in his mouth; kissy face", "vault_lines": ["I'ma stick a semi in his mouth; kissy face"], "meaning": "Weezy is sticking a semi-automatic gun in his enemies' faces. While he does so, it will look like they are blowing kisses with their mouths.\n\nThe line is likely metaphorical, but note that Wayne has had trouble with guns in the past. If you’re on his bad side, watch out…", "annotation_id": "7771766", "url": "https://genius.com/7771766", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’ma kick a nigga in his mouth; MMA", "vault_lines": ["I'ma kick a nigga in his mouth; MMA"], "meaning": "MMA stands for mixed martial arts, which is a full contact sport somewhat similar to boxing. Of course, there is more contact involved.\n\nWayne threatens to kick people in the mouth like he’s in an MMA match. Apart from taking immense skill and flexibility, mouth kicks are legal––as long as your opponent isn’t grounded. Mouth guards are also strongly suggested for this kind of move.", "annotation_id": "7771762", "url": "https://genius.com/7771762", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Sayin", "line": "I’ma fuck her sisters and her mom; Kim & Ye", "vault_lines": ["I'ma fuck her sisters and her mom; Kim & Ye"], "meaning": "Wayne references Kanye West’s relationship with Kim Kardashian. If he was Kanye, he would fuck all of them: Khloe, Kourtney, Kylie, Kendall, and Kris. Wayne doesn’t fuck around and stick with one girl––he’s ready to fuck them all.\n\n\n\nNote that the youngest sibling, 18 year-old Kylie Jenner, is also dating a rapper––Tyga. If he actually wants to get with the whole family, he’ll have some tough competition.", "annotation_id": "7771747", "url": "https://genius.com/7771747", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
