{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Know (Remix)", "line": "Zigzaggin’ through that traffic like Emmitt I tell them niggas, “Hurry and buy!”", "vault_lines": ["Zigzaggin' through that traffic like Emmitt"], "meaning": "Reference to retired Cowboys running back Emmitt Smith.\n\n\n\nHis aforementioned Maserati can speed through traffic like Emmitt making his way to the end zone.", "annotation_id": "2755979", "url": "https://genius.com/2755979", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Know (Remix)", "line": "I’m a New Orleans gangsta, after the storm Boy, it took ’bout three million to rebuild my home, but—", "vault_lines": ["I'm a New Orleans gangsta, after the storm"], "meaning": "Wayne will always represent for his city and his hood.\n\n\n\nAfter Hurricane Katrina wiped out the city, many celebrities tried to donate money to help out the cause; however Wayne took it a step further and went back to his city to personally help with the rebuilding.", "annotation_id": "2755879", "url": "https://genius.com/2755879", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What You Know (Remix)", "line": "I keep a bad bitch skatin’ like New-New (Gangsta—)", "vault_lines": ["I keep a bad bitch skatin' like New-New (Gangsta—)"], "meaning": "Reference to the character New-New from the film ATL; played by actress Lauren London.\n\n\n\nThe irony of this line is that a few years later, Lauren got pregnant with Wayne and they now have a son named Cameron together.", "annotation_id": "2755839", "url": "https://genius.com/2755839", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
