{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What We Need", "line": "Cause my whip game is fertile, shit could make a twin nigga", "vault_lines": ["Cause my whip game is fertile, shit could make a twin nigga"], "meaning": "“Whips” often refer to cars, but in the drug world “whip game” refers to how well someone can cook up drugs (whipping up crack in a pot).", "annotation_id": "1694943", "url": "https://genius.com/1694943", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What We Need", "line": "Connect’s gettin’ hit and want us to make amends", "vault_lines": ["Connect's gettin' hit and want us to make amends"], "meaning": "A “connect” ( or “connection”) is a drug dealer. For example, “Let me call my connect.”\n\nThe connect Glasses is referring to keeps “gettin' hit” (getting robbed). The connect has come to “us” (Glasses and his crew) to “make amends” (ask for peace). Glasses is implying that he has been the one robbing the connect, who is now begging Glasses for forgiveness.", "annotation_id": "1694939", "url": "https://genius.com/1694939", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
