{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "What He Does", "line": "When I can stand over the stove and make them birds sing?", "vault_lines": ["When I can stand over the stove and make them birds sing?"], "meaning": "Birds is slang for a kilo of cocaine.\n\nWayne cooks crack in the kitchen making the “birds” sing, much to his girlfriend’s dismay.\n\nIt doesn’t look like this:\n\n\n\nmore like this:", "annotation_id": "2649306", "url": "https://genius.com/2649306", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
