{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We’re Done (Remix)", "line": "I got game like EA But I wanna let you play", "vault_lines": ["We're done, but it's not over"], "meaning": "EA – a popular brand of video games. He claims he has ‘game like EA’, but he want’s to let her ‘play’. Meaning he wants her with him.\n\nAlso, another is it is common men generally don’t allow women to play their video games, and it is a big deal including her.", "annotation_id": "548048", "url": "https://genius.com/548048", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
