{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Westwood Radio 1 Freestyle", "line": "Cause I don’t wanna finish They diminish I replenish Scientific, I’m out this world ho I wear bright red like a girl toe No homo, fingernails dirty I’ve been counting dirty money since 12:30 A-M, weigh them, if they short take them Right back and spray him amen, yea I just do my Wayne And every time I do it I do my thing, yea", "vault_lines": ["I just do my Wayne"], "meaning": "#All of these bars are from Weezy’s Let The Beat Build, you can check out the lyrics here", "annotation_id": "3439970", "url": "https://genius.com/3439970", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Westwood Radio 1 Freestyle", "line": "Welcome to the Carter, little shop of horror Bloody like a period , after D-R Doctor, im a dog, im a dog, im a dog yeah Not Goergetown but im a Uptown Hoya", "vault_lines": ["Doctor, im a dog, im a dog, im a dog yeah"], "meaning": "Wayne starts of his verse with bars are actually in his song “Eat You Alive”.", "annotation_id": "3438568", "url": "https://genius.com/3438568", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Westwood Radio 1 Freestyle", "line": "Like a pot and a pan i rock that ,yeah", "vault_lines": ["Like a pot and a pan i rock that ,yeah"], "meaning": "Weezy is referring to the production of crack cocaine, also called rocks.\n\nCrack Cocaine is a common street drug that consists of cocaine and baking soda. It is often produced by mixing the cocaine and baking soda in a beaker or glass jar.\n\nThe jar is placed in a boiling pot of water so the mixture heats up and forms a bond.\n\n\n\n#DON’T DO DRUGS KIDS", "annotation_id": "3438556", "url": "https://genius.com/3438556", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Westwood Radio 1 Freestyle", "line": "Freestyling for you , no for me, for me no no only for money", "vault_lines": ["Freestyling for you , no for me, for me no no only for money"], "meaning": "At first, he’s suggests that the purpose of his freestyle was for the audience that was listening to the radio that day, then he changes and suggests that he’s freestyling for himself, then he realizes that he’s only freestyling for that money aka “Guap”", "annotation_id": "3438545", "url": "https://genius.com/3438545", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
