{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Weezy’s Ambitions", "line": "I’mma trip to Japan and buy some brand new shit 900 to a grand get chu 28 grams If you talking ’bout bricks, I’m the interstate man", "vault_lines": ["Yep, I'm a muthafucking trip"], "meaning": "Wayne here makes a great comparison of how he’s rich from the rap game but still hustles on the streets. He can go across the world to Japan and buy brand new tech with his rap money, but for 900 to a grand he’s still traveling state by state to deliver bricks.", "annotation_id": "31238115", "url": "https://genius.com/31238115", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
