{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Weezy’s Ambitions", "line": "Weezy baby dat crack Mother fucker get a fix", "vault_lines": ["Weezy Baby that crack, muthafucka get a fix"], "meaning": "Getting ‘fixed’ is the term used for when crackheads need their drug. The ‘fix’ makes them stop acting crazy and shit. Weezy is calling himself the crack, and people listen to him to get their ‘fix’!", "annotation_id": "213500", "url": "https://genius.com/213500", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
