{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Weezy Baby", "line": "I ain’t talkin’ fast, you just listenin’ too slow (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I ain't talkin' fast, you just listenin' too slow (Yeah)"], "meaning": "This verse’s opening line may have been inspired by Lil Wayne’s future collaborator, Eminem, who on “Bitch” off of D12 World, said,\n\n“And if I’m talking too fast it just means you’re listening too slow\nAnd if you listen a little faster maybe you’ll catch up, bitch”", "annotation_id": "18830324", "url": "https://genius.com/18830324", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
