{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Weather Man", "line": "I’m Rick James (Jones), “I’m rich, bitch,” is what I tell her (I’m rich)", "vault_lines": ["I'm Rick James (Jones), \"I'm rich, bitch,\" is what I tell her (I'm rich)"], "meaning": "This opening line is a reference to comedian Dave Chappelle and his classic skit on Rick James that became a staple in comedy history.", "annotation_id": "19968434", "url": "https://genius.com/19968434", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
