{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We Don’t", "line": "We was raised in these war times Jail also made men in these hard times", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, and we was raised in these war times"], "meaning": "Birdman doesn’t literally mean he and Wayne grew up in a war, he means they grew up in the hood, which is so dangerous, it could be referred to as a war.\n\nAlso, during these times that Birdman refers to as war (dangerous times in the hood) young prisoners grew up/matured in prison, making them become men.", "annotation_id": "1053725", "url": "https://genius.com/1053725", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
