{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We Back Soon (Original)", "line": "Smoke some kush and snap my fingers in case you got cat lives", "vault_lines": ["Smoke some kush and snap my fingers in case you got cat lives"], "meaning": "Wayne is going to smoke a strain of medical-grade cannabis\n\n\n\n and snap his fingers hoping you don’t have cat lives.  It would appear he’s smoking kush to cope with his anxiety and rampant paranoia.\n\nHe snaps his finger to call his goons to shoot you more than one time, because you might have 9 lives like a cat.", "annotation_id": "139065", "url": "https://genius.com/139065", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
