{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We Back Soon (Original)", "line": "Blunt thick as Bobby Christina, high as Serena’s skirt", "vault_lines": ["Blunt thick as Bobby Christina, high as Serena’s skirt"], "meaning": "To be thick is to have a good body like Bobbi Christina the daughter of Whitney Houston. Serena Williams is a professional tennis player known for wearing pretty high Nike skirts on the court. To be high is to be under the influence of Marijuana or another mood altering drug. Lil Wayne is saying he very high.\n\n\n\nEither his blunts are as thick as Bobbi Christina’s head since she was recently caught smoking weed even though both of her parents were addicts, or he is simply name dropping her as thick because she recently turned 18. His blunt gets you as high as serena williams tennis skirts", "annotation_id": "138736", "url": "https://genius.com/138736", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
