{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We Alright", "line": "Living the star life you never know who you’ll run into Like, baby I can change your life, just leave everything that you been through And ride", "vault_lines": ["Living the star life you never know who you'll run into"], "meaning": "You never know who might change your life, you might just meet a star like a birdman aka baby, who would tell you to leave everything you’ve been through and join him as he changes your life.", "annotation_id": "22715412", "url": "https://genius.com/22715412", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "We Alright", "line": "Would someone just tell the bartender to mix my drink while I mix my thoughts my business and pleasure?", "vault_lines": ["I couldn't have done it better, I couldn't have done this shit any other way"], "meaning": "The bartender’s job is to mix drinks while for him, he’ll use his thought as business for pleasure which is getting rich so he uses ‘mix’ as a comparison with what the bartender is going to to.", "annotation_id": "22715381", "url": "https://genius.com/22715381", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
