{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne’s World", "line": "Tony Montana said, “This world is yours,”", "vault_lines": ["Tony Montana said, \"This world is yours\""], "meaning": "In the 1983 Brian de Palma remake of Scarface, Tony Montana looks up in the evening sky to see a blimp with the message: The World is Yours.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VOqUTI1T71M", "annotation_id": "18996335", "url": "https://genius.com/18996335", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
