{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne on Me", "line": "I get it wetter than bass pussy", "vault_lines": ["I get it wetter than bass pussy"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne operates in a world where he assumes people already say “bass pussy” for this line.\n(Source: Riley Savage, Hivemind LTD.)\nOn a more serious note, bass are fishes, so you’d assume that the females, already being wet due to virtue of being underwater, would have even wetter genitalia when aroused. Wayne is saying that he, a presumable sexual master, can get a girl even wetter than THAT.\nOf course, the implication is still that anyone would ever say “bass pussy.”", "annotation_id": "29649090", "url": "https://genius.com/29649090", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne on Me", "line": "Come and make it Wayne down on me", "vault_lines": ["Come and make it Wayne down on me"], "meaning": "Instead of saying “Rain down on me”, Weezy is playing around with his name and changes the “rain” into “wayne”. Wayne is not talking about water falling from the sky anymore, he’s talking about having an orgasm and ejaculating all over her.\nSo the girl actually wants him to come and ejaculate all over her.", "annotation_id": "3242924", "url": "https://genius.com/3242924", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne on Me", "line": "Wide receiver Weezy, throw the pussy at me", "vault_lines": ["Wide receiver Weezy, throw the pussy at me"], "meaning": "This is continuing the football metaphor from the last song, “That’s All I Have”:\n\nYoung Money down your throat, ya gotta stay hydrated\nQuarterback Weezy, young Tom Brady\nOpen up ya mouth, and catch a bomb baby\n\nExcept in this case, Wayne is on the receiving end, and his girl is the quarterback.", "annotation_id": "2875262", "url": "https://genius.com/2875262", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne on Me", "line": "I fuck American pie and I get foreign head", "vault_lines": ["I fuck American pie and I get foreign head"], "meaning": "American Pie was a movie in which the teenagers vowed to lose their virginity before graduating one character (Nadia) was a smoking hawt foreign exchange student from Czechoslovakia.", "annotation_id": "79659", "url": "https://genius.com/79659", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
