{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wayne on Me", "line": "She send me pictures to my iPhone Then I gotta clear em cause my girl be checking my phone", "vault_lines": ["I like to kiss, she like to kiss"], "meaning": "He has to delete his mistress' naked photos, because his main girl checks his phone.\n\nWayne:\n\n\nStop this infidelity, shame on you!\niPhones are for girls, bro. Be a thug: get a Blackberry Storm™\n\n\n\n\n(Not a paid advertisement for Blackberry™)", "annotation_id": "8515", "url": "https://genius.com/8515", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
