{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "[Female] Cash Money... Cash Money... Cash Money... Cash Money...", "vault_lines": ["We rollin wit Cash Money"], "meaning": "This section is a homage to the intro of Hit ‘Em Up by 2Pac.\n\n(Take money) West Side, Bad Boy killas\n(Take money) (You know) You know who the realest is\n(Take money) Niggas, we bring it too\nThat’s a'ight, haha\n(Take money) Haha\n\nExcept here, “take money” is replaced with “Cash Money”, obviously due to 500 Degreez being made under the Cash Money record label.\n\nIt is also worth noting that 2Pac’s Hit ‘Em Up is a song that also samples Don’t Look Any Further by Dennis Edwards.", "annotation_id": "27478533", "url": "https://genius.com/27478533", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "Cause you know it ain’t trickin if you got it", "vault_lines": ["Cause you know it ain't trickin if you got it"], "meaning": "A saying that means that if you’ve got the cash to be flashy and have nice cars, clothes, jewelery, etc. it isn’t fake (trickin') as opposed to somebody who is faking wealth by showing off with items that arent paid for. The Cool G Rap track I Ain’t Trickin’ could have been an inspiration.\n\nWayne went on to repeat variations of this line in A Milli and Got Money.", "annotation_id": "19128869", "url": "https://genius.com/19128869", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "Know’n what I got up in my styrofoam cup - that purple stuff", "vault_lines": ["Know'n what I got up in my styrofoam cup - that purple stuff"], "meaning": "Wayne has a long history of drinking lean, the party drug that became popular in the south in the 90s while he was a teenager. And his love for sizzurp even manifested in a dedicated song a few albums later. In 2016, he reportedly drank three 16 ounce bottles of the Promethazine/Codeine syrup during a club appearance.", "annotation_id": "15456738", "url": "https://genius.com/15456738", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "Copped baby girl what she desired It’s chump change ma, marijuana scholar", "vault_lines": ["Copped baby girl what she desired"], "meaning": "At this point is his career, Weezy was already making big money, enough so that a few mall puchases would'nt set him down more than some “chump change” (pocket money). He was also already an expert pot smoker.", "annotation_id": "15456728", "url": "https://genius.com/15456728", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "Tats in my face, my back and my arm", "vault_lines": ["Tats in my face, my back and my arm"], "meaning": "Back in 2002, Weezy only had tattoos on his face, torso and chest.\n\n\n\nThis is a more recent picture, but still before every inch of his body got tatted.", "annotation_id": "4383124", "url": "https://genius.com/4383124", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "It’s lil whoadie from the hot block with serious flow Gotta get dough, cha’ll won’t feel me broke", "vault_lines": ["It's lil whoadie from the hot block with serious flow"], "meaning": "Add Lil Whodi to the ever-growing list of Wayne nicknames…\n\nWhodi is slang for “friend”. Interestingly enough Wayne admits that while he may be your friend, if he were broke you wouldn’t be feelin' him", "annotation_id": "2960606", "url": "https://genius.com/2960606", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "line": "Oh, I forgot about peace - Peace!", "vault_lines": ["Oh, I forgot about peace - Peace!"], "meaning": "A reference to the end of “Paid In Full” by Rakim, which the instrumental to this song samples\n\nAnd we outta here\nYo, what happened to peace?\nPeace", "annotation_id": "2012102", "url": "https://genius.com/2012102", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way of Life", "status": "done", "targets": 7, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-way-of-life-lyrics", "genius_title": "Way of Life", "genius_id": 28594, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "And even though I’m not an artist, this is where I draw the line", "vault_lines": ["And even though I'm not an artist, this is where I draw the line"], "meaning": "What Wayne intended to say in here was that he isn’t this kind of artist, that paints or draws. Still, he is drawing a line now, that is a metaphor for a limit.\n\nWhat isn’t clear, however, is that if this is Wayne’s own limit, meaning he makes this person he is robbing tell him the safe combination but then doesn’t do anything else to him or her, or if this limit is for other people, and so they shouldn’t cross the line like a mexican.", "annotation_id": "3363241", "url": "https://genius.com/3363241", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "That’s a pocket full of stones", "vault_lines": ["that's a pocket full of stones"], "meaning": "Wayne plays with the meaning of the word stones, a synonym for rocks (a slang for crack rocks). So, if Weezy has a pocketful of stones, he’s got as much as it fits in his pocket of that crack to sell. Also, there’s a probable reference to the UGK’s song here.", "annotation_id": "3363208", "url": "https://genius.com/3363208", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Mansion on the beach, nigga that’s the purpose", "vault_lines": ["Mansion on the beach, nigga that's the purpose"], "meaning": "Birdman’s 14.5 Million dollar house in Miami", "annotation_id": "2811679", "url": "https://genius.com/2811679", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "And Giuseppe, she got it", "vault_lines": ["and Giuseppe, she got it"], "meaning": "‘Jimmy Choos’ and ‘Guiseppe’ are both very expensive shoe brands, Mack’s saying that he’s only with the finest girls around.", "annotation_id": "2254363", "url": "https://genius.com/2254363", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I’m too good for just any bad bitch", "vault_lines": ["I'm too good for just any bad bitch"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is obviously one of the richest men on the planet, no where near Bill Gates' level, however it’s still a very notable amount. Wayne was recently listed On the Highest Earning Hip-Hop artists', Forbes List as the 7th richest hip-hop artist of 2013, earning just over $16 million this year.\n\nBecause he’s earning so much money and he’s one of the most well known artists throughout the entire music world, he feels that he’s way out of all of these women’s league and any girl who gets to have him is lucky.\n\n\n\nAlso note the juxtaposition between “I’m too good for just any bad bitch”.", "annotation_id": "2254348", "url": "https://genius.com/2254348", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Jimmy Choos", "vault_lines": ["If we talkin' mew mew's, Jimmy Choos"], "meaning": "Jimmy Choo is a Chinese fashion designer specializing in shoes, handbags and other accessories\n\n\n\nI wonder who taught this chick how to put some mother fucking Jimmy Choos on", "annotation_id": "2249376", "url": "https://genius.com/2249376", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "This bitch text saying her lights off I bought her a new crib, it’s a tax write-off", "vault_lines": ["This bitch text saying her lights off"], "meaning": "One of Mack Maine’s girls came to her with her problems. He didn’t just pay for her light bill. He bought her a whole new house.\nThat little piece of charity is nothing to him, just a tax write-off.", "annotation_id": "2242511", "url": "https://genius.com/2242511", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I just flew 2 hoes in, oh how time flies, clip its wings", "vault_lines": ["I just flew 2 hoes in, oh how time flies, clip its wings"], "meaning": "He’s about to play with his foreign girls that just arrived.\n“Time flies” for the average person. But he’s about to enjoy his time and live in slow-mo a because it’s in his control like a bird with its wings clipped.", "annotation_id": "2242443", "url": "https://genius.com/2242443", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "All my life I been this cold", "vault_lines": ["All my life I been this cold"], "meaning": "Growing up in the mean streets of Hollygrove, Weezy has always been cold-blooded. He had to develop a sense of selfishness and bravery at an early age to survive.\n\nHe even shot himself with his own gun at the age of 12. Below is an interview about that moment.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=84U1I5e7I54", "annotation_id": "2195387", "url": "https://genius.com/2195387", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I’m a walkin’ hedge fund", "vault_lines": ["I'm a walkin' hedge fund"], "meaning": "Mack compares himself with a hedge fund just to show how rich he is. Wiki definition of hedge fund:\n\n“A hedge fund is a collective investment scheme, often structured as a limited partnership, that invests private capital speculatively to maximize capital appreciation.”\n\nYou can think of hedge funds as mutual funds for the super rich.", "annotation_id": "2168358", "url": "https://genius.com/2168358", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Surprise yo ass like a baby… taking his first steps", "vault_lines": ["Surprise yo ass like a baby… taking his first steps"], "meaning": "A baby taking its first steps is both special and surprising. Weezy is playing off the line from before explaining that he’ll pull the uzi from under his dress and surprise you like a baby’s first steps.", "annotation_id": "2167100", "url": "https://genius.com/2167100", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I still got residue all on my dinner plates", "vault_lines": ["I still got residue all on my dinner plates"], "meaning": "Cocaine leaves a residue on what you cook it in, Weezy is saying he still has residue on his plates after all this time.", "annotation_id": "2167099", "url": "https://genius.com/2167099", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
