{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Dressed up like a old lady, uzi under my church dress", "vault_lines": ["Dressed up like a old lady, uzi under my church dress"], "meaning": "1- Lil Wayne is willing to wear a disguise to get the jump on an enemy\n2- Who would EVER expect an old lady to be packing heat?!\n\n(well except her [if you know who she is])", "annotation_id": "2165444", "url": "https://genius.com/2165444", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "We hit the block dippin’ ’cause the block hot", "vault_lines": ["We hit the block dippin' 'cause the block hot"], "meaning": "Possibly a reference to an old Lil Wayne album Tha Block is Hot", "annotation_id": "2164676", "url": "https://genius.com/2164676", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "That milk carton show her missing panties", "vault_lines": ["That milk carton show her missing panties"], "meaning": "Older milk cartons often displayed images of missing people and if anyone knew of their whereabouts, they’d contact the number supplied on the carton.\n\nLil Wayne’s girls underwear are missing because he’s possibly making love too her right now.\n\nIf you find them, please contact the number on the milk carton. Thank you.", "annotation_id": "2164660", "url": "https://genius.com/2164660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Fuck with me ’cause I fuck around and got that shit from Neil Armstrong aw! Neil Armstrong aw! Neil Armstrong Fuck with me ’cause I fuck around and got that shit from Neil Armstrong! Got some moon rocks in my pockets, that’s a pocket full of stones Fuck with me ’cause I fuck around and got that shit from Neil Armstrong aw!", "vault_lines": ["Got some moon rocks in my pockets,"], "meaning": "Neil Armstrong (RIP) was the first man to ever step foot on the moon. On this hook Wayne implies that it was Neil Armstrong who retrieved the moon rocks (ecstasy) from the moon and brought it back to him.\n\n\n\nThis also compliments the rest of the hook by explaining how Wayne got his pocket full of moon rocks.", "annotation_id": "2163394", "url": "https://genius.com/2163394", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Got some moon rocks in my pockets,", "vault_lines": ["Got some moon rocks in my pockets,"], "meaning": "Moon rocks is a slang term for the drug ecstasy. After popping a few, you’ll be as high as the moon.", "annotation_id": "2163371", "url": "https://genius.com/2163371", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Lil’ Tune", "vault_lines": ["Track off Wayne’s Dedication 5 mixtape. Featuring Mack Maine, Future & Birdman."], "meaning": "Lil Wayne’s classic ending to his verses just to let you know who’s on the track.\n\nHe uses ‘Tunechi’ a lot more often than ‘Lil’ Tune'.", "annotation_id": "2162600", "url": "https://genius.com/2162600", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "None of my checks come late, I ain’t having that, I give ’em curfews", "vault_lines": ["None of my checks come late, I ain't having that, I give 'em curfews"], "meaning": "Wayne wants his money on time, so he gives it a curfew.\n\nA curfew is usually used by parents when they give their kids a time that they must be home by.", "annotation_id": "2162299", "url": "https://genius.com/2162299", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I star 6-7, my flights I fly private", "vault_lines": ["I star 6-7, my flights I fly private"], "meaning": "A play on flying private. Whenever you make a phone call, and you *67, it automatically restricts it, making your number private.", "annotation_id": "2161646", "url": "https://genius.com/2161646", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "But all good things must come to an end Like this blunt burning my fingertips", "vault_lines": ["But all good things must come to an end"], "meaning": "When a blunt is almost finished, often times it burns your fingers. This is why many stoners use a roach clip.\n\nIt is no secret that Lil Wayne is an avid marijuana smoker, he has a song called “Blunt Blowin”, and a song that names his priorities called “Pussy, Money, Weed”.\n\n\n\nAll good things must come to an end, not only his blunt, but his verse is also coming to an end.", "annotation_id": "2161544", "url": "https://genius.com/2161544", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Bitch, I’m ballin’ like Rondo", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm ballin' like Rondo"], "meaning": "Rajon Rondo is an all star point guard who currently plays for the NBA team the Boston Celtics. He is known for his ridiculous handles.\n\n\n\nGood simile by Mack, for he isn’t actually playing ball, but he is balling in the sense of living the good life, and having extreme wealth and he flaunting it.", "annotation_id": "2161526", "url": "https://genius.com/2161526", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Make you spit that safe combination, out like Listerine", "vault_lines": ["Make you spit that safe combination, out like Listerine"], "meaning": "Weezy is gonna force you, most likely at gunpoint due to all those gun references he has previously mentioned, to “spit” or tell him the combination to the safe with the money in it.\n\nHe forces one to spit just like when they take some listerine, if you don’t spit that out when you’re done swishin' then good luck!", "annotation_id": "2160991", "url": "https://genius.com/2160991", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "I keep change on me now ‘Cause this shit’s startin’ to take a toll", "vault_lines": ["I keep change on me now"], "meaning": "Take a toll means that it is tearing him up psychologically, but also “take a toll” as in he has to pay a toll, which typically requires a fee of a few quarters or dimes(change).", "annotation_id": "2160987", "url": "https://genius.com/2160987", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Been had this bitch on lock, I’m ’bout to get this bitch a cellmate", "vault_lines": ["Been had this bitch on lock, I'm 'bout to get this bitch a cellmate"], "meaning": "Wayne has his a girl on lock, which means she’s down with anything.\n\nOn lock is also a play on prison, because in prison you get locked up. By bringing in another “cellmate”, he’s about to bring another girl into the picture, and have a threesome.", "annotation_id": "2160980", "url": "https://genius.com/2160980", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Thank God that I’m so gifted", "vault_lines": ["Thank God that I'm so gifted"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is a man of god. He’s thanking the lord for his ‘gift’ which is his talent and successful rap career.\n\n\n\nWe know he is a man of god from his previous songs, such as “Rich As Fuck”:\n\nAK on my night stand, right next to that bible", "annotation_id": "2160964", "url": "https://genius.com/2160964", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "Smoke like I’ve been kissing dragons", "vault_lines": ["Smoke like I've been kissing dragons"], "meaning": "Dragon’s are mythical creatures that are able to breath fire out of their mouths.\n\nLike dragons, Wayne too has been blowing smoke.", "annotation_id": "2160958", "url": "https://genius.com/2160958", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Way I’m Ballin’", "line": "We don’t feel none of you niggas Y’all some fuckin’ porcupines", "vault_lines": ["We don't feel none of you niggas"], "meaning": "Porcupines are an animal with very sharp points on their backs.\n\n\n\nWHY WOULD YOU FEEL A PORCUPINE?\n\nWayne’s doesn’t feel your flow, like he wouldn’t try to ‘feel’ a porcupine because he already knows it’ll hurt.", "annotation_id": "2160949", "url": "https://genius.com/2160949", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
