{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "A big-head nigga couldn’t even imagine", "vault_lines": ["A big-head nigga couldn't even imagine"], "meaning": "Young mula Weezy could be saying 2 things:\n\n1: A big headed person, meaning someone who is egotistical, couldn’t imagine what he’s done.\n2: A big headed person in the literal sense. As a common saying goes, if a head is bigger on a person it means and they are smarter. So they couldn’t even imagine what Wayne can do even with how smart they are. 🧠", "annotation_id": "40613281", "url": "https://genius.com/40613281", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
