{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "I am different like blue pee", "vault_lines": ["Mic check, two-three; I am different like blue pee"], "meaning": "Pee here could refer to urine or ‘pea’ as in the food. Either way, blue is a strange colour for either of the two; urine usually being yellow or clear while peas are usually green. This shows how rare Lil Wayne is as an artist, whether it be his incredible wordplay, quirky delivery or prolific output of mixtapes.", "annotation_id": "36458420", "url": "https://genius.com/36458420", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "Mickey Mouse cheese, hip-hop Walt Disney", "vault_lines": ["Mickey Mouse cheese, hip-hop Walt Disney"], "meaning": "Mice are known to like cheese hence why Lil Wayne says ‘mickey mouse cheese’. But cheese is also slang for ‘money’ so Wayne references the creator of Mickey Mouse, Walt Disney, who was filthy rich before he passed away in 1966.", "annotation_id": "36458385", "url": "https://genius.com/36458385", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "I don’t splurge around no ho, no, I don’t shine in front of no bitch ’Cause after she get off my dick, I be like “Find the front door, bitch”", "vault_lines": ["I don't splurge around no ho, no, I don't shine in front of no bitch"], "meaning": "Wayne has no time to show off in front of a lady, because as soon as he’s done having sex with her, she’s out the door!", "annotation_id": "36458371", "url": "https://genius.com/36458371", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "I bring it to your front door like you ordered me", "vault_lines": ["I bring it to your front door like you ordered me"], "meaning": "In this lyric, young Carter gives us insight about his early days as an entertainer, working under daddy Birdman’s wing.", "annotation_id": "35681645", "url": "https://genius.com/35681645", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "Weezy Fucking Baby, baby, make the ladies come quick", "vault_lines": ["Weezy Fucking Baby, baby, make the ladies come quick"], "meaning": "Wayne often calls himself ‘Weezy F Baby’ and consistently gives us a variety of different explanations for what the ‘F’ stands for. Here he is saying that it stands for ‘Fucking.’ With that and the rest of the line, he is bragging that he has sex with women.", "annotation_id": "33824337", "url": "https://genius.com/33824337", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
