{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "Bet I run this shit, I don’t run from shit", "vault_lines": ["Bet I run this shit, I don't run from shit"], "meaning": "An example of antanaclasis and/or functional shift. Wayne uses this literary device often, and is sometimes derided for it. However, this device was a common tool of literary greats such as Shakespeare.", "annotation_id": "30831812", "url": "https://genius.com/30831812", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
