{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Watch My Shoes", "line": "Man, I’d rather chill with 54 bitches Ch—Chill like— Ch—Chill like an Eskimo L—Let’s get more— Let’s get more bitches And I be like, “Let’s get more bitches”", "vault_lines": ["Man, I'd rather chill with 54 bitches"], "meaning": "Wayne wants to “chill” (hang out) with some ladies.\n\nEskimos are known to reside in freezing temperatures; hence they “chill”.", "annotation_id": "24760", "url": "https://genius.com/24760", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
