{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Wasted", "line": "I shake you pussies up, I’m a vibrator, haha!", "vault_lines": ["I shake you pussies up, I'm a vibrator, haha!"], "meaning": "Wayne here will shake up (attack) his enemies, who he refers to as pussies, which is a vulgar way of calling someone weak or a coward. He compares himself to a vibrator because a vibrator is a sex toy which ‘vibrates’ or shakes up a female’s vagina, which gives them great pleasure.", "annotation_id": "36458311", "url": "https://genius.com/36458311", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
