{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "WIND", "line": "No socks, no shoes, I put my soul in it", "vault_lines": ["No socks, no shoes, I put my soul in it"], "meaning": "The line “No socks, no shoes, I put my soul in it” is deceptively simple but richly metaphorical, blending physical imagery with emotional depth. On the surface, it paints an image of bare feet—raw, exposed, grounded—a choice that immediately suggests vulnerability and authenticity. By stating “no socks, no shoes,” Tyler implies he’s stripped of protection, artifice, or barriers, offering something unfiltered and direct. This lack of footwear can symbolize humility or returning to basics, almost like standing barefoot on the earth—fully present and connected to something real.\n\nThe brilliance comes in the wordplay between “soul” and “sole.” Shoes typically have soles, but Tyler says he has no shoes—just his soul. It’s a pun that links physical absence to spiritual presence: even without the material (the soles), he’s putting everything internal (his soul) into what he’s doing. That twist suggests total emotional investment, the idea that what he’s delivering—whether a verse, a relationship, or a performance—isn’t polished or dressed up, but deeply personal and fully committed. It’s a mic-drop moment of poetic minimalism that blends swagger, sacrifice, and sincerity in a single bar.", "annotation_id": "35529017", "url": "https://genius.com/35529017", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "WIND", "line": "See he the Flower Boy, he got the roles in him (Roles in him)", "vault_lines": ["See he the Flower Boy, he got the roles in him (Roles in him)"], "meaning": "This line is most likely a reference to the name of his fourth studio album, Flower Boy, released on July 21st, 2017.\n\n\n\nCover art for Flower Boy.", "annotation_id": "33651462", "url": "https://genius.com/33651462", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
