{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "WHAT I WANT", "line": "Mona Lisa smile, but she not gon’ let her teeth show", "vault_lines": ["Mona Lisa smile, but she not gon' let her teeth show"], "meaning": "The world-renowned Leonardo da Vinci’s Mona Lisa painting depicts a woman smiling without showing her teeth. Wayne references the Mona Lisa to describe a deceptive woman who hides her true  intentions behind a smiling facade much like the hidden teeth behind the lady’s smile in the painting.\n\n\n\nAdditionally, Wayne has a track titled “Mona Lisa” featuring Kendrick Lamar which tells a story about a deceptive woman named ‘Liz’ that manipulates both a gangster (Lil Wayne) and her boyfriend (Kendrick Lamar.)", "annotation_id": "37276651", "url": "https://genius.com/37276651", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
