{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Viva La White Girl (Remix)", "line": "Ms. Aphrodite, what is your synopsis?", "vault_lines": ["Ms. Aphrodite, what is your synopsis?"], "meaning": "Aphrodite was the goddess of love, and is very similar to the word aphrodisiac. Cocaine can be looked at as an aphrodisiac and the consumption of which blocks one’s “Synapses” (Synopsis).\n\n\n\nAll this beautifully concealed as asking a lady what she thinks of him.", "annotation_id": "952566", "url": "https://genius.com/952566", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Viva La White Girl (Remix)", "line": "But it’s, clear as a mirror they don’t want to race us As I stare in this mirror", "vault_lines": ["But it's, clear as a mirror they don't want to race us"], "meaning": "Reference to cocaine as people break up the cocaine lines on a mirror. This reference is used in the following line as well.", "annotation_id": "952563", "url": "https://genius.com/952563", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Viva La White Girl (Remix)", "line": "As the white stallion bucks And kicks me in my nose until my face bust, fuck", "vault_lines": ["and powder my face up"], "meaning": "White stallion refers to cocaine. When snorted hard and long enough, it isn’t uncommon to get a nose bleed from the coke. This is what Wayne is illustrating here.", "annotation_id": "559877", "url": "https://genius.com/559877", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
