{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Veteran’s Day", "line": "Junior doing time, kicking up his feet", "vault_lines": ["Junior doing time, kicking up his feet"], "meaning": "Yet another of Waynes nicknames, this one came about because of the ‘fatherly’ way that Birdman took care of him and helped his career\n\nBirdman acknowledges Wayne’s recent time spent in prison and away from the game", "annotation_id": "54089", "url": "https://genius.com/54089", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Veteran’s Day", "line": "Thousand dollar cologne", "vault_lines": ["Cash money is the Army, Veterans day"], "meaning": "Considering the most expensive cologne in the world – Clive Christian No. 1 – can be had for $650 a bottle, this sounds like an exaggeration..", "annotation_id": "53990", "url": "https://genius.com/53990", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Veteran’s Day", "line": "And by the way, my name is Tunechi", "vault_lines": ["And by the way, my name is Tunechi"], "meaning": "One of Lil Wayne’s many nicknames (the original one from his childhood too!)\n\nAlso the basis for his Twitter name..", "annotation_id": "53985", "url": "https://genius.com/53985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Veteran’s Day", "line": "Cash money is the Army, Veterans day", "vault_lines": ["Cash money is the Army, Veterans day"], "meaning": "Cash Money records takes a lot of inspiration from the Armed Forces, hence “Veterans Day”!\n\nIt’s a common comparison for him to make:\n\nCash Money is the Army, Navy Seal me in here\n\n(from “Fly In”)\n\nThe phrase originates from B.G.’s song of the same name.", "annotation_id": "53972", "url": "https://genius.com/53972", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
