{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "With my homies screamin’ out, “Tunechi don’t do it! Reconsider!”", "vault_lines": ["With my homies screamin' out, \"Tunechi don't do it! Reconsider!\""], "meaning": "This line interpolates Andre 3000’s verse on “International Players Anthem”, in particular when Andre says\n\nDon’t do it! Reconsider, read some liter-\nAture on the subject? You sure? Fuck it\n\nhttps://youtu.be/awMIbA34MT8?t=1m28s\n\nAt this point of Wayne’s day, he is under the influence and is struggling to think reasonable as he is contemplating marriage with some woman he barley recognizes or knows. Thankfully his “homies” Cortez Bryant and Mack Maine are there to pressure him out of it.", "annotation_id": "14981135", "url": "https://genius.com/14981135", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "Baby you my trending topic", "vault_lines": ["Baby you my trending topic"], "meaning": "Trending topics are the most popular stories on Twitter. This woman is Fat Leopard’s flavor of the week – in a few days, she’ll be an afterthought.", "annotation_id": "6407432", "url": "https://genius.com/6407432", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "It’s like your body’s worth Bugattis", "vault_lines": ["It's like your body's worth Bugattis"], "meaning": "Bugattis typically cost $1.5 million at minimum, so it’s clear this woman has a high class, rockin' body.", "annotation_id": "6407403", "url": "https://genius.com/6407403", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "My girl just said, “Let’s go get married,” I laughed Now I’m at a drive-through chapel in a cab", "vault_lines": ["My girl just said, \"Let's go get married,\" I laughed"], "meaning": "Vegas is one of the easiest places in the world to get married, with countless “instant marriage” and drive-through chapels – sometimes with Elvis impersonators.\n\n\n\nYou know, since he’s surpassed Elvis on the Billboard charts, don’t you think they should start having Weezy impersonators down in Las Vegas?", "annotation_id": "6398061", "url": "https://genius.com/6398061", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "I’m up in Vegas, a million in cash I just lost half, don’t dwell on the past", "vault_lines": ["I'm up in Vegas, a million in cash"], "meaning": "When you’ve got as much cash as Wayne, why would you lament on losing half a milli?", "annotation_id": "6398058", "url": "https://genius.com/6398058", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "And she tell me I’m the one and I tell her she the one And all we gotta do is dial 9", "vault_lines": ["And she tell me I'm the one and I tell her she the one"], "meaning": "They both tell each other “you’re the one” – an expression of love that would cause any player to panic that he might actually be falling for the girl.\n\nHence dialing 911, as this would certainly be some sort of gangsta’s emergency.", "annotation_id": "6398025", "url": "https://genius.com/6398025", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "She tapped the dick twice, is this thing on? You are now live, and the crowd vibed", "vault_lines": ["She tapped the dick twice, is this thing on?"], "meaning": "Often before speaking or singing, an emcee or singer will lightly tap the mic to make sure it’s turned on. It doesn’t usually work for dicks, but hey, more power to her.", "annotation_id": "6398018", "url": "https://genius.com/6398018", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "We had so much cocaine When I stepped out the suite I had sand on my feet", "vault_lines": ["We had so much cocaine"], "meaning": "The amount of cocaine on the suite floor is reminiscent of sand on the beach – soft and white.", "annotation_id": "6397987", "url": "https://genius.com/6397987", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "I woke up thinking, I don’t remember last night With a stranger laying next to me She said it’s Vegas, so I guess it’s alright Shit is exactly how it’s s’posed to be These Vegas nights, they never end These Vegas nights, they never end", "vault_lines": ["I woke up thinking, I don't remember last night"], "meaning": "One night stands are the name of the game in Sin City. These lines verbally depict and stay true to the popular saying:\n\nWhat happens in Vegas, stays in Vegas", "annotation_id": "6395333", "url": "https://genius.com/6395333", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "line": "I said, ”Fuck it, my nigga, we up in Vegas And I feel like De Niro”", "vault_lines": ["I said, \"Fuck it, my nigga, we up in Vegas"], "meaning": "Actor Robert De Niro had his own experiences in the 2013 film, Last Vegas.", "annotation_id": "6395290", "url": "https://genius.com/6395290", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vegas", "status": "done", "targets": 10, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Hoodybaby-vegas-lyrics", "genius_title": "Vegas", "genius_id": 1792085, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vans", "line": "Ayo, Paul, why’ont you roll up a ‘Young L’ Hahah", "vault_lines": ["Ayo, Paul, why'ont you roll up a"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is aware that the producer of the instrumental is Young L. When people smoke they often talk about rolling up an L. Lil Wayne is preparing to be on a roll after he murks this beat!", "annotation_id": "33385930", "url": "https://genius.com/33385930", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vans", "line": "Haha, and I swear I go dumb I smoke so much, niggas call me No Lungs", "vault_lines": ["Haha, and I swear I go dumb"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne acknowledges the culture in the Bay Area as they started a movement with their hyphy dance and going dumb.\n\n\n\nOne of the most influential elements of California is their stoner culture which Wayne brags about being on their level.", "annotation_id": "33385853", "url": "https://genius.com/33385853", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vans", "line": "Yeah, it’s Weezy Baby", "vault_lines": ["Weezy freestyles over the instrumental for Vans, originally by The Pack."], "meaning": "Wayne has many nicknames and monikers (as do most rappers).  One of them is “Weezy Baby”, perhaps a nod to Wayne’s former father figure and business partner Birdman, whose nickname is Baby, and Weezy often uses the “Baby” part of his name to make references, metaphors, and jokes in his lyrics.\n\nIn this case, his use of “baby” sets up the punchline that follows in the next line.  Weezy is a “baby” in his own way (due to his nickname), but he wants his girl to act like a “baby” a different way (by sucking on him), additionally, he calls the girl “baby” (which is a common nickname for a girl you’re intimate with).", "annotation_id": "7261690", "url": "https://genius.com/7261690", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vans", "line": "Young Money, Volume 1 Yeah LilWeezyAna Yeah DJ Raj Smoove, greatest DJ in the world Weezy F Baby, best rapper alive", "vault_lines": ["Young Money, Volume 1"], "meaning": "Weezy often likes to make albums or songs into series.  He conceptualizes many of his albums as connected with a common thread.  Recent examples include his Sorry 4 the Wait 2 mixtape, which is the second installment in his Sorry 4 the Wait series.\n\nBest known though, is his highly successful The Carter series of albums, with albums 1 through 4 being released to date (while 5 remains held up due to label issues).\n\nThis mixtape is the 1st (and so far, only) Volume in Wayne’s “LilWeezyAna” series, so Raj and Weezy use the opportunity of the song’s intro help contextualize it for the audience.", "annotation_id": "7240812", "url": "https://genius.com/7240812", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vans", "status": "done", "targets": 4, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-vans-lyrics", "genius_title": "Vans", "genius_id": 218978, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "That’s how it go, I need a fix, a nigga diagnose I need to fix this fuckin’ sickness before I explode", "vault_lines": ["That's how it go, I need a fix, a nigga diagnose"], "meaning": "Regardless of whomsoever is victim to his actions, Wayne is in a fiendish state and needs to satiate his needs before he suffers from withdrawal.", "annotation_id": "15461388", "url": "https://genius.com/15461388", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "My stomach hurtin’, palms itchin’ with a snotty nose Comin’ through your curtains, guns spittin’ aimin’ high and low", "vault_lines": ["My stomach hurtin', palms itchin' with a snotty nose"], "meaning": "Many users of cocaine and illegal distributors have been known to cut cocaine with laxatives inducing users to go relieve their bowels.\n\nWayne despite his hunger for cocaine and firearm baring itchy palm is focused on invading your home violently.", "annotation_id": "15461356", "url": "https://genius.com/15461356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Neighborhood jump like Geronimo", "vault_lines": ["Neighborhood jump like Geronimo"], "meaning": "Wayne makes the neighborhood “jump” with his music like they’re at a club listening to a club-jumper. Basically, they love him.\n\n“Thanks to a 1939 movie about Geronimo, US paratroopers traditionally shout \"Geronimo” to show they have no fear of jumping out of an airplane.“ - Wikipedia", "annotation_id": "6350792", "url": "https://genius.com/6350792", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "It’s YM , that’s my team, nigga, vámonos", "vault_lines": ["It's YM , that's my team, nigga, vámonos"], "meaning": "YM stands for Young Money which Lil' Wayne is the leader of, not to be confused with Cash Money Records. Young Money is a branch of Cash Money that includes Drake and Nicki Minaj. Cash money was started by Birdman and his brother, and now him and his “fellow label member, Lil' Wayne have beef because Birdman keeps delaying the drop of Lil' Wayne’s Tha Carter V. Wayne is probably going to sue Birdman for doing this and even went as far as to make his fans a mixtape apologizing for the wait on his album. Lil' Wayne says Young Money is his team in this song instead of Young Money Cash Money because he wants to leave Cash Money and Bring all Young Money members with him, and start his own label.\n\n\nHe also mentions a similar line here", "annotation_id": "5781881", "url": "https://genius.com/5781881", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "All I know is racks like Sabrina", "vault_lines": ["All I know is racks like Sabrina"], "meaning": "Triz is referring to a Sabrina type coat rack. Rack is also another term for women’s boobs. He is an expert on breasts.", "annotation_id": "5778388", "url": "https://genius.com/5778388", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Bitch pussy super wet it’s Aquifina", "vault_lines": ["Bitch pussy super wet it's Aquifina"], "meaning": "YT has turned on this girl and her vagina has became “wet”. He compares it to a bottle of water, Aquafina", "annotation_id": "5777942", "url": "https://genius.com/5777942", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "They tell its the codeine, I say “how you know?”", "vault_lines": ["They tell its the codeine, I say \"how you know?\""], "meaning": "Playing off the previously line, Wayne’s codeine consumption could be impairing him to function quicker than usual because of drug’s function slowing side effects.\n\nThis could be the main reason why Mr. Carter’s been getting those tickets as of late.", "annotation_id": "5469188", "url": "https://genius.com/5469188", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "My bitch pussy taste like Häagen-Dazs", "vault_lines": ["My bitch pussy taste like Häagen-Dazs"], "meaning": "Häagen-Dazs is an ice cream brand, established in 1961.\n\n\n\nSupposedly, Wayne’s girl tastes similar to ice cream during cunnilingus to which we could only imagine to be quite delightful!", "annotation_id": "5469162", "url": "https://genius.com/5469162", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Get the drank in the double cup, tryna drink it while it’s cold", "vault_lines": ["Get the drank in the double cup, tryna drink it while it's cold"], "meaning": "Wayne’s sippin' on some Lean – a Huston born drink that involves components such as Promethazine with Codeine, Sprite soda, and (for extra flavor) Jolly Rancher candy, which is usually found and sipped from stacked cups.", "annotation_id": "5469123", "url": "https://genius.com/5469123", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "And cops givin’ niggas tickets just for drivin’ slow", "vault_lines": ["And cops givin' niggas tickets just for drivin' slow"], "meaning": "Black Man vs Police\n\nWayne touches on the subject of unjust Police prosecution of African Americans, like a lot of other rappers these days. Ecpecially prosecuting them when they are doing nothing wrong, like driving to slow which isn’t a crime.\n\n\n\nIts also relates to the next bar’s mention of Codeine, Wayne’s favorite anesthetic. Codeine makes you slow.", "annotation_id": "5469026", "url": "https://genius.com/5469026", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Vamonos", "line": "Ballin’ since 94, feelin’ like a pot of gold", "vault_lines": ["Ballin' since 94, feelin' like a pot of gold"], "meaning": "Wayne has been in this game for a very longtime, he feels lucky to still be ballin after all these years in the Rap game. A pot of gold is a sign of luck, but also a sign of sudden wealth and success. His success has been going on for over 20 years.", "annotation_id": "5468987", "url": "https://genius.com/5468987", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
