{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "Keep a Hot Boy with me, I got love for BG The feds tryna lock me up like the BG", "vault_lines": ["Keep a Hot Boy with me, I got love for BG"], "meaning": "Here Lil Wayne is giving a shout to one of his former Hot Boys partner, BG. He goes on to say he got love for BG, which is not the first time. On the song “All Alone”, he said and I quote “There’s something about the Hot Boys that you don’t know, I got a lot of love for em' that I don’t show, And BG been my n**** since the front tho”\n\nBG was sentenced to 14 years in prison in 2012 for gun possession which is the same charges Weezy is facing.", "annotation_id": "21561535", "url": "https://genius.com/21561535", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "I went to the Middle East, came back with a Lamb’", "vault_lines": ["I went to the Middle East, came back with a Lamb'"], "meaning": "During “Drink Champs” interview Wayne address a story of which a Saudi prince gifting him a Franck Muller Watch and a Lamborghini as an apology !\n\nhttps://youtu.be/dR9fCy_y7T4", "annotation_id": "21483136", "url": "https://genius.com/21483136", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "Young Money, OVO", "vault_lines": ["Young Money, nigga, that's my DNA"], "meaning": "Young Money Entertainment is an American Record Label founded by Lil Wayne. OVO Sound is another American Record Label, founded by the Toronto native, Drake.\n\nDJ Khaled, the host of the No Ceilings 3 mixtape, decides to hint at the next track, “BB KING FREESTYLE”, which features Drake, by mentioning their labels, showcasing their talent whilst giving a glimpse of their celebrity status.", "annotation_id": "21472552", "url": "https://genius.com/21472552", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "Weighing my options, I feel like a whale My pockets on blubber", "vault_lines": ["Weighing my options, I feel like a whale"], "meaning": "Marine animals, especially whales, store their excess fat in the form of blubber. Essentially, Lil Wayne’s pockets are fat with bands similar to the blubber storage in a whale.", "annotation_id": "21467177", "url": "https://genius.com/21467177", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "[Chorus: Lil Wayne]", "vault_lines": ["Ayo, check this out, it's DJ Khaled"], "meaning": "Wayne interpolates the chorus and takes this track’s instrumental from Lil Baby & 42 Dugg’s 2020 hit single, “We Paid”:\n\nI’m rockin' with the Lions, yeah, I’m rocking with the Braves\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, we paid\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, we paid", "annotation_id": "21466576", "url": "https://genius.com/21466576", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "Fly your bitch to the beach, she come back with a tan", "vault_lines": ["Fly your bitch to the beach, she come back with a tan"], "meaning": "Wayne is known for his luxurious lifestyle, here he claims to fly “your bitch” to the beach, “your” here probably refers to his “opps” “enemies” or “haters”\n\nWayne goes further to say that she comes back with a tan, the beach is usually sunny so one is most likely to get tanned, Wayne could also mean that she comes back with another lady who happens to be a tan. Tan also mean a person with a darkened skin, Wayne has previously referred to women by their physically attributes as commonly done, e.g a Redhead, a Blonde e.t.c", "annotation_id": "21462572", "url": "https://genius.com/21462572", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "V8", "line": "I fuck her, then I tell her get lost like a tourist", "vault_lines": ["I fuck her, then I tell her get lost like a tourist"], "meaning": "Tourists tend to easily get lost since they are in an unfamiliar environment. Here, Weezy is telling his partner to leave him alone after they have sex.", "annotation_id": "21462523", "url": "https://genius.com/21462523", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
