{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "I’mma hold it down and blow up, the anchor is the missile", "vault_lines": ["I'mma hold it down and blow up, the anchor is the missile"], "meaning": "He’s gonna rep his city and still blow up to be internationally famous, which is challenging for rappers to appeal to a nationa wide/international audience when only talking about their own city. Hes doing something usually done by two different people, hence the Anchor is the Missile", "annotation_id": "2824166", "url": "https://genius.com/2824166", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "My inf’ aim proper", "vault_lines": [", my inf' aim proper"], "meaning": "inf' is short for an Infrared sight/scope on a gun, making targets easily visible in the dark.", "annotation_id": "2824138", "url": "https://genius.com/2824138", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Money over bitches period", "vault_lines": ["Money over bitches period"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne must feel the same as Ja Rule because he has M.O.B tattooed on his chest.", "annotation_id": "1790740", "url": "https://genius.com/1790740", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "When I say we got them brrrrrrrrrr! I ain’t tryin to whistle", "vault_lines": ["When I say we got them brrrrrrrrrr! I ain't tryin to whistle"], "meaning": "“Brrrrrrrrrrrr!” Is Birdman’s, Lil Wayne’s daddy, call. Birdman is the CEO of Cash Money records, where Wayne is signed to.\n\n\n\nSo Wayne isn’t trying to whistle he is trying to let you know Cash Money is in the building!\n\nThere is another possible meaning to this line though. When someone says Brrr it can be used to indicate they have a gun. Meaning, when Wayne says Brrr he isn’t whistling, he’s saying he’s strapped.", "annotation_id": "475974", "url": "https://genius.com/475974", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "I eat angels for dinner", "vault_lines": ["I eat angels for dinner"], "meaning": "A play on the previous line. One would believe devils eat angels. and hence are devil’s food because of the history between the two types of beings.", "annotation_id": "422405", "url": "https://genius.com/422405", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Flow sweet as devil’s food,", "vault_lines": ["Flow sweet as devil's food,"], "meaning": "“Flow” refers to a rappers ability to ride the beat, or maintain a nice, steady rhythm.\n\n“Devil’s food” in this line refers to Devil’s food cake, which is a very sweet cake.\n\n\n\n“Sweet” is often a term used to describe something that is very good, in this case it is Weezy’s flow. His flow is just as sweet (good) as Devil’s food cake (which is good as well), and that cake is very sweet!", "annotation_id": "422404", "url": "https://genius.com/422404", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Ya dig", "vault_lines": ["Cause they know we gettin' it, got money we takin' it"], "meaning": "After a wicked verse Wayne basically just wants to say:\n#Nah'Mean?", "annotation_id": "379652", "url": "https://genius.com/379652", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Murder Inc. nigga (Young Money just crept in like uh-ohhh!) Em-pire, em-pire! Heh...", "vault_lines": ["Uh-ohhh! Uh uh uh-ohhh! Uh-ohhh! Uh uh uh-ohhh!"], "meaning": "Ja Rule reps Murder Inc. (now known as “The Inc.”) and MPire records. Wayne started Young Money records, but this isn’t his song, it’s Ja Rule’s (even though Wayne killed his verse!). Wayne simply “crept in”.", "annotation_id": "369218", "url": "https://genius.com/369218", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "I’m ballin on the suckers and I won’t pick up my dribble", "vault_lines": ["I'm ballin on the suckers and I won't pick up my dribble"], "meaning": "Ballin is a the urban way of saying you’re living the good life. Wayne ties this in with when a basketball player doesn’t pick up their dribble. They just keep dominating their opponent. Wayne is saying he’s above all these other whack ass rappers and he won’t stop.", "annotation_id": "369206", "url": "https://genius.com/369206", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Long-body Maybach, it make me feel so little", "vault_lines": ["Long-body Maybach, it make me feel so little"], "meaning": "By the name, you can guess a Longbody Maybach is pretty big, plus, Wayne is only 5'6, so that makes it even easier to make him feel small.", "annotation_id": "369204", "url": "https://genius.com/369204", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Call me young Raekwon, I’m a Chef in Hell’s Kitchen", "vault_lines": ["Call me young Raekwon, I'm a Chef in Hell's Kitchen"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Wu-Tang club member Raekwon who released a mixtape called “Hells Kitchen” under the name Raekwon the Chef with Mobb Deep. He is also referring to the line above. He raises so much hell that he might as well be in hell.", "annotation_id": "369184", "url": "https://genius.com/369184", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Weezy F is in yo’ buildin, I will step, on yo’ buildin From the steps, of my buildin, raise hell, hell’s risen", "vault_lines": ["Weezy F is in yo' buildin, I will step, on yo' buildin"], "meaning": "When Wayne arrives to your location, he will act wildly and outrageous, or, will raise hell.", "annotation_id": "369183", "url": "https://genius.com/369183", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Uh-ohh! You did it; now, you gotta get it", "vault_lines": ["Uh-ohh! You did it; now, you gotta get it"], "meaning": "Weezy is most likely preparing us for this beast of a verse.", "annotation_id": "369171", "url": "https://genius.com/369171", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "Murder Inc. nigga", "vault_lines": ["Inc Gang nigga, young money Cash Money, collabo'"], "meaning": "Now known as The Inc. Records.", "annotation_id": "251226", "url": "https://genius.com/251226", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "So run and I will hit you like Jeremiah Trotter", "vault_lines": ["So run and I will hit you like Jeremiah Trotter"], "meaning": "Jeremiah Trotter is a former NFL player, and juding by his size, a hit from him could do some damage.\n\n\n\nRunning will result in the same damage from Wayne as it would from Trotter.", "annotation_id": "251223", "url": "https://genius.com/251223", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh-Ohhh!", "line": "I be stunt’n like my dada", "vault_lines": ["and I be stunt'n like my dada"], "meaning": "His Step-father (dada) is Birdman. Stuntin like my Daddy is the name of one of the songs they’ve done together.", "annotation_id": "251222", "url": "https://genius.com/251222", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
