{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Uh Oh (Original Version)", "line": "[Verse 2: Young Merc]", "vault_lines": ["Tch, let's get 'em"], "meaning": "Young Merc talked about this verse in a 2008 interview with MurderIncOnline\n\nMIO: Most recently you were on Uh-Oh with Rule and Wayne, how was that for you?\n\nMerc Montana: Actually, with that record, I had heard the beat and laid my verse, then rule came in and laid his and the hook. Then Gotti heard it and got Wayne on it and from there it just blew up. It was just crazy, it was overwhelming! But it was a great experience, it was a good record. A lot of people told me that it was better with me on it! (laughs)", "annotation_id": "31589054", "url": "https://genius.com/31589054", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
