{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m ahead of the game, I need a blowjob", "vault_lines": ["I'm ahead of the game, I need a blowjob"], "meaning": "Pun with “head” and “blowjob”.\n\nWayne is so ahead of the rap game that he needs to receive head (or a blowjob).", "annotation_id": "26329828", "url": "https://genius.com/26329828", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Her mouth, pussy, or asshole, life is full of hard decisions", "vault_lines": ["Her mouth, pussy, or asshole, life is full of hard decisions"], "meaning": "It’s a hard decision because it’s difficult choice and because he has to make the decision when his dick is hard.", "annotation_id": "15853012", "url": "https://genius.com/15853012", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m ahead of the game, I need a haircut", "vault_lines": ["I'm ahead of the game, I need a haircut"], "meaning": "Wayne keeps on the play with ahead and a head. To be ahead of the game comes with being the best, being on top. The phrase I need a haircut alluded to the rap game being a body, and Wayne is the uppermost part. Also, Wayne is infamous for his dreads.", "annotation_id": "10878999", "url": "https://genius.com/10878999", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Shout out to my nigga Mack gettin’ his boo on in that Ghost", "vault_lines": ["Shout out to my nigga Mack gettin' his boo on in that Ghost"], "meaning": "Apparently, Mack has recently bought a Rolls Royce Phantom Ghost\n\n\n\n“Boo” is an obvious play on the name of the car.", "annotation_id": "2811627", "url": "https://genius.com/2811627", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I know you want a pat on the back, but then those fools gon’ see you choke", "vault_lines": ["I know you want a pat on the back, but then those fools gon' see you choke"], "meaning": "Brilliant play on words from Weezy right here.\n\nPat on the back is a common idiom which means to congratulate someone or give them acknowledgment for an accomplishment.\n\n\n\nTaken literally you give someone a pat on the back if they’re choking on something to help them get rid of what’s causing blockage.\n\n\n\nChoke also means to struggle, or to be very nervous and panicky as in choking up.\n\nBy playing on both the literal and figurative meanings of pat on the back and the multiple definitions of choke, Lil Wayne is cleverly saying that other rappers or competitors are doing all that they can to keep up with him (which is an accomplishment), but they’re struggling as they do it, or close to choking by trying to keep up with him. And if Wayne congratulates them for just that, it’ll reveal how much of a struggle it is for them.", "annotation_id": "2727512", "url": "https://genius.com/2727512", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "And when I’m through ballin’ I coach", "vault_lines": ["and when I'm through ballin' I coach"], "meaning": "When athletes are done playing their sport and retire, they sometimes go on to be coaches.\n\nWayne is saying that once he’s done balling (getting money, rapping, etc.), he’s going to focus on coaching his proteges and making sure they have a successful career like he did.\n\n\n\nHe’s done a pretty good job with Drake and Nicki so far…", "annotation_id": "2712345", "url": "https://genius.com/2712345", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I got animal all in my floor", "vault_lines": ["I got animal all in my floor"], "meaning": "Tunechi’s floor is nicely decorated with some animal rugs, so you better take your shoes off when you enter(see next line)", "annotation_id": "2628640", "url": "https://genius.com/2628640", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m looking for that loud pack, weedman bring the noise, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I'm looking for that loud pack, weedman bring the noise, yeah"], "meaning": "Loud is a slang term used to describe good weed. Here, Wayne uses noise as a more obscure way of asking for some tree.\n\nAye, Wayne i got that…", "annotation_id": "2225101", "url": "https://genius.com/2225101", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Twisted like french braids", "vault_lines": [", twisted like french braids"], "meaning": "A french braid is a twisted braid.\n\n\n\nTo be “twisted” is also used to describe being high and drunk at the same time.", "annotation_id": "2222249", "url": "https://genius.com/2222249", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Niggas be lukewarm at the most", "vault_lines": ["Niggas be lukewarm at the most"], "meaning": "Other rappers are only lukewarm at best, while we all know that Wayne is a Hot Boy.", "annotation_id": "2181157", "url": "https://genius.com/2181157", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "MLK would be proud of me, ’cause I do this shit for all my niggas", "vault_lines": ["MLK would be proud of me, 'cause I do this shit for all my niggas"], "meaning": "Martin Luther King, Jr. was an American clergyman, activist, and leader in the African-American Civil Rights Movement. He was most known for (in a nutshell) trying to give African Americans the same rights as whites at the time.\n\nHe did it for (in Lil Waynes line) niggas, to put it bluntly.\n\nLil Wayne balls and stunts and makes music for all his niggas, so MLK would be proud of him.", "annotation_id": "2175902", "url": "https://genius.com/2175902", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m high like Bonjour", "vault_lines": ["I'm high like Bonjour"], "meaning": "Bonjour = Hi (In French)\n\nHe uses “High” as a homophone. Very clever.", "annotation_id": "2175884", "url": "https://genius.com/2175884", "state": "accepted", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Used to hug the block, I mean bear hug", "vault_lines": ["Used to hug the block, I mean bear hug"], "meaning": "Wayne used to be on the block all the time when he was younger, selling drugs and doing enforcement. To “hug the block” is to constantly be on your grind, and to “bear hug” something is to wrap it up, i.e. Wayne put a lot of work in on his block.", "annotation_id": "2173484", "url": "https://genius.com/2173484", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Yeah, my weed good, my sex better", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, my weed good, my sex better"], "meaning": "As he said in his Playboy Interview :\n\n Umm, “some say the ex makes the sex spectacular….” That’s my answer to that. When a woman says, “Can’t we get something?” or “Gimme something to drink?” I say, “I don’t want you to be high because tomorrow you’re not gonna know that it felt that great. You kinda negated some of that by being intoxicated.” So I always tell the woman I am the ultimate high. I am the drug.", "annotation_id": "2170645", "url": "https://genius.com/2170645", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Future fuck with me!", "vault_lines": ["Future fuck with me!"], "meaning": "Future sang the chorus to the original “U.O.E.N.O.”", "annotation_id": "2167701", "url": "https://genius.com/2167701", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "What up, 5?", "vault_lines": ["Niggas feed these bitches lies, nigga, don't food poison my ho"], "meaning": "A salute to Birdman, aka the “5 Star Stunna”", "annotation_id": "2166459", "url": "https://genius.com/2166459", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "My niggas like Lou Rawls with that blow", "vault_lines": [", my niggas like Lou Rawls with that blow"], "meaning": "Lou Rawls, is a famous singer and voice actor, who has sold more than 40 million records and has spawned numerous top charting songs such as,“Love is a Hurtin' Thing.” Here Wayne is saying that his man has high quality cocaine and is selling it in large numbers.", "annotation_id": "2166292", "url": "https://genius.com/2166292", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Young sex pistol", "vault_lines": ["Lil Tunechi Li, young sex pistol"], "meaning": "Sex Pistols are a punk band that formed in London in 1975.\n\n\n\nLil Wayne is saying that he is living the life of a rock star with his lifestyle full of sex and drugs. And of course, the pistols he has are real guns.", "annotation_id": "2165807", "url": "https://genius.com/2165807", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Rocko fuck with me!", "vault_lines": ["Rocko fuck with me!"], "meaning": "UOENO was originally a song by the rapper Rocko.", "annotation_id": "2165770", "url": "https://genius.com/2165770", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Yeah, only selling work to them workaholics", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, only selling work to them workaholics"], "meaning": "Work are drugs that are sold for money.\n\n\n\nHe is only selling to people who are serious about making money and hard-working dealers.", "annotation_id": "2165754", "url": "https://genius.com/2165754", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I blues your bitch ass, hope somebody give you rhythm", "vault_lines": ["I blues your bitch ass, hope somebody give you rhythm"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is saying he will kill you, and your body will turn blue because blood no longer circulates, kinda late to give you CPR or rythm (heartbeat).\n\n\n\nAlso referring to the music genre, R N'B: “rhythm & blues”", "annotation_id": "2165712", "url": "https://genius.com/2165712", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m still coming off the top of the dome but it’d be on a tombstone if I wrote, Tunechi", "vault_lines": ["I'm still coming off the top of the dome but it'd be on a tombstone if I wrote"], "meaning": "To be coming off the top of the dome is a slang phrase that means to freestyle. The definition of freestyle varies from artist to artist. Some consider it to be the act of reciting pre-memorized lines, but most consider it to be spontaneously rapping by creating the lyrics as you speak.\n\nWayne’s definition of off the top of the dome is unique in that he creates his lyrics as he records the song, but without the help of writing them down. This vid provides a better understanding of Wayne’s creative process:\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kWDxE1_J27k\n\nWayne is stating that he is still creating his lyrics without a pen and pad, but if he decided to start writing, it would be on a tombstone; in other words, he would kill it.", "annotation_id": "2163185", "url": "https://genius.com/2163185", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Niggas be sayin’ they racked up, don’t let that Q-ball leave you broke", "vault_lines": ["Niggas be sayin' they racked up, don't let that Q-ball leave you broke"], "meaning": "“Racked up” means that someone has a lot of money, however it can also refer to a rack of balls in Pool. The Q-ball is the white ball that breaks (separates) the other balls from each other, so the Q-ball breaks, and leaves you broke.", "annotation_id": "2163051", "url": "https://genius.com/2163051", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I woke up this morning, dick rock hard, dick harder than a armadillo", "vault_lines": ["I woke up this morning, dick rock hard, dick harder than a armadillo"], "meaning": "Wayne shouts out Mystikal as he quotes his rhymes from his old song “That Nigga Aint Shit”, from Mystikals first album, The Mind of Mystikal…\n\n“I woke up this morning dick rock hard, had to piss so bad that shit made me say Good Lord.  Dick harder than a armadillo, so I went to the bathroom and I drained the little fellow”", "annotation_id": "2162960", "url": "https://genius.com/2162960", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’ma ball, like Crystal", "vault_lines": [", I'ma ball, like Crystal"], "meaning": "To ball means to stunt heavily.\n\nPlay on words with a crystal ball.", "annotation_id": "2162832", "url": "https://genius.com/2162832", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Yeah, if you got a problem, I’m Einstein", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, if you got a problem, I'm Einstein"], "meaning": "Albert Einstein was a German-born theoretical physicist. While best known for his mass–energy equivalence formula E = mc2, and his theory of relativity. He received the 1921 Nobel Prize in Physics. He was so smart, he seemingly could solve anything.\n\n\n\nLike Einstein, if you have a problem, Weezy can solve it.", "annotation_id": "2162827", "url": "https://genius.com/2162827", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Hoes want this scud missile", "vault_lines": ["Hoes want this scud missile"], "meaning": "A scud missile is a series of tactical ballistic missiles developed by the Soviet Union during the Cold War.\n\nLil Wayne is comparing his penis to a scud missile, which is long and phallus-shaped.", "annotation_id": "2162622", "url": "https://genius.com/2162622", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m hard-headed, Ocho, Dedication Cinco, uh", "vault_lines": ["I'm hard-headed, Ocho, Dedication Cinco"], "meaning": "Chad Johnson (formerly known as Chad Ochocinco) head butted his wife.\n\n\n\n“Ocho” also sets up the next line “Ochocinco”.\n\nIt’s a also a wordplay with the name of the mixtape: Dedication 5.", "annotation_id": "2162306", "url": "https://genius.com/2162306", "state": "accepted", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Uh, I’m flying private through Cloud 9", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I'm flying private through Cloud 9"], "meaning": "Cloud nine is a term used to describe  complete bliss or euphoria.\n\nWayne is smoking some very good weed so he’s on cloud 9\n\n\n\nWayne could also be speaking literally about flying with his private plane", "annotation_id": "2162138", "url": "https://genius.com/2162138", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Got guns bigger than you, nigga, I don’t fuck with new niggas", "vault_lines": ["Got guns bigger than you, nigga, I don't fuck with new niggas"], "meaning": "Tunechi thinks that all these new rappers are lame and small (next to him), so he does not hang out with them.\n\n\n\nHe also says that his guns have more meaning then his competition and enemies.", "annotation_id": "2162044", "url": "https://genius.com/2162044", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "My niggas like Kanye with that good", "vault_lines": ["My niggas like Kanye with that good"], "meaning": "Double Entendre\n\n\nWayne is saying that his niggas got that good weed. Also playing on the name of Kanye West’s record label, which is called G.O.O.D. Music.\nWayne is saying his YMCMB counterparts, make and have good music the same way Kanye does.", "annotation_id": "2161901", "url": "https://genius.com/2161901", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "I’m working that graveyard shift, man, these niggas been dead", "vault_lines": ["I'm working that graveyard shift, man, these niggas been dead"], "meaning": "Wayne has been up working the graveyard shift (late night labor), writing songs to kill the rappers he hasn’t already.\n\n\n\nNotice the play on graveyard and dead?\n\nThis is also a clever play on Michael Jackson’s song and music video for “Thriller”, which took place in a graveyard. All of the background dancers were supposed to be dead people, so this ties back nicely to Wayne stating he feels like MJ", "annotation_id": "2161862", "url": "https://genius.com/2161862", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "U.O.E.N.O.", "line": "Uh, my cologne illegal in nine countries", "vault_lines": ["Uh, my cologne illegal in nine countries"], "meaning": "Wayne’s cologne of course is loud, or marijuana which leaves a scent. It is illegal in many countries.\n\nAlso Wayne is making a reference to the Sex Panther cologne from the movie Anchorman which is illegal in nine countries.", "annotation_id": "2161664", "url": "https://genius.com/2161664", "state": "accepted", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
