{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "(G.D.O.D!)", "vault_lines": ["That shit ain't hot, we out here poppin' that's all I can say (G.D.O.D!)"], "meaning": "Stands for Get Dough Or Die, which was the name of the mixtape by Hustle Gang, a group of artists signed to T.I.’s Grand Hustle Records", "annotation_id": "2165179", "url": "https://genius.com/2165179", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
