{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "My bitch been fussin’ at me about nothin’ Ain’t no tellin’ what she’d do if I replace her Like bae, I’m straight, there’s plenty fish and I’m bait", "vault_lines": ["My bitch been fussin' at me about nothin'"], "meaning": "Wayne plays with the phrase “there’s plenty fish in the sea” by telling his girl she better stop being a pain in his ass because he will dump her and still be good. He can find another girl (as bait finds a fish)\n\n\n\nAt the end of the day though, Wayne really just wants every girl in the world.", "annotation_id": "2162965", "url": "https://genius.com/2162965", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "I hope that ho don’t call sayin’ her cycle late", "vault_lines": ["I hope that ho don't call sayin' her cycle late"], "meaning": "Wayne hopes that after he has sex with this girl, she won’t call him back saying her menstrual cycle is late. This usually means that she is pregnant and Wayne was just fooling around with her, he doesn’t want any kids. In fact, he already has enough as is:\n\n\n\nWayne has previously referred to this as the “I think I’m late” text", "annotation_id": "2162263", "url": "https://genius.com/2162263", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "And it’s 6-6-2's Piru all day, my nigga", "vault_lines": ["And it's 6-6-2's Piru all day, my nigga"], "meaning": "Wayne runs with the 662 Piru Gang (Bloods) aka the M.O.B. (he’s even got it tatted)\n\n6-6-2 on a phone spells out M-O-B", "annotation_id": "2162249", "url": "https://genius.com/2162249", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "I wax that ass, she make that Mr. Miyagi face", "vault_lines": ["I wax that ass, she make that Mr. Miyagi face"], "meaning": "The use of “wax” here is purposeful.  In The Karate Kid, Mr. Miyagi taught his karate student Daniel the motions of how to block a punch by having him wax a car\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fULNUr0rvEc\n\nWayne fucks this girl (wax that ass) until she orgasms\n\nIn the original, RichHomie Quan says\n\nWhen I get to biting on her ear she make that Tyson face", "annotation_id": "2162211", "url": "https://genius.com/2162211", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "It’s curtains for these niggas I feel like some drapes", "vault_lines": ["It's curtains for these niggas I feel like some drapes"], "meaning": "The idiom “it’s curtains” means that something will come to an end. Drapes are window coverings similar to curtains, so Tunechi is the reason that it’s over for these niggas", "annotation_id": "2162181", "url": "https://genius.com/2162181", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "Hustle Gang, bang, green mean, anybody get it Anything we’ll do for the paper", "vault_lines": ["Hustle Gang, bang, green mean, anybody get it"], "meaning": "Grand Hustle Records aka Hustle Gang Music is T.I.’s record label. Him and the rest of his label-mates are all about getting money, they’ll do whatever to get that cheddar", "annotation_id": "2161887", "url": "https://genius.com/2161887", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "And we smokin’ on that gas, pass it like “excuse you”", "vault_lines": ["And we smokin' on that gas, pass it like \"excuse you\""], "meaning": "They’re passing a blunt around after taking a hit out of it (gas = weed)\n\nTo “pass gas” means to fart, which lines up with Wayne calling the weed in the blunt “gas”", "annotation_id": "2161733", "url": "https://genius.com/2161733", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "I be shittin’ on these niggas, like I’m sippin’ Metamucil", "vault_lines": ["I be shittin' on these niggas, like I'm sippin' Metamucil"], "meaning": "Yet another in the seemingly endless stream of Wayne “shit” puns.  This one is still our all-time favorite", "annotation_id": "2161670", "url": "https://genius.com/2161670", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "She throw it at me like I’m just one strike away", "vault_lines": ["She throw it at me like I'm just one strike away"], "meaning": "In baseball, when it’s a two strike count the pitcher tends to pull out the stinky cheese (best pitch in the arsenal) and go right at the batter to try and strike them out.\n\nWayne’s girl is throwing herself at him quicker than a pitcher trying to strike out a batter in baseball.", "annotation_id": "2161604", "url": "https://genius.com/2161604", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "Bitch it’s my life, my life, my life shout out Mary J", "vault_lines": ["Bitch it's my life, my life, my life shout out Mary J"], "meaning": "Reference to Mary J Blige’s single and second studio album.\n\n\n\nWayne could also possibly be referring to one of the nicknames of the drug marijuana, which is known as ‘Mary Jane’ or ‘Mary J’. Since his girl told him to stop drinking in the previous line, he goes the extra mile and tells her that he can drink and smoke as much as he wants. After all, it’s his life, his life, his life.", "annotation_id": "2161597", "url": "https://genius.com/2161597", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "These niggas chicken and I’ve never seen a chicken fly", "vault_lines": ["These niggas chicken and I've never seen a chicken fly"], "meaning": "Calling someone a “chicken” means they’re scared. If you’re scared, you’re certainly not cool or “fly”. You’re also not going to get far in life without taking chances and flying.\n\nChickens also can’t fly, or at least not high at all", "annotation_id": "2161569", "url": "https://genius.com/2161569", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Typa Way", "line": "They say numbers don’t lie, she shaped like a 8", "vault_lines": ["They say numbers don't lie, she shaped like a 8"], "meaning": "Curvy women have a body that’s shaped like an 8 (big boobs, small waste, fat ass)\n\n\n\n“They” would be Jay Z who says\n\nNumbers don’t lie, check the scoreboard\n\nThe phrase basically means that what you’re saying has to be true because numbers don’t lie (usually stated in a braggadocio manner)", "annotation_id": "2161553", "url": "https://genius.com/2161553", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
