{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Chasin’ a leopard (Pew)", "vault_lines": ["Sometimes the paper chase could be like chasin' a leopard (Pew)"], "meaning": "Most likely a reference to Bringing Up Baby, The film tells the story of a paleontologist in a number of predicaments involving a scatterbrained heiress and a leopard named Baby.", "annotation_id": "17531947", "url": "https://genius.com/17531947", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Pay me no mind but I don’t have change (What?)", "vault_lines": ["Pay me no mind but I don't have change (What?)"], "meaning": "A quote for the Wayniac.\n\n1.Pay me no mind = Ignore.\n\n\nChange = Monetary change, following a payment.\n\n\n\nHowever, by the word “pay”, there is something that has to be given for. In this case, attention.\n\nHe could have all of your attention and you could have all your expectations of him (“Pay me”), but he would never act on your behalf or to surpass your expectations (actual “change”), but for his own benefit.\n\nhttp://vignette4.wikia.nocookie.net/heinpedie/images/e/ea/Lil-wayne-strip-club-50k-dollar-bills-funny-faces-3.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140802181035\n\nLastly, as “1. Pay me no mind”, he is actually telling you to ignore him, because he has nothing to return (2. Change + expectation of return).\n\n\n\nFuck You, Pay Me!", "annotation_id": "11151051", "url": "https://genius.com/11151051", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Life, death, love, hate, pleasure, pain (What?)", "vault_lines": ["Life, death, love, hate, pleasure, pain (What?)"], "meaning": "Like positive and negative numbers, life is a paradox.", "annotation_id": "11151049", "url": "https://genius.com/11151049", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
