{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Cut our ears off, ain’t shit you could tell us (Nah)", "vault_lines": ["Cut our ears off, ain't shit you could tell us (Nah)"], "meaning": "Wayne doesn’t want to hear about what a hater has to say, so much so that he’s tempted to permanently lose his hearing on some Van Gogh shit", "annotation_id": "2231442", "url": "https://genius.com/2231442", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
