{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "It’s like tug-of-war, tryna pull myself together", "vault_lines": ["It's like tug-of-war, tryna pull myself together"], "meaning": "Tug-of-war is a metaphorical and literal phrase that describes a struggle in which both opposing sides are forcefully headed in different directions.\n\nA part of Wayne wants to pull himself together (composure/sobriety) but at the same time, his libra side wants the opposite.", "annotation_id": "348437", "url": "https://genius.com/348437", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "If you’re scared, go to church;", "vault_lines": ["If you're scared, go to church;"], "meaning": "Ice Cube & Snoop Dogg once said this. http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9t41oSMD6vc\n\n2Pac had this line in “Ratha Be Ya Nigga” first.", "annotation_id": "336814", "url": "https://genius.com/336814", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Shoot so many times, I’ma choke off the gunsmoke (Brrt)", "vault_lines": ["Shoot so many times, I'ma choke off the gunsmoke (Brrt)"], "meaning": "A gun can smoke when its fired off many times in succession.\n\n\n\nThis may also be a play on “shooting” during sex. Weezy’s saying either he or she “blow” so many times they choke off the  (metaphorical) gunsmoke.\n\nACCEPTED COMMENT: Big L used a similar line in Street Struck :\n\nIt ain’t a dumb joke, listen to this young folk\n Cause where I’m from – you can choke from the gunsmoke", "annotation_id": "336517", "url": "https://genius.com/336517", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Two Shots", "line": "Money over Bitches, M.O.B, Goodfellas (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Money over Bitches, M.O.B, Goodfellas (Yeah)"], "meaning": "The film “GoodFellas” is about a mob/Mafia family. Weezy makes a play on words by alluding to the abbreviation of M.O.B actually meaning ‘MOB’.", "annotation_id": "336473", "url": "https://genius.com/336473", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
