{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tuxedo", "line": "Don’t care who these rappers are That shit sound like salad bars", "vault_lines": ["That shit sound like salad bars"], "meaning": "Other rappers do not lyrically impress Wayne. He equates their bars to a salad bar, a double entendre on the word “bar”, a line of rap lyrics, and “word salad”, a collection of words sloppily thrown together in a disorganized manner.", "annotation_id": "31768536", "url": "https://genius.com/31768536", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
