{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "I wish we were both single like a couple dollars", "vault_lines": ["I wish we were both single like a couple dollars"], "meaning": "Couple dollars.\n2 dollars.\nTwo one-dollar bills.\n\nWayne is saying he wishes they weren’t tied to other people, and states he wishes they could both be single, as if they were both one dollar bills, or singular dollars, so they could be together.\n\nHere’s a dollar bill.", "annotation_id": "1074128", "url": "https://genius.com/1074128", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "That pussy feel new But we been fucking way before I went to Rikers Island", "vault_lines": ["That pussy feel new"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne was charged with illegal gun possession in ‘06, but the actual sentencing and punishment didn’t happen until around March ‘2010, at which point he went to Riker’s", "annotation_id": "1074127", "url": "https://genius.com/1074127", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "And shawty be like This pussy for you I ask her is it true? And she say like a horseshoe", "vault_lines": ["And shawty be like"], "meaning": "True to my religion, 2 everything I’m too different\n\nThe horse shoe is the branding on the back of True Religion jeans and denim products.", "annotation_id": "1074122", "url": "https://genius.com/1074122", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "I ain’t got no worries, no Frank Ocean I’m straight", "vault_lines": ["I ain't got no worries, no Frank Ocean I'm straight"], "meaning": "Frank Ocean came out of the closet in July, in an open letter on Tumblr.\n\nSome speculate this is a shot at Frank Ocean, and Wayne’s received a lot of flak for this.", "annotation_id": "1073760", "url": "https://genius.com/1073760", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "I say come and eat this bone and stop eating dog food", "vault_lines": ["I say come and eat this bone and stop eating dog food"], "meaning": "Bone.\nBoner.\nHard on.\nErection.\n\nWayne uses wordplay and likens his girl to a dog, so instead of wasting time on the sub-par ‘dog food,’ or other guys, she should get the actual treat, or Wayne’s ‘bone.’\n\nHere’s a dog bone.", "annotation_id": "1073751", "url": "https://genius.com/1073751", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "Tunechi", "vault_lines": ["Tunechi, tell 'em I'm straight"], "meaning": "“My nickname is Lil Tune — my grandmother named me that. She’s passed. My grandmother, her name was Mercedes Carter. She named me Lil Tune. We just threw the ‘Chi’ on there. Like Gucci, I say ‘Tunechi!’”\n\n~Lil Wayne", "annotation_id": "1073729", "url": "https://genius.com/1073729", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "She lay me on my back and ride this dick like “vroom”", "vault_lines": ["She lay me on my back and ride this dick like \"vroom\""], "meaning": "Before automatic transmissions became standard someone always had to ride with their legs straddling the gear shift in a manual car, and thus it was called ‘riding stick’.\n\nSo when Weezy’s girl ‘rides stick,’ she be straddling Wayne’s gear shift, if you catch my drift.", "annotation_id": "1073700", "url": "https://genius.com/1073700", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "She got that nigga name covered that’s a war wound", "vault_lines": ["She got that nigga name covered that's a war wound"], "meaning": "Covers up a tatt of her current/previous man’s name.\n\nThis is like a ‘war wound’, in the fact that a war wound is generally patched up and covered up, and it hurts. So just like a covered up war wound, her tattoo is covered, because it’s just a reminder that Lil Wayne can’t have the girl he loves because she’s already with another man, and vice versa.", "annotation_id": "1073693", "url": "https://genius.com/1073693", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "That dick make her feel retarded She say I make her feel special", "vault_lines": ["That dick make her feel retarded"], "meaning": "Double entendre:\n\n1\n\n\n\nWhen she feels ‘special,’ it refers back to the previous line. Special like special ed, or special education, which refers to mentally handicapped peoples, or retarded people.\n\n2\n\n\n\nBut the second one it’s like math.\nIt refers to two previous lines:\n\nAnd me I’m purple kush forever\nI’m purple drank forever\n\nWayne=Lean\nWayne=Weed\n\nWayne(Dick)= weed – make her feel retarded\nWayne=lean – make her feel special\n\nIt’s about the mixed feelings you get when you are an addicted. Sometimes you feel like a douchebag, but sometimes you fell on top of the world.", "annotation_id": "1073680", "url": "https://genius.com/1073680", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "And me I’m purple kush forever", "vault_lines": ["And me I'm purple kush forever"], "meaning": "Purple kush is just another strain of Cannabis, and is purplish in color.", "annotation_id": "1073675", "url": "https://genius.com/1073675", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Turn On the Lights", "line": "I’m purple drank forever", "vault_lines": ["I'm purple drank forever"], "meaning": "Codeine and Sprite, infamously known as Wayne’s favourite drink.\n\n\n\nSecond possible Dave Chappelle reference.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UayQTu2kH-U", "annotation_id": "1073654", "url": "https://genius.com/1073654", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
