{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tunechi Rollin’", "line": "T, roll another one", "vault_lines": ["T, roll another one"], "meaning": "From this lyric up to ‘’…..suck a nigga dick or somethin', Lil Wayne utilises a similar flow and rhyme scheme to the one we would hear on the second track of 2012’s Dedication 4, ‘Same Damn Tune’\n\n‘'Yeah, Scooby got another one, smokin’ on that bubble gum\nTwo dutch bitches, double dutch, I’m the shit, bubble guts\nNigga get your duffles up, don’t know if it’s love or lust\nTell that ho to suck it up, she got lips like rubber ducks…..‘’", "annotation_id": "36093114", "url": "https://genius.com/36093114", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
