{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tunechi Rollin’", "line": "Hold up; Click-clack! Okay, I’m reloaded", "vault_lines": ["Hold up; Click-clack! Okay, I'm reloaded"], "meaning": "On the previous track Tunechi’s Back, Wayne raps “And I brought them twins with me, nigga, Click and Clack”. It seems as if he still has the aforementioned weapons and they are now reloaded after using them in the previous track.", "annotation_id": "27396652", "url": "https://genius.com/27396652", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
