{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Trust Fund", "line": "Walkin’ ’round with the .9 like I’m Drew Brees (Brees)", "vault_lines": ["Walkin' 'round with the .9 like I'm Drеw Brees (Brees)"], "meaning": "The “nine” refers to a semi-automatic pistol that uses a 9mm bullet. It shouldn’t be a surprise that the rapper frequently carries weapons on him, as he was charged with weapon & ammunition possession in late 2020.\n\nLil Wayne references former NFL quarterback Drew Brees who wore the #9 jersey for his entire 20 season career with the San Diego Chargers (2001-2005) and the New Orleans Saints (2006-2020).", "annotation_id": "24173432", "url": "https://genius.com/24173432", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
