{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tomorrow", "line": "And I’m the BM J.R., the hood come running when they hear that bird call", "vault_lines": ["And I'm the BM J.R., the hood come running when they hear that bird call"], "meaning": "He is the Birdman Junior, another nickname out of his many nicknames.\n\nAlso, there is a track called BM J.R. on his first Tha Carter album.", "annotation_id": "4164274", "url": "https://genius.com/4164274", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
