{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "To The Bank", "line": "And I walk on the moon, it’s like carpet to Tune", "vault_lines": ["And I walk on the moon, it's like carpet to Tune"], "meaning": "Normally walking on the moon is seen as something that’s unachievable for people, however for Wayne, it’s just like walking on carpet and theres nothing special about doing something so crazy.", "annotation_id": "29677388", "url": "https://genius.com/29677388", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "To The Bank", "line": "I walk out the bank like the men’s room", "vault_lines": ["I walk out the bank like the men's room"], "meaning": "This line refers to the ease of walking out the mens room and how when he walks out of the bank its with the same nonchalantness.\n\nBasically, he’s taking care of business", "annotation_id": "29677369", "url": "https://genius.com/29677369", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "To The Bank", "line": "My pockets so fat, they hemorrhagin’ Damn, that’s an injury", "vault_lines": ["My pockets so fat, they hemorrhagin'"], "meaning": "The definition of a hemorrhage is an escape of blood from a ruptured blood vessel. Wayne has that much money in his pockets, they’re overflowing. He’s relating the blood that spills out of you from a hemorrhage to having too much money in his pocket.", "annotation_id": "29672205", "url": "https://genius.com/29672205", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "To The Bank", "line": "I got paper like I’m a tribune", "vault_lines": ["I got paper like I'm a tribune"], "meaning": "Tribune refers to newspaper company names, for example “The Chicago Tribune\"", "annotation_id": "29669961", "url": "https://genius.com/29669961", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
