{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Time for Us to Fuck", "line": "Girl I wanna love you long like Eva", "vault_lines": ["Girl I wanna love you long like Eva"], "meaning": "Reference to actress Eva Longoria; whose last name obviously has the word “long” in it.", "annotation_id": "2849050", "url": "https://genius.com/2849050", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Time for Us to Fuck", "line": "I’ll throw that dick much deeper Come be my wide receiver", "vault_lines": ["I'll throw that dick much deeper"], "meaning": "From baseball straight to American football, Wayne sure does love his sporting idioms.\n\nA wide receiver is a position in American/Canadian football that specialize in pass-catching and agile physical play.\n\n\n\nWayne’s throwing his sex deep into the girl and she’s and she’s skilled and agile enough to catch or handle it.", "annotation_id": "2584221", "url": "https://genius.com/2584221", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Time for Us to Fuck", "line": "That banana like Chiquita", "vault_lines": ["That banana like Chiquita"], "meaning": "Chiquita Brands International Inc. is an American producer and distributor of bananas and other produce.\n\n\n\nChiquita are passionate about their bananas and according to Wayne, this girl’s passionate about his banana too.", "annotation_id": "2584211", "url": "https://genius.com/2584211", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
