{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throw It In The Bag", "line": "I go fishing in it, and I ain’t a Pisces", "vault_lines": ["I go fishing in it, and I ain't a Pisces"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne was born on September 27th, making him a Libra\n\nAlso, Pisces is often associated with fish", "annotation_id": "28758", "url": "https://genius.com/28758", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throw It In The Bag", "line": "Give her dope dick; now, she under the sedation", "vault_lines": ["Give her dope dick; now, she under the sedation"], "meaning": "Double Entendre Alert!\n\n\nWayne’s bed game is so good, his girl feels completely relaxed\nWhen you do heroin and have sex, you get some mean wood", "annotation_id": "25962", "url": "https://genius.com/25962", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throw It In The Bag", "line": "Stop playing, bitch, we balling like Okafor", "vault_lines": ["Stop playing, bitch, we balling like Okafor"], "meaning": "Emeka Okafor\n\nEmeka now balls for the New Orleans Hornets, which is explains why Weezy mentions him.", "annotation_id": "22383", "url": "https://genius.com/22383", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
