{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throw It In The Bag", "line": "I love to hit it backwards: call it Pig Latin", "vault_lines": ["I love to hit it backwards: call it Pig Latin"], "meaning": "Pig latin is a language game where the onset of the first syllable is transposed to the end of the word. Not exactly reversing the word like Lil Wayne implies, but still a clever line", "annotation_id": "20627", "url": "https://genius.com/20627", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
