{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throat Baby", "line": "I like big pussy on some soprano shit", "vault_lines": ["I like big pussy on somе soprano shit"], "meaning": "Wayne is using a play on words to describe his love for plus-size women. “Big Pussy” Bonpensiero is the name of the character played by Vincent Pastore in the popular mafia crime TV show The Sopranos.\n\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/villains/images/b/b6/Big_Pussy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200628160901", "annotation_id": "21675429", "url": "https://genius.com/21675429", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Throat Baby", "line": "Ooh, you a angel, swallow the cum and say, “Thank you,” I say, “De nada, mi amore”", "vault_lines": ["Ooh, you a angel, swallow the cum and say, \"Thank you,\" I say, \"De nada, mi amore\""], "meaning": "“De nada” is a Spanish expression meaning “you’re welcome,” while “mi amore” is Italian for “my love.” Lil Wayne’s bilingual response is most likely used to demonstrate the uncertainty of a foreign broad’s ethnic background.", "annotation_id": "21651350", "url": "https://genius.com/21651350", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
