{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thought I Was Gonna Stop (Remix)", "line": "Used to shoot groupies, now I shoot movies And try to stay away from the Mickey Mouses and Goofys", "vault_lines": ["Used to shoot groupies, now I shoot movies"], "meaning": "Remy Ma was sentenced to eight years in prison for shooting and wounding an acquaintance after discovering money was missing from her purse after a night out in Manhattan.\n\nSince her release she has starred in a variety of TV shows like ‘Queen of the South’ and appeared in movies like  ‘American Gangster Presents: Big Fifty – The Delronda Hood Story’.", "annotation_id": "24793014", "url": "https://genius.com/24793014", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
