{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "Got me feelin’ like Missy (Hey), ’cause she all in my grill (Yo)", "vault_lines": ["Got me feelin' like Missy (Hey), 'cause she all in my grill (Yo)"], "meaning": "Here, Mack Maine references Missy Elliott’s 1998 hit single “All N My Grill” featuring a rap verse by Big Boi on the original version or by MC Solaar on the remix version, and ad-libs by Nicole Wray.", "annotation_id": "27965295", "url": "https://genius.com/27965295", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "With one foot off I still try to escape But, who can I run to (Who can I?) like Xscape? (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["With one foot off I still try to escape"], "meaning": "Kidd Kidd plays on the title of the 1979 song “Who Can I Run To” by the Jones Girls which was famously covered by R&B group Xscape in 1995.", "annotation_id": "27964685", "url": "https://genius.com/27964685", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "Now, I get him rockier than the cavemen I deep-deep, I deep throat it ’til it cave in", "vault_lines": ["Now, I get him rockier than the cavemen"], "meaning": "A little caveman wordplay.\nNicki gets her man rock hard.\nCavemen live in caves which when broken into pieces creates rocks. When Nicki puts his penis all the way in her mouth he cums or caves in.", "annotation_id": "9309607", "url": "https://genius.com/9309607", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "I’m such a maniac (Uh, kyuh), lemme get some brainiac You know that special head (Uh) like I’m in special ed (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm such a maniac (Uh, kyuh), lemme get some brainiac"], "meaning": "Nicki is known to be bizarre, outlandish, and very much a maniac. Brain is slang for head.\n\nManiac Nicki…", "annotation_id": "2395975", "url": "https://genius.com/2395975", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "Uh, you know you like that (Kyuh) Now put ya-put ya ring on, where ya wife at? (Huh?) The Mistress", "vault_lines": ["Uh, you know you like that (Kyuh)"], "meaning": "Nicki is known for her AKA Nicki Lewinsky AKA The Young Money Mistress.\n\nAs explained more here…", "annotation_id": "2395972", "url": "https://genius.com/2395972", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
