{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking To Myself (Her Eyes)", "line": "And I can smell her lookin’ at I She recognize real, I don’t wear no disguise And I can see it in her eyes She fuckin’ me with her eyes She fuckin’ me with her eyes (She fuckin’ me with her eyes, she fuckin’ me with her eyes) She fuckin’ me with her eyes (She fuckin’ me with her eyes, yeah!) She fuckin’ me with her eyes (She fuckin’ me with her eyes, she fuckin’ me with her eyes) Yeah (She fuckin’ me with her eyes, yeah!)", "vault_lines": ["And I can smell her lookin' at I"], "meaning": "When he looks at her he can see that she is already into him.", "annotation_id": "2389153", "url": "https://genius.com/2389153", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
