{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking Of You", "line": "Will somebody please please double-cup me", "vault_lines": ["And mommy used to tell me one day some girl gone get me"], "meaning": "Double-cup is a reference to one of Lil Wayne’s old pastimes, Codeine mixed with Promethazine, Sprite, and usually a sweet candy.", "annotation_id": "2585756", "url": "https://genius.com/2585756", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking Of You", "line": "Loving you to death, I didn’t expect", "vault_lines": ["Loving you to death, I didn't expect"], "meaning": "This idiom describes how love just hits you in the face with no warning. Tyga also cleverly intertwines this line about death into the next line about suicide.", "annotation_id": "2568681", "url": "https://genius.com/2568681", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking Of You", "line": "And mommy used to tell me one day some girl gone get me But I won’t know love if it walk right up and hit me", "vault_lines": ["And mommy used to tell me one day some girl gone get me"], "meaning": "Wayne isn’t too familiar with love so he wouldn’t know what girl is right for him to settle down with. So much so, that he has 4 different baby mamas, yet still isn’t married.\n\n\n\nSomebody needs to teach Wayne How to Love.", "annotation_id": "2568657", "url": "https://genius.com/2568657", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Thinking Of You", "line": "Let’s Kiss, like Gene Simmons", "vault_lines": ["Now listen, let's Kiss, like Gene Simmons"], "meaning": "#DOUBLE ENTENDRE\n\n1) Tyga wants to french kiss his lover sensually, like the extremely famous bassist Gene Simmons is able to do with his notoriously long tongue.\n\n\n\n2) This also refers to Simmons' band, Kiss.", "annotation_id": "2568654", "url": "https://genius.com/2568654", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
