{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Rapper Eater", "line": "Buckwheat otay", "vault_lines": ["Nappy ass hair like buckwheat otay"], "meaning": "Buckwheat is a fictional character from  the 1922 show “The Little Rascals.” A show which centered around the lives of young children, the phrase “otay” was commonly used within the shows dialogue.", "annotation_id": "33031220", "url": "https://genius.com/33031220", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Rapper Eater", "line": "I got 12 Barbaros under that Lam hood", "vault_lines": ["I got 12 Barbaros under that Lam hood"], "meaning": "Barbaro was a Kentucky Derby-winning horse, and the engine for a Lamborghini is situated\n\n\n\nWayne’s Lamborghini has a lot of horsepower in the engine, and the “12 Barbaros” is likely referring to a V12 Engine.", "annotation_id": "3009168", "url": "https://genius.com/3009168", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Rapper Eater", "line": "I’m butter on the bread like parkay", "vault_lines": ["I'm butter on the bread like parkay"], "meaning": "A reference to the Parkay brand of butter, and just like butter makes everything better, Lil Wayne makes every track he is better.", "annotation_id": "2559182", "url": "https://genius.com/2559182", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Rapper Eater", "line": "I’m so high you could’nt reach me with a fuckin antenna", "vault_lines": ["I'm so high you could'nt reach me with a fuckin antenna"], "meaning": "Antennas are high in the air. Also Antennas are responsible for transmitting information for communication. In this case music.\n\nThe antenna on your radio still couldn’t reach him or his music. Even though that is an antenna’s purpose.", "annotation_id": "108430", "url": "https://genius.com/108430", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Rapper Eater", "line": "Hollygrove, Eagle street be my damn hood", "vault_lines": ["Hollygrove, Eagle street be my damn hood"], "meaning": "Hollygrove is the neighborhood Wayne grew up in, Eagle St. was the street. He’s mentioned both in several songs", "annotation_id": "56901", "url": "https://genius.com/56901", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
