{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Party Anthem", "line": "Money, money, money, money don’t make the man Man make the money with the biggest master plan", "vault_lines": ["Money, money, money, money don't make the man"], "meaning": "A man has to earn that money to get where he wants to be and to get it he needs to have a plan. If his plan works, he will make that money and that is what Timbaland has been doing all these years.\n\nWith an estimated net worth of 80 million… he has certainly succeeded.", "annotation_id": "1367941", "url": "https://genius.com/1367941", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Party Anthem", "line": "Say I’m too old to rap, I’ll be rapping til I wear dentures Yeah, hello haters", "vault_lines": ["Say I'm too old to rap, I'll be rapping til I wear dentures"], "meaning": "Missy Elliott is 41 years old!! No surprise people have been telling her she’s too old, but she doesn’t care, she’ll be going til she loses her teeth (from old age that is)!", "annotation_id": "1367936", "url": "https://genius.com/1367936", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Party Anthem", "line": "Man, fuck these niggas. Pause", "vault_lines": ["Man, fuck these niggas. Pause"], "meaning": "Technically, he just said he’d have sex with these dude and Lil Wayne isn’t gay so he had to take a pause. http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRL4SV3b4gY\n\nSpeaking of that link, Lil Wayne has actually been in an episode of The Boondocks.", "annotation_id": "1367930", "url": "https://genius.com/1367930", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Party Anthem", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Timbaland-the-party-anthem-lyrics", "genius_title": "The Party Anthem", "genius_id": 106187, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "And you MCs are just “milk and cherries” to Lil Wayne", "vault_lines": ["And you MCs are just \"milk and cherries\" to Lil Wayne"], "meaning": "The “milk and cherries” line is a direct jab at other rappers by calling them children. To understand it, you have to look at the track “That Was Easy” on the same mixtape, where Wayne stops to say,\n\n“That was milk and cookies for me… Rest in peace Bernie Mac.”\n\nHe is referencing a famous joke by comedian Bernie Mac about his sister’s soft, spoiled kids who were always asking for “milk and cookies.” By using that phrase, Wayne is calling his work “child’s play.” When he later refers to MCs (the standard term for rappers) as “milk and cherries,” he is mocking them. He is swapping the meaning of the letters MC to say they aren’t “Musicians,” but are actually just “Milk and Cherries/Cookies\"—weak, unrefined kids who are beneath him. It’s his way of saying he is the adult in the room and the rest of the industry is just a snack.\n\nBernie Mac’s comedy bit “Milk & Cookies”:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y5yMZEr6MbI", "annotation_id": "39583544", "url": "https://genius.com/39583544", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "Smokin’ them dykes, I’m on that Mary-fucking-Jane", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' them dykes, I'm on that Mary-fucking-Jane"], "meaning": "The phrase “smoking dykes” operates on multiple levels: as a metaphor for sexual encounters with lesbians, a reference to his prowess, and a metaphorical representation of marijuana blunts. This is intertwined with “Mary-fucking-Jane,” a term rich in double entendre, serving both as slang for marijuana and an insinuation of lesbian interactions (“Mary fucking Jane”).", "annotation_id": "30621129", "url": "https://genius.com/30621129", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "Fifty clips at his hat, leave a peeled potato", "vault_lines": ["Fifty clips at his hat, leave a peeled potato"], "meaning": "50 round drum at someones head will ‘peel their top back’ like a potato, as well as a shoutout to 50 Cent.", "annotation_id": "20015514", "url": "https://genius.com/20015514", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "The game dirty on the streets, tryna deal yayo", "vault_lines": ["The game dirty on the streets, tryna deal yayo"], "meaning": "Rappers trap to fund their career, and some sell cocaine (yayo) to make it, their ‘dirty’ little secret.\n\nAlso a shout out to Tony Yayo", "annotation_id": "20015506", "url": "https://genius.com/20015506", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "A bankroll of bucks is what these young niggas killing for", "vault_lines": ["A bankroll of bucks is what these young niggas killing for"], "meaning": "The last 3 lines of Gudaas verse are double entendres on G-Units members.\n\nA bank roll with bucks = bag of money, a shoutout to Young Buck, as well as Lloyd Banks", "annotation_id": "20015501", "url": "https://genius.com/20015501", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "But if I keep eatin’ you rappers, I’ll get sugar-diabetes", "vault_lines": ["But if I keep eatin' you rappers, I'll get sugar-diabetes"], "meaning": "Other rappers are so “sweet”, meaning so soft, that by “eatin'” or successfully competing against the other rappers constituting the rap game, Lil Wayne could become diabetic (which is often caused by eating excessive quantities of sugar)", "annotation_id": "15026924", "url": "https://genius.com/15026924", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "And all my riders riding like a Winnebago", "vault_lines": ["And all my riders riding like a Winnebago"], "meaning": "A Winnebago is a long-standing manufacturer of motorhomes. In recent years, they’ve seemed to put out quite a few models that looked like just long, nondescript boxes on wheels.\n\nFor many years, “Winnebago” has been used as a synonym for “motorhome”, regardless of its manufacturer.", "annotation_id": "4525276", "url": "https://genius.com/4525276", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "Inside The Carter, cooking 36 zones", "vault_lines": ["Inside The Carter, cooking 36 zones"], "meaning": "The Carter is the apartment building that Nino Brown uses as his drug lair in the film New Jack City.\n\n\n\nLil Wayne named his Tha Carter albums after this building.\n\nA zone is an ounce of cocaine in this context and 36 ounces is equal to a little over 1 kilo.", "annotation_id": "4360781", "url": "https://genius.com/4360781", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "I call my nina “bay,” like San Diego", "vault_lines": ["I call my nina \"bay,\" like San Diego"], "meaning": "This would be a better play on words if there was a place called Nina Bay in San Diego; but alas, Weezy F is referencing San Diego Bay.\n\nWordplay Breakdown:\n\nWayne has strong feelings for his nine millimeter pistol and calls it bae. This is very 2Pac-esque as Pac made an entire song comparing his gun to a woman.", "annotation_id": "3158379", "url": "https://genius.com/3158379", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "Get me twisted, and I’ma turn into a tornado", "vault_lines": ["Get me twisted, and I'ma turn into a tornado"], "meaning": "Double Entendre:\n\n1) Lie about Weezy (get him twisted), it’ll start a disaster.\n\n2) When Tunechi becomes under the influence of drugs, he gets turnt up.\n\n\n\nWordplay:\n\nTornado & Twisted", "annotation_id": "3024523", "url": "https://genius.com/3024523", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "Shoot you like “Halo,” give your ass a halo", "vault_lines": ["Shoot you like \"Halo,\" give your ass a halo"], "meaning": "Reference to the First-Person Shooter Halo.\n\n\n\nWayne will shoot you like they do in the video game, and give you a physical halo.", "annotation_id": "2748240", "url": "https://genius.com/2748240", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
