{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "I be climbing through your window like I’m fucking Bruh Man", "vault_lines": ["I be climbing through your window like I'm fucking Bruh Man"], "meaning": "“Bruh Man” is a character from the TV show Martin. He is known for crawling through the window:\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yne4xKQtJic", "annotation_id": "2311762", "url": "https://genius.com/2311762", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "But man, I remember when these bitches was just “Hey, ho” (Gangsta!)", "vault_lines": ["But man, I remember when these bitches was just \"Hey, ho\" (Gangsta!)"], "meaning": "This is a continuation of the other line refering to J.lo. Wayne got this from a joke that Jaime Foxx told on his standup I Might Need Security, in which Jaime said he “remembered her before the J.lo”…he “remembered her when it was just hey hoe”", "annotation_id": "1089057", "url": "https://genius.com/1089057", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "The Embassy, AMG, Young Money merger", "vault_lines": ["The Embassy, AMG, Young Money merger"], "meaning": "L.A.D. is with Embassy Apphiliates Music Group and Wayne, like Nicki, is Young Money ‘til the death of me", "annotation_id": "973914", "url": "https://genius.com/973914", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "When there’s beef, I’m in the center like Tyson Chandler", "vault_lines": ["When there's beef, I'm in the center like Tyson Chandler"], "meaning": "Chandler is an NBA center with the Knicks as of this writing\n\n\n\nWe all know how much Wayne loves sports\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YUUzCSo97VU&feature=kp", "annotation_id": "608735", "url": "https://genius.com/608735", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
