{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Other Side", "line": "This shit so “Tom and Jerry” to Lil Wayne", "vault_lines": ["This shit so \"Tom and Jerry\" to Lil Wayne"], "meaning": "Tom and Jerry is a children’s show about a cat and mouse that chase each other around for no real reason\n\n\n\nOther rappers in the game are Tom and Jerry, they are nothing compared to Lil Wayne.", "annotation_id": "203491", "url": "https://genius.com/203491", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
