{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Niggas brave after two packs a Coors, Two packs? OF COURSE Triple entendre you bastards off", "vault_lines": ["Niggas brave after two packs a Coors, Two packs? OF COURSE"], "meaning": "Aha! He’s so good at these:\n\n\nTwo packs a coors = Tupac Shakurs\nYou know after you drink your first can of booze you think you’re the shit?\nRappers think that they’re great cause they went Gold or got a Grammy nomination… but to Jay-Z you’re just 50 tyson:\n\n\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yM8jrvF5zYs\n\nHe is mocking them saying “are they Tupacs? Of course!”", "annotation_id": "470067", "url": "https://genius.com/470067", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Thinkin those messages is for themmm jus because they been gettin cc’ed", "vault_lines": ["Thinkin those messages is for themmm jus because they been gettin cc'ed"], "meaning": "You know when you write an email message and you see the little text box that says CC:? CC means carbon copy.  A carbon copy is a copy of something else already made.  So Jay-Z is saying that all these other fake rappers are cc'ing or carbon copying him.\n\n\n\nOr he could be saying that his message is against EVERY OTHER rapper in the game… so no “one” rapper should get too offended because his name came up on the list.", "annotation_id": "468211", "url": "https://genius.com/468211", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Use ta FLIP grams, but then it EXpand-ed, SHIT man, look what I WITH-stand-ed", "vault_lines": ["Use ta FLIP grams, but then it EXpand-ed, SHIT man, look what I WITH-stand-ed"], "meaning": "A portion of Jay’s life that is pretty well explained in A Star is Born", "annotation_id": "467966", "url": "https://genius.com/467966", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Pokerface’d the game n now I’m steady stackin CHIPS, man", "vault_lines": ["Pokerface'd the game n now I'm steady stackin CHIPS, man"], "meaning": "A pokerface is a straight face.  He came into the game serious and now is steady gettin' paid or “stackin' chips”.\n\nRemember! Jay-Z net worth = $450 million!", "annotation_id": "467960", "url": "https://genius.com/467960", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Listen, my nigga, we ain’t even speakin the same DEC-i-bels", "vault_lines": ["Listen, my nigga, we ain't even speakin the same DEC-i-bels"], "meaning": "Decibels are measurements of loudness.  Jay-Z speaks louder decibels meaning more people can hear him (more people would rather hear his music than yours).", "annotation_id": "467951", "url": "https://genius.com/467951", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Even Elvis had to BOW DOWN", "vault_lines": ["Even Elvis had to BOW DOWN"], "meaning": "In early 2009, Jay-Z shared a record with Elvis for most #1 albums by a solo artist on the Billboard 200 Music Charts. Once his Blueprint 3 became #1 on the Billboard Music Charts, he squashed his tie with Elvis:\n\nI just got 10 #1 albums, maybe now 11?\n\nHe therefore made Elvis (the king) BOW DOWN, as Jay-Z is the new king now.", "annotation_id": "467841", "url": "https://genius.com/467841", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Lost Carter IV Song", "line": "Sawrdeens", "vault_lines": ["Tunechi is tha tunafish...yall nigguhs is sawrdeens"], "meaning": "you’re small, like sardines, as compared to the larger tunafish (Tunechi, or Lil Wayne)", "annotation_id": "359018", "url": "https://genius.com/359018", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
