{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "The Cliche Lil Wayne Feature (It’s the Remix Baby!)", "line": "I’m on my Scott Storch staying clear of Timbalands", "vault_lines": ["I'm on my Scott Storch staying clear of Timbalands"], "meaning": "Scott Storch and Timbaland are both very talented musical producers and they don’t work together because of it. The point of this line is the pun on Timbaland/Timberland. Scott Storch stays clear of Timbaland because they are competing producers; Wale stays clear of Timberland boots because he wears Nike boots.", "annotation_id": "122899", "url": "https://genius.com/122899", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
