{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "That’s What Niggas Do", "line": "I sip Big Mo I drank Pimp C", "vault_lines": ["I sip Big Mo"], "meaning": "Big Moe and Pimp C were Houston rappers that died of an overdose caused by syrup drinking in 2007.\n\nWayne is sipping in their memory, and he is not afraid to end up like them. He also had a similar line in his song “Me And My Drank” :\n\nYea I sip that Big Mo, I drink that Pimp C\nRest in peace Big Mo, rest in peace Pimp C", "annotation_id": "2642434", "url": "https://genius.com/2642434", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
