{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "That Was Easy!", "line": "That was easy, that was milk and cookies for me Milk and cookies! Rest in peace Bernie Mac, man", "vault_lines": ["That was easy, that was milk and cookies for me"], "meaning": "He is referencing a famous joke by comedian Bernie Mac about his sister’s soft, spoiled kids who were always asking for “milk and cookies.” By using that phrase, Wayne is calling his work “child’s play.”\n\nBernie Mac’s comedy bit “Milk & Cookies”:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y5yMZEr6MbI", "annotation_id": "39583796", "url": "https://genius.com/39583796", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
