{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tha Blues", "line": "A lot of heat, a lot of fire, a blazer like Stoudamire", "vault_lines": ["A lot of heat, a lot of fire, a blazer like Stoudamire"], "meaning": "Damon Stoudamire played 8 seasons with the Portland Trailblazers from 1997 – 2005.\n\nhttps://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSdDq0ea5H4YoKn2_KtIFseEhgd7yU7ce5bmg&s", "annotation_id": "23239194", "url": "https://genius.com/23239194", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
