{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tear It Up", "line": "You kill me it really don’t matter to Lil B. Geezy It’s cool whoa I’m waitin’ to see my nigga L.Teezy", "vault_lines": ["You kill me it really don't matter to Lil B. Geezy"], "meaning": "If someone kills BG, It really wouldn’t phase him. His deceased friend LT is in Heaven and he’s been missing him, so a visit would be just perfect.", "annotation_id": "1020249", "url": "https://genius.com/1020249", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tear It Up", "line": "Wodie I’m young but strictly bout my cash Fuck petty check I want it in thousand dollar stacks", "vault_lines": ["Wodie I'm young but strictly bout my cash"], "meaning": "BG was 16-17 when he made this song. Most 16 year olds were sitting at home, while he was out making money. But he isn’t satisfied with just any money, he wants large amounts of it.", "annotation_id": "1020244", "url": "https://genius.com/1020244", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
