{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tear Gas", "line": "You don’t know the feeling of never seein’ your kid again And it’s a Russell Wilson type nigga raisin’ your lil’ man", "vault_lines": ["You don't know the feeling of never seein' your kid again"], "meaning": "Machine is alluding to rapper Future in this bar. Future had a child named Future Zahir with Ciara during their relationship in the mid 2010’s.\n\n\n\nCiara and Future separated in 2014 and Ciara started dating the Seattle Seahawks/Denver Broncos' star quarterback Russell Wilson to whom she is still married to this day. Future’s son was mainly raised by Ciara and Wilson after the Atlanta rapper found a custody settlement with the R&B star in 2017 (per Us Weekly).", "annotation_id": "25262047", "url": "https://genius.com/25262047", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
