{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tattoo Girl (Foreva)", "line": "Like first the rose, then the butterfly", "vault_lines": ["Like first the rose, then the butterfly"], "meaning": "The rose and the butterfly are two of the most common tattoos. So if she’s gonna start tattooing her body, probably she’d start by getting a rose or a butterfly.", "annotation_id": "7205975", "url": "https://genius.com/7205975", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tattoo Girl (Foreva)", "line": "And even Angelina Jolie got those The only way you see those is with no clothes So there’s a few who knows Maybe Brad Pitt know Billy Bob saw a few so she got some more", "vault_lines": ["And even Angelina Jolie got those"], "meaning": "At the moment, Angelina Jolie is married to Brad Pitt, but until 2003 she was married to Billy Bob, so both of them were able to see Angelina’s tattoos.", "annotation_id": "4971527", "url": "https://genius.com/4971527", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tattoo Girl (Foreva)", "line": "Then we cut off the night lamp And I get up on that ass like a tramp stamp", "vault_lines": ["Then we cut off the night lamp"], "meaning": "“Tramp Stamp” is a tattoo above a woman’s ass crack (low back).\n\n\n\nWayne is saying that he turned off the lights (cut off the night lamp) and then he had sex with her.", "annotation_id": "4947498", "url": "https://genius.com/4947498", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
