{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tap Out", "line": "(Rich Gang)", "vault_lines": ["Million dollar, oh, oh"], "meaning": "Rich Gang is a rotating hip-hop collective and supergroup formed in 2013 by Cash Money Records co-founder Birdman. Initially designed as a massive showcase for the extended Young Money Cash Money Billionaires (YMCMB) roster, the group evolved to capture one of the most culturally significant eras in modern trap music.", "annotation_id": "41752526", "url": "https://genius.com/41752526", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
