{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Tap Out", "line": "Play with his balls, dunks", "vault_lines": ["Million dollar, oh, oh"], "meaning": "Nicki Minaj uses a double entendre.\n\n\n“Play with his balls” could be interpreted as handling a basketball, and “dunks” relates to scoring in basketball by dunking the ball into the hoop\nThe lyric also carries a sexual innuendo. “Play with his balls” can be a euphemism for engaging in sexual activity, and “dunks” might imply dominance or success in that context.", "annotation_id": "32589216", "url": "https://genius.com/32589216", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
