{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "Came in the game as a young’n", "vault_lines": ["Came in the game as a young'n"], "meaning": "Weezy signed his first major record deal at the age of 9 with Cash Money records – so he knows how to maneuver the game at this point, he’s a veteran of the rap industry.\n\n\n\nThis line also serves as a brag about how Wayne was already at Pro-level with rapping even as a little kid.", "annotation_id": "7441576", "url": "https://genius.com/7441576", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "Man, they just talking ’bout it They just talking ’bout it And I’m on the streets with it I’m on the streets with it", "vault_lines": ["They just talking 'bout it"], "meaning": "Every controversial thing you do is going to end on the news. You’ll be on the front pages of newspaper, they’ll just talk about the thing you’ve done all the time. Something like this happened to Lil Wayne and he’s keeping his head up showing himself in public like nothing happened.", "annotation_id": "2475406", "url": "https://genius.com/2475406", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "Come through a nigga house And aim at the pillows", "vault_lines": ["Come through a nigga house"], "meaning": "If you are planning to murder someone, one of the best places to shoot them would to be in the head. When people sleep, they rest their head on the pillow, so saying to shoot at the pillows I just a way to imply to shoot them in the head. Or, they might be sleeping when Wayne goes into their house to kill them, so the pillows would literally be the number 1 spot to shoot at.", "annotation_id": "1402286", "url": "https://genius.com/1402286", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "Well you could call me Scrooge Cause I’m swimming in bucks", "vault_lines": ["Well you could call me Scrooge"], "meaning": "Scrooge McDuck is a Disney cartoon character and within the context of the fictional Disney universe, he is the Earth’s richest person.", "annotation_id": "647028", "url": "https://genius.com/647028", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "Signed with Cash Money", "vault_lines": ["Signed with Cash Money"], "meaning": "At the age of nine, Lil Wayne joined Cash Money Records.\n\nThat’s incredibly young!", "annotation_id": "647015", "url": "https://genius.com/647015", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talkin’ About It", "line": "I’mma smoke so many niggas, I’mma catch cancer", "vault_lines": ["I'mma smoke so many niggas, I'mma catch cancer"], "meaning": "Smoking tobacco is the leading cause of various cancers, while he’s not talking about cigarettes, he is talking about his great number of vengeful murders. Does murder give you cancer? Did Dr. Weezy just drop some medical knowledge?", "annotation_id": "413180", "url": "https://genius.com/413180", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
