{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Talk That", "line": "And I ought to be an author Damn, man and I tell ya, it’d be a best seller", "vault_lines": ["Call me orthopedic Carter and I ought to be an author"], "meaning": "A reference to the Jay-Z song “Money, Cash, Hoes”:\n\nShit, I led a life you can write a book on\nSex, murder and mayhem, romance for the street\nMan, and I tell ya, it’ll be the best-seller\n\nPerhaps best-selling literary fiction writer, Jonathan Franzen could guide Weezy’s writing. After all, he did write a novel called Freedom", "annotation_id": "51403", "url": "https://genius.com/51403", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
