{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Take It Slow", "line": "I’m so for real like a fold-out", "vault_lines": ["I'm so for real like a fold-out"], "meaning": "The way Tune delivers this in the song sounds like he says “I’m sofa real like a fold-out”, which is some good wordplay on “so for real” and couches.", "annotation_id": "18584422", "url": "https://genius.com/18584422", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
