{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagger Like Us (Alternate Verse)", "line": "Wipe the cloud off my eye", "vault_lines": ["Hold up, let me wipe the cloud off my eye"], "meaning": "Two meanings:\n\n\nLiterally, he fell from the sky, so he’s wiping clouds out of his eye because there are clouds in the sky.\nHe’s wiping a cloud of marijuana smoke, which made him high, out of his eye.", "annotation_id": "78255", "url": "https://genius.com/78255", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagger Like Us (Alternate Verse)", "line": "Church", "vault_lines": ["No one on the corner has swagga like moi,"], "meaning": "Church or Chuuch, a term made famous by Snoop Dogg means to have God in everything you do. Also used at the end of a sentence to express agreement or excitement", "annotation_id": "56453", "url": "https://genius.com/56453", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagger Like Us (Alternate Verse)", "line": "No one on the corner has swagga like moi,", "vault_lines": ["No one on the corner has swagga like moi,"], "meaning": "Moi= Me in French. Lil Wayne is from New Orleans which is heavily influenced by French culture", "annotation_id": "56449", "url": "https://genius.com/56449", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagger Like Us (Alternate Verse)", "line": "I earn my stripes, Adidas", "vault_lines": ["I require what I desire I earn my stripes, Adidas"], "meaning": "Stripes are a symbol of respect/enhancement of one’s reputation in a criminal organization (Can I get a Soo Woo!?)\n\nAdidas is notoriously known for their striped logo!", "annotation_id": "56446", "url": "https://genius.com/56446", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagger Like Us (Alternate Verse)", "line": "Runnin this bitch like I got four thighs", "vault_lines": ["Runnin this bitch like I got four thighs"], "meaning": "He is “running” (controlling) this bitch (rap game)\nHe is reminding everyone that he is not a human, but rather a vicious quadruped beast!", "annotation_id": "56444", "url": "https://genius.com/56444", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
