{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Swagga Like Us", "line": "So I guess we should address it, huh?", "vault_lines": [", so I guess we should address it, huh?"], "meaning": "This lyric is too random alone to not relate to the previous bar. They put a wound dressing on fresh tattoos to allow them to heal, thats why kanye says he should ad- Dress it.", "annotation_id": "38152816", "url": "https://genius.com/38152816", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
