{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sum 2 Prove", "line": "Diamonds on deep freeze, ice cubes like Dr. Dre, Eazy N.W.A, that New Watch Attitude", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on deep freeze, ice cubes like Dr. Dre, Eazy"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne pays homage to N.W.A., a Compton rap group consisting of Eazy-E, Dr. Dre, Ice Cube, MC Ren and DJ Yella. Although the collective’s name stands for “Niggaz With Attitudes,” Wayne reuses the initials to describe his feelings of purchasing an iced-out, or diamond-encrusted, timepiece.", "annotation_id": "21651042", "url": "https://genius.com/21651042", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
