{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "Three brazies deep, we got .380s and P80s Nice 9's, M10's M1's and 12 Gauges", "vault_lines": ["Three brazies deep, we got .380s and P80s"], "meaning": "Weezy rolls deep with heavy artillery.\n\n.380s\n\n\n\nGlock P80\n\n\n\n\nGlock 9mm\n\n\n\n\nM10\n\n\n\n\nM1's\n\n\n\n\n12 Gauge Shotgun\n\n\nThat’s a lot of ammunition for 3 guys!", "annotation_id": "40926345", "url": "https://genius.com/40926345", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "You niggas is sleeveless, man, you can’t hang with us", "vault_lines": ["This song is track #21 and is a freestyle. It is also the same verse that he uses on:"], "meaning": "Sleeveless shirts are notoriously hard to hang on a standard clothes hanger in a closet as they will just slide off.\n\nSleeveless shirts can’t “hang with” normal shirts in a closet, just like you can’t “hang with” Wayne and his crew.", "annotation_id": "40925611", "url": "https://genius.com/40925611", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "No, we don’t run for the Olympics, but the flame’s with us", "vault_lines": ["No, we don't run for the Olympics, but the flame's with us"], "meaning": "This is referring to the Olympics opening ceremony, where running with the torch is very symbolic.\n\nEvery year since 1936 the Olympics have began with a “torch relay”, where the Olympic flame is “ran” from Olympus, Greece, to the site of the games (usually including planes or boats)\n\nThe type of “flame” Weezy is running with, is a gun.\n\nhttps://img.olympics.com/images/image/private/t_s_pog_staticContent_hero_xl_2x/f_auto/primary/cfolbpsgufjp56w6s2yh", "annotation_id": "40833476", "url": "https://genius.com/40833476", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "Nigga, we bussin’ and bussin’ till the banger bust", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, we bussin' and bussin' till the banger bust"], "meaning": "Shooting until the gun is broken or they cant shoot no more", "annotation_id": "40833473", "url": "https://genius.com/40833473", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "Swerve the nickel black if I wreck, bet I will not panic Cop another one the next day and drive it crazier The seats’ll be lazier, shit’ll be gravier", "vault_lines": ["Servin' nickel bags in Iraq, bet I will not panic"], "meaning": "He drives crazy in his black BMW 5 series, because he doesn’t have to worry about crashing. If he wrecks it, he’s rich enough to buy another tomorrow and drive it ever crazier.\n\nSeats will be lazier = laying the driver seat even further back. So called “gangster lean”", "annotation_id": "18201030", "url": "https://genius.com/18201030", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "I got that ’tussin, that scummy and the angel dust So pick your high, I will supply", "vault_lines": ["I got that 'tussin, that scummy and the angel dust"], "meaning": "Wayne will sell you whatever drugs you want.", "annotation_id": "18200972", "url": "https://genius.com/18200972", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "Got Hova at the game and now he coachin’ me!", "vault_lines": ["Got Hova at the game and now he coachin' me!"], "meaning": "Right before and during the production of this mixtape Lil wayne there were rumors that Wayne almost left YMCMB to go join Jay Z on RocNation.", "annotation_id": "2765282", "url": "https://genius.com/2765282", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "Hollygrove the hood, nigga Throw it in your face ’Till you get that understood", "vault_lines": ["Hollygrove the hood, nigga"], "meaning": "Wayne once again shouting out his hometown of Hollygrove, New Orleans.\n\n\n\nSince Hollygrove is an extremely dangerous and impoverished area of New Orleans, Wayne will keep repping his hood to give the people support and let everyone know where he comes from.", "annotation_id": "2610278", "url": "https://genius.com/2610278", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stilettos", "line": "This is a Dedication, motherfucker This is Gangsta Grillz you bastards", "vault_lines": ["This is a Dedication, motherfucker"], "meaning": "Shoutout to the mixtape this song is featured on, Dedication.\n\n\n\nIt is first of Wayne’s Gangsta Grillz collaborations with DJ Drama.", "annotation_id": "2610270", "url": "https://genius.com/2610270", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
