{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stay Hood", "line": "Rest in peace Li’l Beezy I wish my nigga could see me now", "vault_lines": ["Rest in peace Li'l Beezy"], "meaning": "He wish his childhood friend Lil Beezy could witness his success. He also mentioned him in “Get Over” and “Real Rap”\n\nRest in peace Lil Beezy, my nigga\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZrMTgUW1NYU#t=62\n\nBeezy rolled a L, Beezy ain’t here\nWhere’s Beezy at? Beezy got killed\nAnd that was my nigga,\nI go way back with my nigga …", "annotation_id": "1473344", "url": "https://genius.com/1473344", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
