{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Started", "line": "Married to the MOB, man, you niggas just some bridesmaids", "vault_lines": ["Married to the MOB, man, you niggas just some bridesmaids"], "meaning": "“M.O.B.” in Wayne parlance always stands for “Money Over Bitches” – he even has it tattooed on his chest\n\n\n\nHere, he turns his fealty to his motto into a pun on the 1988 movie Married to the Mob", "annotation_id": "2166227", "url": "https://genius.com/2166227", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
