{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Staring at the World", "line": "I’m ready to perform and she’s gon’ be my audience And she said “Bravo” And I said “I know”", "vault_lines": ["And I said \"I know\""], "meaning": "Wayne channels his inner “porn star” He does his thing in bed, after the sex she applauds his work tells him hes great, He then confidently tells her he knows he put it down.\n\nIn These four lines wayne uses a continuous theme\n-Perform\n-Audience\n-Bravo\n-Encore\n\nclever word play", "annotation_id": "1419457", "url": "https://genius.com/1419457", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
