{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stand Up", "line": "And all that gangster shit you talkin’, yeah, it sound good But make it understood you gon’ have to show me, I’m a O.G", "vault_lines": ["And all that gangster shit you talkin', yeah, it sound good"], "meaning": "As he had said in the first verse of his song “U Don’t Know Me”:\n\nI graduated out the streets, I’m a real O.G\nI been trappin', shootin' pistols since I stood four feet\nSo all you niggas actin' bad, you gon' have to show me", "annotation_id": "36480431", "url": "https://genius.com/36480431", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stand Up", "line": "Your mouth writing checks that your ass can’t cash", "vault_lines": ["Your mouth writing checks that your ass can't cash"], "meaning": "He had previously said this to Lil' Flip in the background during the third chorus of his diss track “Keep Talkin [Game Over!!]”:\n\nMake ya mouth write checks that ya ass can’t cash, nigga", "annotation_id": "32231263", "url": "https://genius.com/32231263", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Stand Up", "line": "If you don’t like what I’m saying then buck Swing when you see me we can throw them hands sucker", "vault_lines": ["Swing when you see me we can throw them hands sucker"], "meaning": "A twist of his lines from his diss track “99 Problems [Lil Flip Aint One]”:\n\nHalf time you don’t like what I’m sayin' then buck, nigga swing when you see me, nigga, I don' give a fuck", "annotation_id": "28367815", "url": "https://genius.com/28367815", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
