{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "The Perc got a 10 on it", "vault_lines": ["The Perc got a 10 on it"], "meaning": "“Perc” is short for Percocet, which is a commonly abused painkiller frequently referred to in rap music. The certain Perc in Chainz' possession happens to be 10mg, which is a strong dose. 2 Chainz has used a very similar lyric in another song.\n\nShe fell in love with the Percocet\nShe like the one with a ten on it", "annotation_id": "11810454", "url": "https://genius.com/11810454", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "Say you getting money, nigga whoop di doo", "vault_lines": ["Say you getting money, nigga whoop di doo"], "meaning": "“Whoop Di Do” is a phrase commonly used when someone is not impressed with the actions of someone else. Here, 2 Chainz uses this phrase to clarify that he is not impressed with the money that other people have because he has an impressive amount of money himself.", "annotation_id": "11810315", "url": "https://genius.com/11810315", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "Riding down Peach Street", "vault_lines": ["Riding down Peach Street"], "meaning": "Riding down Peachtree**, in a flying saucer\n\nPeachtree is an area of metro Atlanta (Chainz’s ‘hood’).  Specifically,\n\n\n\n he is likely referencing Peachtree Street – a street that many famous artists (Frank Sinatra, John Mayer, Elton John, Lynyrd Skynyrd) have referenced in their songs throughout the years.", "annotation_id": "10871349", "url": "https://genius.com/10871349", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "Spend that shit, spend that shit Spend that shit, spend that shit Spend that check and get it right back Spend that check and get it right back Spend that shit, spend that shit Spend that shit, spend that shit Spend that check and get it right back Spend that check and get it right back", "vault_lines": ["Spend that shit, spend that shit"], "meaning": "I started with the hook. I just went in there and I was just saying, “spend it.” I don’t know. I was just in there turnt. I was recording myself. Didn’t nobody record that record. Nobody was at the computer recording that record.\n\nI was recording that record myself. I literally hit record and ran into the booth, then went in there freestyled the whole thing, It’s just what I do. I’ll pull up a beat and I just freestyle the whole bitch", "annotation_id": "10675082", "url": "https://genius.com/10675082", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 20, 40, 60, 80, 2 1, 40, 60, 80, 3, 2, 30, 60, 80, 40 (This a thousand right here)", "vault_lines": ["I smoke rapper weed, this that moon rock"], "meaning": "I was counting in the front. I actually pulled some money out of my pocket and if you listen to the record you can hear the paper sound. Like, I was real live counting. I put the money up to the microphone and I was counting, making the paper hit the mic and everything.", "annotation_id": "10674830", "url": "https://genius.com/10674830", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "Signed my first deal, about time", "vault_lines": ["Signed my first deal, about time"], "meaning": "When I was young I always wanted to sign a deal. Back then, it was so cool and everybody was on if you were signed to a label. As soon as you said you were signed to somebody, you was somebody out there. No matter if you had a song.", "annotation_id": "10674798", "url": "https://genius.com/10674798", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "I’m certified, you minimised I’m maximised, look in my eyes Don’t fuckin’ lie, don’t be surprised They legally blind, don’t wanna see me shine", "vault_lines": ["I'm certified, you minimised"], "meaning": "That mean everybody hear my name. Everybody knows what’s going on. They don’t want me in the position I’m in. So everybody tries to close their eyes and try not to see it.", "annotation_id": "10674787", "url": "https://genius.com/10674787", "state": "verified", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "Your Rollie fake, that shit unthawed", "vault_lines": ["Your Rollie fake, that shit unthawed"], "meaning": "You got on a fake Rollie. It’s not icy.  You know how you have frozen meat and you put it in the sink to thaw it out?", "annotation_id": "10674760", "url": "https://genius.com/10674760", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Spend It (ColleGrove Remix)", "line": "I smoke rapper weed, this that moon rock", "vault_lines": ["I smoke rapper weed, this that moon rock"], "meaning": "At the time I was doing that record, I was smoking moon rock mixed with rapper weed.\n\nRapper weed is a slang in Atlanta of the best weed that’s out here. It’s the strongest weed. We call that rapper weed because don’t nobody smoke that type of weed but rappers.", "annotation_id": "10674679", "url": "https://genius.com/10674679", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
