{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Space Jam", "line": "I get behind that ass, we drag racing", "vault_lines": ["I get behind that ass, we drag racing"], "meaning": "Clever wordplay here:\nLil wayne compares having sex with women from the behind to drag racing which is a popular sporting event in which most of the times the bumper of the car is skidding on track whereas the front wheels are up in the air.\n\nHe is also compares the two because when cars are drag racing they usually release fire while racing, and sex is metaphorically described as being on fire", "annotation_id": "1990708", "url": "https://genius.com/1990708", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
