{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Something Different", "line": "Moved out Miami and forgot bout the Lambi’ Neighbors just called me, I said “You can have it”", "vault_lines": ["Moved out Miami and forgot bout the Lambi'"], "meaning": "So rich he moved and forgot about 200,000 dollar car! Another reference to Drake’s “Laugh Now Cry Later” where Drake says he forgot about his Bentley when he moved! Wayne One Ups Drake by giving the damn car to his neighbor! Insane.", "annotation_id": "21612542", "url": "https://genius.com/21612542", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Something Different", "line": "I done went ghost town", "vault_lines": ["And I done went ghost town"], "meaning": "He ghosted the chick because she tripped, he used “Ghost Town” to specifically reference Drake’s Track “Laugh Now Cry Later” a nice touch, for fans who know both songs.", "annotation_id": "21612511", "url": "https://genius.com/21612511", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Something Different", "line": "If you do then we can’t even kiss after that", "vault_lines": ["If you do then we can't even kiss after that"], "meaning": "It’s a joke taking Drake’s line to the next extreme. In “Laugh Now Cry Later” Drake say’s “I can’t even listen to that” Wayne rhymes with his line and at the same time says if his girl sings some wack shit, her mouth is going to be unkissable, tainted by the wackness.", "annotation_id": "21612493", "url": "https://genius.com/21612493", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
