{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Something Different", "line": "It wasn’t me man, it must’ve been Shaggy", "vault_lines": ["It wasn't me man, it must've been Shaggy"], "meaning": "This line depict one man asking his friend what to do, after his girlfriend caught him having sex with another woman. His friend’s advice is to deny everything, despite clear evidence to the contrary, with the phrase “It wasn’t me… Single by Shaggy featuring Rickardo \"RikRok”", "annotation_id": "21460253", "url": "https://genius.com/21460253", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
