{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Snap ya Fangas", "line": "The Haitians and Puerto Ricans, sak pase, mami", "vault_lines": ["The Haitians and Puerto Ricans, sak pase, mami"], "meaning": "“Sak Passe” is essentially how Haitians greet each other in the same vain as an American says “what’s up,“ while \"Mami” is a Spanish word used in Puerto Rico to refer to a girl like an American would say “baby” or “bae”.", "annotation_id": "11866075", "url": "https://genius.com/11866075", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
