{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smoke Sumthin (Remix)", "line": "It’s Tunechi", "vault_lines": ["Just in case you need something else to roll to"], "meaning": "Tunechi is one of Lil Wayne’s many nicknames. The ‘Tune’ comes from what his grandmother called him growing up – he added the ‘Chi’ on his own – stylizing it so that it pronounce Toon-Chee and sound similar to Gucci (the clothing brand)", "annotation_id": "340302", "url": "https://genius.com/340302", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smoke Sumthin (Remix)", "line": "To be a billionaire, I got a shot, like Danny Ainge", "vault_lines": ["To be a billionaire, I got a shot, like Danny Ainge"], "meaning": "You gotta take a shot at being rich before you can achieve it.\n\nDanny Ainge is a former baseball and basketball player, and is currently on the Boston Celtics' management team.", "annotation_id": "339192", "url": "https://genius.com/339192", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
