{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smoke Session", "line": "Verse 2} I’m like hold on, what’s up Shorty, what you goin’ for She packed up, dipped out Now she left me all alone Back up in the smokin’ section Damn, she got me really trippin’ Weezy, tell me what you sippin’ I fucked up on this situation Please pass me a cigarette My nerves back calm down She always used to promise if she leave she’ll be back around I guess it’s some things as a man that I’m missin’ So at the end of the night, you can find me in the smokin’ section [Hook : Juliany] Find me where you left me burnin’ in the smokin’ section Up in smoke What’s left you’ll find it in the smokin’ section Find me where you left me burnin’ in the smokin’ section Up in smoke", "vault_lines": ["Damn, I can't believe she left me like this"], "meaning": "This song sucks don’t listen to it", "annotation_id": "1646713", "url": "https://genius.com/1646713", "state": "pending", "votes": -10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
