{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "I watch my step so much, I’m starting to feel like my ankles’ wrist", "vault_lines": ["I watch my step so much, I’m starting to feel like my ankles’ wrist"], "meaning": "This is a double meaning on the word watch. Wayne is watching his steps for “snakes” while also referring to WATCHing his ankles. Meaning his ankles are like his wrists which also have watches", "annotation_id": "22395185", "url": "https://genius.com/22395185", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "They say, “Tune, you’re dead wrong,” I say wrong had to die", "vault_lines": ["They say, \"Tune, you’re dead wrong,\" I say wrong had to die"], "meaning": "“Dead Wrong” is a song by the Notorious B.I.G., taken from his third overall album, Born Again. The song features background vocals from Diddy and rap vocals from Eminem, and it was released as a single posthumously in 1999. The song samples the drum break from Al Green’s song, “I’m Glad You’re Mine”.", "annotation_id": "20179013", "url": "https://genius.com/20179013", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "And make it as fat as a pig in a blanket", "vault_lines": ["And make it as fat as a pig in a blanket"], "meaning": "Pigs in a blanket (also pigs in blankets) is a variety of different sausage-based culinary dishes in the United Kingdom, United States, Denmark, Ireland, Germany, Belgium, Russia, Canada, Israel and Japan. In the United Kingdom the term is commonly used for small sausages (usually chipolatas) wrapped in bacon; in the United States it typically refers to hot dogs wrapped in croissant pastry.", "annotation_id": "20177922", "url": "https://genius.com/20177922", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "My chances are cold cut thin", "vault_lines": ["My chances are cold cut thin"], "meaning": "Lunch meats—also known as cold cuts, luncheon meats, cooked meats, sliced meats, cold meats, and deli meats—are precooked or cured meats that are sliced and served cold or hot. They are typically served in sandwiches or on a tray. They can be purchased pre-sliced, usually in vacuum packs, or they can be sliced to order.", "annotation_id": "20177914", "url": "https://genius.com/20177914", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Niggas is assholes Or enemas, finna get anal", "vault_lines": ["Or enemas, finna get anal"], "meaning": "An enema is when someone uses water to clean their rectum.  This is commonly done before anal sex, so Wayne is saying he’s fucking these people in the ass, and they’re used to it, so they get enemas.", "annotation_id": "13395140", "url": "https://genius.com/13395140", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Last night I prayed to God and asked for him to make a drop truck", "vault_lines": ["Last night I prayed to God and asked for him to make a drop truck"], "meaning": "This concept is recycled from a previous 2 Chainz verse:\n\nLast night I prayed that God would make a Bentley truck\n\nHowever, his original prayers were answered when Bentley began manufacturing their Bentayga model. Now that he knows that God is listening to his prayers, he asks for just one more automobile.", "annotation_id": "11612047", "url": "https://genius.com/11612047", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Had a threesome with two sisters", "vault_lines": ["Had a threesome with two sisters"], "meaning": "Chainz recalls having sex with two females at the same time that happen to be sisters, much like his “A Milli Billi Trilli” collaborator Wiz Khalifa allegedly did. Fellow Atlanta native, Future also demonstrates this idea.\n\nFuck around with me, I fuck twin sisters", "annotation_id": "11581126", "url": "https://genius.com/11581126", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "I get head and you kiss her", "vault_lines": ["I get head and you kiss her"], "meaning": "After receiving a blowjob, 2 Chainz sends this girl back home to her boyfriend, where she will inevitably end up kissing him with the same mouth she pleased Chainz with. This concept resembles a line previously rapped by the featured artist on this song, Lil Wayne, and it also draws comparisons to another lyric on this album:\n\nKiss your man after you sucked on my woo!", "annotation_id": "11581099", "url": "https://genius.com/11581099", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "I throw niggas from off of the plane I’m in “Oh, my God, it’s rainin’ men” Said the weatherman to the anchorman", "vault_lines": ["I throw niggas from off of the plane I’m in"], "meaning": "The guys he threw off the plane are free falling from the sky appearing to make them seem like they are raining to the weatherman and anchorman.\n\nAlso,  this is possibly a slick reference to the classic 1983 song “It’s Raining Men” by The Weather Girls. Wayne has previously conveyed this concept in his lyrics.\n\nWent from flyin' cockroaches to flyin' without credentials\nThat’s private, tell the pilot, ‘Be quiet, we need our privacy’\nThrow you off this bitch if you wired, justifiably", "annotation_id": "8985942", "url": "https://genius.com/8985942", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Middle finger to the judicials Fork and a pot is my utensils", "vault_lines": ["Middle finger to the judicials"], "meaning": "2Chainz says fuck the cops, while he whips up the dope cooking crack on the stove with a Fork.\n\nFuck the police (fuck ‘em), hundred middle fingers (fuck ‘em)\n\n\n\nwoke up on the block, had to hit it with the fork\nSkrrr, skrrr, skrrr, skrrr, skrrr: hit it with the fork\nSkrrr, skrrr, skrrr, skrrr, skrrr: hit it with the fork", "annotation_id": "8799454", "url": "https://genius.com/8799454", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Codeines, Xanax, and liquor Prescriptions and couple pistols Got clean Molly with the crystals", "vault_lines": ["Codeines, Xanax, and liquor"], "meaning": "2chainz is mixing up prescription drugs\nCodeine the main ingredient in Cough Syrup “Lean”/“Purple Drank” and Xanax a common anxiety/sleeping pill, the combo is popular.\n\nSimilar to Waynes Line on “Rich As Fuck” ft. 2 Chainz\n\nAnd I got Xanax, Percocet, Promethazine with Codeine\n\nXan with the Lean a popular, but dangerous combo. Adding Liquor interacts as a potentiator to get even more turnt.\n\n2Chainz has pure Molly (molecular mdma) thats uncut and a few pistols like a Codeine Cowboy", "annotation_id": "8799326", "url": "https://genius.com/8799326", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Only child with trust issues", "vault_lines": ["Only child with trust issues"], "meaning": "2 chainz really was an only child with trust issues.  He shared in an interview with The Urban Daily:\n\nThe fact that my mom raised me, used to bother my pop. He didn’t know if a woman could raise a man. And they’d have differences of opinions all the time. My pops used to tell me things from prison and as soon as he hung up my mom would say ‘don’t listen to him’,", "annotation_id": "8780143", "url": "https://genius.com/8780143", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "I eat so much shrimp I smoke so much hemp", "vault_lines": ["I eat so much shrimp"], "meaning": "Shrimp has been a status symbol for southern MCs at least since Pimp C’s iconic brag on Three 6 Mafia’s “Sippin' on Some Syrup”:\n\nWe eat so many shrimp, I got iodine poisoning\n\nSince Wayne is from New Orleans, Louisiana it’s only right that  he loves shrimp—the city is known for it’s seafood culture. In an interview with Nardwuar, it was revealed that Wayne’s first rap name was ‘Shrimp Daddy.’\n\nHemp of course is cannabis, and we all know that Wayne is a heavy weed smoker. Wayne has made it very clear that he likes to smoke that kush.", "annotation_id": "8767708", "url": "https://genius.com/8767708", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Totin’ double barrels in a horse and carriage Ain’t scared of nothing except God and marriage", "vault_lines": ["Totin’ double barrels in a horse and carriage"], "meaning": "Whenever Chainz is rolling ‘round it’s as if he arrives in a horse in carriage. What all high members of society would be carried in 1880’s-1910 and 2 Chainz classifies himself as just that, but in the 21st century.\n\nThe Georgia rapper is only scared of God’s judgment and what his life after death will consist of. Chainz is scared of what being locked down by a single women will make him feel and fears what a life of not smashing any girl of his liking will be like.", "annotation_id": "8767613", "url": "https://genius.com/8767613", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Call me Trill Cosby, I might spike my own beverage", "vault_lines": ["Call me Trill Cosby, I might spike my own beverage"], "meaning": "In 2015, a large number of women came out with accusations that Bill Cosby had sexually assaulted them over the last 25 years. In most cases, he did so by putting drugs in their drinks.\n\n2 Chainz is spiking his drink specifically with codeine.", "annotation_id": "8767047", "url": "https://genius.com/8767047", "state": "accepted", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "If trapping was a sport, I’d have a gold medal", "vault_lines": ["If trapping was a sport, I’d have a gold medal"], "meaning": "At the Olympics, the best competitor is awarded a gold medal. 2 Chainz is implying that if they gave out awards for trapping (selling drugs), he would be the very best.", "annotation_id": "8767043", "url": "https://genius.com/8767043", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "I steal her, like Jerome Bettis", "vault_lines": ["I steal her, like Jerome Bettis"], "meaning": "2 Chains won’t hesitate to steal your girl away from you. “Steal her” is a play on the NFL’s Pittsburgh Steelers.\n\nJerome Bettis  is a former halfback and Super Bowl champion who played for the Steelers. Perhaps there is additional innuendo in his nickname – the battering ram.", "annotation_id": "8766998", "url": "https://genius.com/8766998", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Through the concrete grew a rose petal", "vault_lines": ["Through the concrete grew a rose petal"], "meaning": "A variation on the now-common metaphor of a rose growing from concrete (possibly paying homage to Tupac Shakur, who wrote the poem “The Rose That Grew From Concrete”); this represents 2 Chainz' journey to greatness from humble origins.", "annotation_id": "8764908", "url": "https://genius.com/8764908", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "My BFF is Benjamin Franklin", "vault_lines": ["My BFF is Benjamin Franklin"], "meaning": "Wayne loves money, and with a net worth of $150 million as of 2015, it’s safe to say he’s become close with Benjamin Franklin over the years.\n\n\n\n‘B.F.F.’ stands for “Best Friends Forever,” but it’s also a play on Ben Franklin’s initials (BF).", "annotation_id": "8764893", "url": "https://genius.com/8764893", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Cold hearted, starting to feel like I’m in Anchorage when I think of this", "vault_lines": ["Cold hearted, starting to feel like I’m in Anchorage when I think of this"], "meaning": "Wayne claims that he’s cold-hearted using a comparison to Anchorage—a city in the notoriously cold state of Alaska.", "annotation_id": "8764885", "url": "https://genius.com/8764885", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Pussy nigga don’t keep it real no more Drug dealers changed, but the high stay the same Prices go up, but the high stay the same", "vault_lines": ["Pussy nigga don’t keep it real no more"], "meaning": "Although the drug dealers Wayne deals with don’t keep it real anymore, the effect of their product stays the same—Despite the fact that they keep raising the price of his drugs.\n\nWayne’s expressed his frustration over the drug game before; in “Krazy,” he rapped:\n\nTell me something I don’t know, like what happened to hard coke?", "annotation_id": "8764863", "url": "https://genius.com/8764863", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "line": "Here I go, here I go, this that C5", "vault_lines": ["Here I go, here I go, this that C5"], "meaning": "Wayne’s first verse on the album, and he’s letting you know he’s kicking it off with a bang. Also appears to reference his delayed upcoming  album Tha Carter 5.\n\nSome also speculate that the song was originally intended for that album, but didn’t make the cut.\n\nThis could be Wayne teasing us with the album, like he did on “Sh!t”:\n\nI’m bumpin Carter 5 on a iPod\nMy bitch mad as hell cause it ain’t out yet", "annotation_id": "8764837", "url": "https://genius.com/8764837", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Smell Like Money", "status": "done", "targets": 22, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/2-chainz-smell-like-money-lyrics", "genius_title": "Smell Like Money", "genius_id": 2433238, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "I leap, ball and I freefall and I sleep all in that pussy", "vault_lines": ["I leap, ball and I freefall and I sleep all in that pussy"], "meaning": "I think he says: “sleep all in that pussy” which makes sense as it is consistent with the rhyme scheme the previous couple lines have set up.\n\nBasically WEEZY can’t get enough of\nthis girl either!", "annotation_id": "6484429", "url": "https://genius.com/6484429", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
