{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Ray Charles niggas blind to the fact --", "vault_lines": ["Ray Charles niggas blind to the fact --"], "meaning": "Again, Gudda Gudda reminds us of his verse on “Bedrock,” in which he dropped a Stevie Wonder reference to describe his girl as out of sight\n\nToo bad there are no other blind blues legends to draw on in future mixtapes… oh, wait…", "annotation_id": "15117", "url": "https://genius.com/15117", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "You a bird, got wings I’m-a fly you with the pack", "vault_lines": ["You a bird, got wings I'm-a fly you with the pack"], "meaning": "“Bird” here means woman, and ties into the last line (“like a bitch”) Since you’re a bird, you have wings and Gudda will use you to fly his “pack” of drugs (or, as a woman, you can take flights with him and his “pack” of thugs)", "annotation_id": "15091", "url": "https://genius.com/15091", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Niggas moving fast gotta pump the brakes on ’em They better pump ’em fast before I beat the brakes off ’em", "vault_lines": ["Niggas moving fast gotta pump the brakes on 'em"], "meaning": "He has to slow people down by shooting them with a shot gun (“pump”). In turn they better away from him quickly (“pump [their legs] fast”) before he breaks their legs (“brakes,” in the sense of agility on the basketball court)", "annotation_id": "15089", "url": "https://genius.com/15089", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Cincinnatti Reds hat, red black", "vault_lines": ["Cincinnatti Reds hat, red black"], "meaning": "Red hat reps the Bloods gang (funny to wear a hat with a “C” on it if he’s a Blood though; maybe it’s intended as a symbol of Blood/Crip Unity?)\n\nMost Bloods wear Boston Red Sox hats (also red, but has a “B”)", "annotation_id": "15087", "url": "https://genius.com/15087", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
