{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Throw a stack at them hoes and tell ’em, “keep the change”", "vault_lines": ["Throw a stack at them hoes and tell 'em, \"keep the change\""], "meaning": "Gudda throws a thousand dollars cash at girls, which I don’t think he can afford given his record sales", "annotation_id": "15082", "url": "https://genius.com/15082", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Get hyphy if you want and I’m a shake them dreads", "vault_lines": ["Get hyphy if you want and I'm a shake them dreads"], "meaning": "Hyphy is a Bay Area-based rap movement, with accompanying sub-culture. “Shake them dreads” is a command from hyphy single “Tell Me When To Go”\n\nGudda will shake your dreads by shooting you in the head", "annotation_id": "15080", "url": "https://genius.com/15080", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Y.M. roll deep, don’t make me call the bosses Y.M. gon’ eat and run like break-fast", "vault_lines": ["Y.M. roll deep, don't make me call the bosses"], "meaning": "“Y.M.” is Young Money Entertainement, Gudda’s record company founded by Lil' Wayne", "annotation_id": "15075", "url": "https://genius.com/15075", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "I’m about that drama You fucking with the kind of nigga that got a gangster grill Yelling diamonds when I ramble nigga", "vault_lines": ["You a bird, got wings I'm-a fly you with the pack"], "meaning": "A reference to DJ Drama’s Gangster Grills series of mixtapes and a literal description of Gudda’s “grill”  (teeth jewelery). He’s “yelling diamonds” metaphorically in that his mouth is full of them. There is also a literal meaning, in that he’s the type of guy who ends up returning to money and bling when he rambles", "annotation_id": "15072", "url": "https://genius.com/15072", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "Nigga likes to gamble, you crapped out", "vault_lines": ["Nigga likes to gamble, you crapped out"], "meaning": "In craps, when the shooter rolls a 2, 3, or 12 when establishing the point, it’s called crapping out: everybody who bet on the shooter loses\n\nIn other words, testing your luck against Gudda is a losing proposition", "annotation_id": "15071", "url": "https://genius.com/15071", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "The night grind and you get scratched Now you cryin’ like a bitch", "vault_lines": ["The night grind and you get scratched"], "meaning": "At night selling drugs, you got shot or otherwise hurt and now you’re crying, “real men don’t cry from bullet wounds.” (What about kidney stones?)", "annotation_id": "15068", "url": "https://genius.com/15068", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Small Thing to a Giant", "line": "And we balling like b-balling, as a matter of fact like street balling", "vault_lines": ["And we balling like b-balling, as a matter of fact like street balling"], "meaning": "To “ball” is to live large, “b-ballin” is playing basketball, street ballin' is, well, its street version. Basketball is a sport that makes millionaires out of its atheletes. Plus Wayne does shady business on the street, so, hey! double meaning", "annotation_id": "15065", "url": "https://genius.com/15065", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
