{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Slip", "line": "Any sport, 24/7, no eight, nigga Mamba mentality but we ain’t got no snakes with us", "vault_lines": ["Any sport, 24/7, no eight, nigga"], "meaning": "Here, Lil Wayne employs dou​ble ​en​ten​dre on 24/7 to probably bring forth the second line that sums up the two bars as homage to the late Kobe Bryant.\n\nThe NBA Lakers' player was well-known for playing Jersey 24 and 8. He also used to end his speeches with, “Mamba Out”.", "annotation_id": "29676665", "url": "https://genius.com/29676665", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
