{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "[Bridge: Ke$ha] Rat-a-tat-tat on your dum-dum drum The beat’s so fat, gonna make me come (um-um-um...) Over to your place Rat-a-tat-tat on your dum-dum drum The beat’s so fat, gonna make me come (um-um-um...) Over to your place", "vault_lines": ["Rat-a-tat-tat on your dum-dum drum"], "meaning": "A nice little double entendre. She starts off implying that she’s going to orgasm from the awesomeness of the instrumental, but then cleans it up by switching “cum” with “come” and finishing the sentence. See the annotation in the original song.", "annotation_id": "1691920", "url": "https://genius.com/1691920", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "I’m boiling, royalty, knew it when I seen her I was gonna take her, make her my new royal penis cleaner", "vault_lines": ["I'm boiling, royalty, knew it when I seen her"], "meaning": "Tying in with his previous line where he dubbed himself the “king” (FYI it was also the title of his\n4th album), T.I. references the 1988 film, Coming to America.\n\nThe film centres around Eddie Murphy’s character, an African prince, who has servants that do everything for him, including women who bathe him. During the film a woman emerges from the bath and announces “The royal penis is clean, your Highness”.", "annotation_id": "495040", "url": "https://genius.com/495040", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "I only say this in cadence so it don’t get negated", "vault_lines": ["I only say this in cadence so it don't get negated"], "meaning": "He’s saying this on a song (cadence: a sequence of notes or chords comprising the close of a musical phrase) so people will actually listen to it. Music is the best way to say things that will make people think, Lots of people will hear him rap this and hopefully actually process what hes saying, but if he were to say these kinds of things in an interview or in a book it would be ineffective", "annotation_id": "494977", "url": "https://genius.com/494977", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "Some would look at my age and try to say I’m young and I’m handsome I say I’m filthy fuckin’ rich, so I’m a ol’ dirty bastard", "vault_lines": ["Some would look at my age and try to say I'm young and I'm handsome"], "meaning": "Wiz puns on the name of the late, beloved Wu-Tang member Ol' Dirty Bastard.  He’s “really too young to be feeling this old.”", "annotation_id": "494917", "url": "https://genius.com/494917", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "Know a girl named Cleopatra, she a-throw that pussy at ya", "vault_lines": ["Know a girl named Cleopatra, she a-throw that pussy at ya"], "meaning": "The Egyptians looked at cats as gods. He’s making a reference to Cleopatra having enough pussy (cats) to throw around.\n\nThis is probably also a reference to the R&B group named Cleopatra, whose first album was called “Comin' Atcha”", "annotation_id": "494833", "url": "https://genius.com/494833", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sleazy (Remix 2.0) - Get Sleazier", "line": "Kings of Leon", "vault_lines": ["Smoke that neon, Kings of Leon"], "meaning": "Lean is mispronounced to rhyme with neon. Also a play on the band Kings Of Leon", "annotation_id": "494681", "url": "https://genius.com/494681", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
