{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Skit End", "line": "What up though? Yes, this is the end of No Ceilings", "vault_lines": ["Yes, this is the end of No Ceilings"], "meaning": "After 15 songs and 2 skits, this is Lil Wayne’s last skit on the mixtape where he thanks the people for listening to it and mention again that the whole mixtape was just for the fans. Also starting this skit with “What up though?” like in both  of the other skits:\n\n\nSkit 1\nSkit 2", "annotation_id": "2818991", "url": "https://genius.com/2818991", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
