{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Skit #2", "line": "In the background I got Shannel banging right now, you know just vibing out", "vault_lines": ["In the background I got Shannel banging right now, you know just vibing out"], "meaning": "Shanell aka SnL’s single, “Save Me”, plays in the background. It’s a soft rock track, accompanied by Shanell’s soothing voice.", "annotation_id": "9666314", "url": "https://genius.com/9666314", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
