{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sinister", "line": "These diamond B’s all VVs, I call em’ Vivica", "vault_lines": ["These diamond B's all VVs, I call em' Vivica"], "meaning": "Sounds like Wayne is saying “bees” as in the “these diamonds be all VVs”. There may be some meaning to “B’s” but it alludes me right now. VVS is a diamond clarity rating standing for “very very slightly”. VVS is the second highest diamond clarity rating with “flawless” being the highest. You can assume that whenever Wayne says “Weezy F and the F is for flawless” it is a double entendre for himself as flawless and his diamonds are also flawless.", "annotation_id": "30627130", "url": "https://genius.com/30627130", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sinister", "line": "They tend to hate on ya when they can’t get rid of ya I ain’t goin’ nowhere, twenty year career minimum", "vault_lines": ["I ain't going nowhere, twenty year career minimum"], "meaning": "Haters will hate and they can’t eliminate him from the rap game, he stands strong, longevity is his fate. Twenty years deep is the minimum he plans to run his  career heavyweight status, and he is here to stay, no exit gate.", "annotation_id": "30239438", "url": "https://genius.com/30239438", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sinister", "line": "Yeah, alright, my flow sinister This ain’t rap music, this straight literature", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, alright, my flow sinister"], "meaning": "Cordae’s opener articulates how he spits rhymes with a sinister tone and attitude as he is Crafting verses, one can call it a literary zone.\nThis ain’t just rap, it’s a lyrical venture,\nElevating the game, it’s a straight up literature class as its seen on the video set.", "annotation_id": "30239343", "url": "https://genius.com/30239343", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
