{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sinister", "line": "Hi-Level", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, alright, my flow sinister"], "meaning": "Hi-Level is something of a slogan in Cordae’s music, so much so that he has created a fashion brand and record label both named Hi-Level.\n\nhttps://hilevel.co\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3vUWLWorm4s", "annotation_id": "25318273", "url": "https://genius.com/25318273", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sinister", "line": "My thots I keep confidential or it’s consequential Our philosophies unidentical, I’m not into ya", "vault_lines": ["My thots I keep confidential or it's consequential"], "meaning": "Philosophy is the study of wisdom; that might mean that Wayne is using “thots” as a double entendre for “thoughts”.\n\nIf Lil Wayne expressed the confidential thoughts in his mind that might carry consequences in the real world.", "annotation_id": "25065491", "url": "https://genius.com/25065491", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
