{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Single Again (Remix)", "line": "[Verse 1: Lil Wayne]", "vault_lines": ["And I gave you a ring that I don't need back"], "meaning": "From a 2008 Rolling Stone interview:\n\nYou did over a hundred guest appearances in the last year and a half. What’s the strangest request you’ve ever got?\nI get some crazy people asking me to do songs. The strangest one was probably Trina’s single, she asked to jump on “Single Again” when clearly [our breakup] was the subject of the song. That was kinda weird, but I did it.", "annotation_id": "8459901", "url": "https://genius.com/8459901", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
