{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Silence On The Gun (Original)", "line": "I’m higher than a bitch, I smoke that Keisha, Frank, and Neffie", "vault_lines": ["I'm higher than a bitch, I smoke that Keisha, Frank, and Neffie"], "meaning": "Tunechi is extremely stoned off of the weed that he is smoking. He only smokes the best\n\nKeisha is slang for good marijuana. Adding theme to his wordplay, Wayne furthers the Keisha pun for female recording artist Keyshia Cole. Cole has a sister named Neffie and a mother named Frankie. That would mean that he is really smoking that “Keyshia,” Frank, & Neffie. But we’ll excuse his spelling error; he’s high as fuck.", "annotation_id": "3436261", "url": "https://genius.com/3436261", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
