{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sick", "line": "I don’t even got to be her number 1 I’m her number 6 and she my number 9 Get it?", "vault_lines": ["I don't even got to be her number 1"], "meaning": "This is a wordplay with the use of a double entendre.\n\nThe numbers 6 and 9 combined make the number 69, there’s also an innuendo here 69 is a well-known sexual position.\n\nBy saying he is her number 6 and she is his number 9, he means they are engaging in a “69” rather than worrying about traditional relationship rankings (like being her “number 1”).", "annotation_id": "41748385", "url": "https://genius.com/41748385", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
