{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sick", "line": "If you don’t want no static You gon’ have to put some antennas on", "vault_lines": ["If you don't want no static"], "meaning": "You need antennaes to get signal for TVs and other devices to avoid static or interference.\n\nHe also refers to static meaning beef or conflict and warns to use your antennas like insects use to sense their surroundings in order to avoid conflict\n\nThis also refers to katt Williams in Friday after next asking an unaware employee where her antennaes were during a burglary\n\nhttps://youtu.be/xNSWp7Hb5tU", "annotation_id": "27116632", "url": "https://genius.com/27116632", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
