{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Probably with my lady", "vault_lines": ["Probably with my lady"], "meaning": "When you’re as fly as Mack, you always have a fine woman by your side.", "annotation_id": "4606912", "url": "https://genius.com/4606912", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "She doin’ the speed limit while I’m eating shrimp pasta", "vault_lines": ["She doin' the speed limit while I'm eating shrimp pasta"], "meaning": "Mack lets his lady chauffeur him around and at the suggested speed while he dines on shrimp pasta.\n\n\n\nShe’s probably doing the speed limit so he doesn’t spill his meal on himself, because that just wouldn’t do.", "annotation_id": "4606905", "url": "https://genius.com/4606905", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Back when Pimp C may pump the party", "vault_lines": ["Back when Pimp C may pump the party"], "meaning": "Pimp C was a rapper, singer and producer who sadly died two years after this song was recorded (December 29, 1973 – December 4, 2007). He was known for being in the group Underground Kings with Bun B.", "annotation_id": "3222843", "url": "https://genius.com/3222843", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Weezy F baby, key-sellin’ like the naval base", "vault_lines": ["Weezy F baby, key-sellin' like the naval base"], "meaning": "Simile by Weezy here, comparing his key-selling with the naval bases, as a lot of drug trafficking takes place there.\n\nKey-selling is slang for kilo-selling, and he’s most likely referring to kilos of cocaine.", "annotation_id": "3194265", "url": "https://genius.com/3194265", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Fly boy nigga I should have wings on my back", "vault_lines": ["Fly boy nigga I should have wings on my back"], "meaning": "A clever homophone by Curren$y here, he’s saying he’s so fly (as in cool) that he should actually be able to literally fly by getting some wings on his back.", "annotation_id": "3193025", "url": "https://genius.com/3193025", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Baby, probably see me ridin’ in my sky-blue Mercedes", "vault_lines": ["Baby, probably see me ridin' in my sky-blue Mercedes"], "meaning": "Seems like Curren$y has an exclusive taste when it comes to cars. Mercedes-Benz is known to be one of the finest automobile companies in the world.\n\n\n\nHe probably chose the sky-blue color because he’s so fly.", "annotation_id": "3192991", "url": "https://genius.com/3192991", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Standin’ in my D-boy stance is all gravy", "vault_lines": ["Standin' in my D-boy stance is all gravy"], "meaning": "A pun on the popular phrase B-Boy stance, meaning he’s a Dope-boy and always standing like one:", "annotation_id": "3192984", "url": "https://genius.com/3192984", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "We hear you niggas talking fly shit Young money cash money ain’t gon’ ride a bitch, nigga", "vault_lines": ["We hear you niggas talking fly shit"], "meaning": "People are pretending to be a part of Birdman’s crew and labels (Young Money Entertainment and Cash Money Records, also known as YMCMB), but they won’t ride with fake people (“bitch niggas”).", "annotation_id": "3192522", "url": "https://genius.com/3192522", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shovlin’ Snow", "line": "Nigga", "vault_lines": ["Yeah nigga, nigga, what, look"], "meaning": "Birdman drops the n-word 11 times in this verse. The number is probably 30 times higher if you count the entire album though.\n\nImpressive!", "annotation_id": "3192507", "url": "https://genius.com/3192507", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
