{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "Simon Says", "vault_lines": ["More colors than the game Simon Says"], "meaning": "Simon was a popular children’s electronic game that came out in the 1970s. Players touched buttons on a circular device while attempting to replicate sound and color patterns provided by the machine.\n\nHere, Wayne is bragging that his diamonds are more colorful than the blue, red, green, and yellow buttons on Simon.\n\nThis is an especially clever reference because the Mannie Fresh beat on this song kind of sounds like the tones from the Simon game.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/shorts/OlShnxf9Ebo", "annotation_id": "26598606", "url": "https://genius.com/26598606", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "But bitch, I got a family", "vault_lines": ["But bitch, I got a family"], "meaning": "A Phantom is a luxury car made by Rolls-Royce.\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rolls-Royce_Phantom", "annotation_id": "26598588", "url": "https://genius.com/26598588", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "Nigga like me stay in the cut 24/7 Steady stacking my ends on dubs, 24/7", "vault_lines": ["Nigga like me stay in the cut 24/7"], "meaning": "He doesn’t leave the house to hang out and waste time, because he’s too busy inside making money all day every day", "annotation_id": "25195063", "url": "https://genius.com/25195063", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "Bling blinging everyday, plus I got work (bling)", "vault_lines": ["Bling blinging everyday, plus I got work (bling)"], "meaning": "This has a double meaning: Turk is collecting bling every day because he is making money. Concurrently, bling is being like a gun sound (“bling blinging”). Turk says he has work, which can mean either he is packing heat or his work involves shooting a gun.", "annotation_id": "9059960", "url": "https://genius.com/9059960", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "All these karats like I’m a fucking vegetarian", "vault_lines": ["All these karats like I'm a fucking vegetarian"], "meaning": "A play on the word “karats” which is a homophone to “carrots”. Lil Wayne has so many you’d think that he is a millionaire (because he is).", "annotation_id": "2975686", "url": "https://genius.com/2975686", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shine", "line": "Niggas steady baller block", "vault_lines": ["Niggas steady baller block"], "meaning": "“Baller Blockin” means getting in the way of someone from getting their money, or hustle on, etc. Cash money millionaires also made a multi platinum Movie and soundtrack entitled “Baller Blockin”", "annotation_id": "1890067", "url": "https://genius.com/1890067", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
