{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Shh", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-and-rich-the-kid-shh-lyrics", "genius_title": "Shh", "genius_id": 7239126, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She’s a Ryder", "line": "And she owns two twin pumps like a pair of heels No Nicole Richie, no Paris Hil’, just my gangsta boo", "vault_lines": ["And she owns two twin pumps like a pair of heels"], "meaning": "The “Double-Pump” Double Entendre\n\nGudda Gudda shifts the imagery from Prada fashion to “pump-action” ballistics. By contrasting his girl with Nicole Richie and Paris Hilton, he highlights that while those two were iconic 2000s childhood best friends famous for their high-end stiletto pumps, his woman’s “pumps” are twin firearms.\n\n\n\nHe uses their well-known friendship and shared fashion sense to emphasize a “lifestyle” divide: he isn’t hanging with socialites who just wear heels; he’s with a “gangsta” who carries weapons that match her footwear.", "annotation_id": "39690721", "url": "https://genius.com/39690721", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She’s a Ryder", "line": "Yeah, the devil wears Prada bitch, and she rydin’ for me, you don’t want no problems bitch", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, the devil wears Prada bitch, and she rydin' for me, you don't want no problems bitch"], "meaning": "The Devil Wears Prada\n\n This line flips the 2006 film title The Devil Wears Prada to project a mix of luxury and street loyalty.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6ZOZwUQKu3E\n\n By claiming the “Devil” is “rydin'” for him, Gudda Gudda is boasting that even a high-class, cold, or dangerous woman is completely devoted to his cause. It’s a classic mixtape-era flex: using a high-fashion pop culture reference to warn rivals that his circle is both elite and armed.", "annotation_id": "39690623", "url": "https://genius.com/39690623", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She’s a Ryder", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-shes-a-ryder-lyrics", "genius_title": "She’s a Ryder", "genius_id": 61522, "source": "api"}
