{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She Will", "line": "But I’m Ray Charles to the bullshit", "vault_lines": ["But I'm Ray Charles to the bullshit"], "meaning": "Ray Charles was an American musician, composer and singer-songwriter and a pioneer for Soul music. He was legally blind since the age of seven.", "annotation_id": "15481020", "url": "https://genius.com/15481020", "state": "accepted", "votes": 55, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She Will", "line": "And you could take that to the bank and deposit that Put your two cents in and get a dollar back", "vault_lines": ["And you could take that to the bank and deposit that"], "meaning": "“Two cents” is an idiom for ideas or thoughts that one contributes to a topic or discussion.\n\nHere, Wayne suggests that you “make an investment” by sharing your ideas and that you can earn a return from it.  The bank may serve as metaphor the rap business, meaning then that if you want to convey your lyrics in rap form, people may be receptive of it and you can earn money back from putting something out there that you were worried may not be beneficial, such as saying something controversial or uninteresting.", "annotation_id": "11622733", "url": "https://genius.com/11622733", "state": "accepted", "votes": 38, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She Will", "line": "So on my Libra scale, I’m weighin’ sins and forgiveness", "vault_lines": ["So on my Libra scale, I'm weighin' sins and forgiveness"], "meaning": "A libra scale. In it, he’s weighing sins and forgiveness.\n\nHe is also referencing his own astrological sign. Since his birthday is September 27th, his sign is Libra, the scales (cf. “I’m a lucky Libra”)\n\nOsiris is also known for weighing the hearts of the dead against a feather to decide if they were worthy of reward or punishment.", "annotation_id": "316784", "url": "https://genius.com/316784", "state": "accepted", "votes": 63, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She Will", "line": "Karma is a bitch? Well, just make sure that bitch is beautiful", "vault_lines": ["Karma is a bitch? Well, just make sure that bitch is beautiful"], "meaning": "Karma in Hinduism is the concept of “action” or “deed”, understood as that which causes the entire cycle of cause and effect\n\nWeezy is all about reciprocation – perhaps this explains why he’s always down to eat pussy…\n\nAs he says on Wayne On Me:\n\nShe give me mine, I give hers back\nIf she a bad bitch, she deserve that..\n\nKarma is inevitable so conduct yourself in such a way to guarantee good outcomes. In other words, do good.", "annotation_id": "316781", "url": "https://genius.com/316781", "state": "accepted", "votes": 86, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
