{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "She Don’t Put It Down", "line": "She don’t do the blogs, but if she did, she’d be on mad sites", "vault_lines": ["She don’t do the blogs, but if she did, she’d be on mad sites"], "meaning": "Budden is a famed Internet addict, known for his video blogs (check out his website: Joe Budden TV) and he also frequently updates his social media accounts. He is usually with his girl of the moment in his video blogs\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&v=xIabCAqRvc4", "annotation_id": "1156926", "url": "https://genius.com/1156926", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
