{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sharks", "line": "Key to do this shit is first you gotta do it, then do it again and find another way to do it", "vault_lines": ["Snakes ain't always in the grass"], "meaning": "“First you gotta do it” referencing I Do It, a song off his first album, Finally Famous.\nHe is saying that to get your self a name in the game you have to do the impossible and stay relevant multiple times.\nAlso, as the bar goes on he runs out of breathe. This represents how much harder it gets every time he has to please the world. He “runs out of breathe” again in the bar “I’m finna pop my shit until I fizzle out”, meaning even though it’s hard and exhausting, he will continue to make music.", "annotation_id": "40044164", "url": "https://genius.com/40044164", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sharks", "line": "Glock under pillow on some missin’ tooth shit", "vault_lines": ["Glock under pillow on some missin' tooth shit"], "meaning": "When a kid looses a tooth, they put it under their pillow so the tooth fairy will exchange it for some money. Sean, however, puts a glock under his pillow for protection. This is the first of many bars about the distrust he feels toward his peers.", "annotation_id": "40044094", "url": "https://genius.com/40044094", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sharks", "line": "But like they bank accounts, it’s all figured out", "vault_lines": ["But like they bank accounts, it's all figured out"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Sean’s song All Figured Out off of Hall Of Fame. In which he says, “It’s crazy how they think you got it all figured out. Just because your bank account gets all figured out”\n\nHe is saying that his family’s bank accounts are now all figured out, or they are rich. At the same time saying that his family feeling stuck has been all figured out.", "annotation_id": "40044064", "url": "https://genius.com/40044064", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
