{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sharks", "line": "I just roll with the winners", "vault_lines": ["I just roll with the winners"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is villifying both the left and right, noting they both have hidden agendas. By siding the Republicans, getting a pardon from Trump, he just rolls with the winners (as Trump won the 2024 election.) This is intended not to say the right is good, just not worse than the left. And they won.", "annotation_id": "35819943", "url": "https://genius.com/35819943", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
