{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex In The Lounge", "line": "But if you scared, go to church", "vault_lines": ["But if you scared, go to church"], "meaning": "The phrase If you scared, go to church is a reference to Ice Cube’s song meaning “The streets really ain’t for you”.\n\nWhereas in this songs interpretation, Lil' Wayne is somewhat saying in other words, “If you can’t take the heat, get out the kitchen”", "annotation_id": "682142", "url": "https://genius.com/682142", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex In The Lounge", "line": "My house so big that bitch came with a lobby", "vault_lines": ["My house so big that bitch came with a lobby"], "meaning": "Can be read as both literally and metaphorically.\n\nLiterally interpretation: His house is actually that “big” because he’s famous and has a lot of money that any “bitch” can come in.\n\nMetaphorically interpretation: This house that is “big” is a metaphor for his penis. Once this “bitch' saw it, she \"came with a lobby” which suggests that she instantly had sex with hm.", "annotation_id": "679580", "url": "https://genius.com/679580", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex In The Lounge", "line": "She be like, “Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.”", "vault_lines": ["She be like, \"Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.\""], "meaning": "The repetition of the word “oh” suggests that the girl has multiple orgasms. However it could be read differently. As she sings to him “ooh, oh, oh” she is subtly wants sex. This act could be foreplay.", "annotation_id": "679534", "url": "https://genius.com/679534", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex In The Lounge", "line": "Don’t I stunt on these bitches?", "vault_lines": ["Don't I stunt on these bitches?"], "meaning": "To “Stunt” is to make alot of money, drive nice cars, & have nice clothes. So when she says that she stunts on these bitches (other females) she means that everything she does is better, whether it be how much money she makes, or how big her house is.", "annotation_id": "678844", "url": "https://genius.com/678844", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex In The Lounge", "line": "Though he packin’ that muscle, I’m addicted to brain", "vault_lines": ["Though he packin' that muscle, I'm addicted to brain"], "meaning": "This is a clever line. In high school, jocks with the muscle tend to get picked over geeks with the brain.\n\nNicki’s man has muscle, but she doesn’t care about that so much. She’d rather have a man with intellect.\n\nGiven the second meaning of brain (slang for oral sex), though, what she probably really wants is not a smart guy, but rather a man who can pleasure her orally.", "annotation_id": "671715", "url": "https://genius.com/671715", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
