{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex Faces", "line": "Because she can suck a golf ball through a garden hose", "vault_lines": ["Because she can suck a golf ball through a garden hose"], "meaning": "A golf ball wouldn’t normally fit through a garden hose, so this girl must have extraordinary sucking abilities. Similar to “you can suck a softball through a straw”.", "annotation_id": "236637", "url": "https://genius.com/236637", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
