{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Sex Faces", "line": "Yeah, she never plays games like the Parker bros", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, she never plays games like the Parker bros"], "meaning": "Parker Brothers is the name of a popular toy and game manufacturer, best known for board games such as Monopoly, Clue, Risk, and Trivial Pursuit. Unlike Parker Brothers, this girl doesn’t play games and cuts right to the chase.", "annotation_id": "236568", "url": "https://genius.com/236568", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
