{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Athletes still gettin’ jacked like they missin’ tires", "vault_lines": ["Athletes still gettin' jacked like they missin' tires"], "meaning": "Being “jacked” means to be very muscular and athletes are often known to be in very good physical shape, so they are referred to as “jacked”, but when a car needs a tire replacement it also needs to be lifted off the ground this action is called “jacking” up the car.", "annotation_id": "26667943", "url": "https://genius.com/26667943", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
