{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Lay a nigga down, Nina sang his ass a lullaby", "vault_lines": ["Lay a nigga down, Nina sang his ass a lullaby"], "meaning": "A lullaby is read to someone who is trying to go to sleep.\nIn this case Lil Wayne is saying that his nina (gun) was reading a lullaby to someone.  The only way a gun can “talk” is to be shot, Lil Wayne is saying that his gun was talking or reading a lullaby to put someone to “sleep” or kill them", "annotation_id": "26667905", "url": "https://genius.com/26667905", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
