{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Got the Yay locked down like Kim K", "vault_lines": ["Got the Yay locked down like Kim K"], "meaning": "A play on words between yay (or yayo, short for cocaine) and ye (one of Kanye West’s nicknames). Kanye got married to Kim Kardashian in 2014 and Wayne similarly has his stash on “lock down”.", "annotation_id": "18350573", "url": "https://genius.com/18350573", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Bullet ain’t got no name, nigga, but you could get it customized", "vault_lines": ["Bullet ain't got no name, nigga, but you could get it customized"], "meaning": "The saying “Bullet ain’t got no name” is basically another way to say Stray Bullet. Meaning that the bullet can hit the wrong person, completely missing the person it was intended to hit.\n\nWayne is saying that although a bullet doesn’t have a name, he can customize the bullet to where it has his enemies name on it and it will definitely hit the person he wants it to hit.", "annotation_id": "17118075", "url": "https://genius.com/17118075", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Fuck me? It’s fuck you if it’s fuck me", "vault_lines": ["Fuck me? It's fuck you if it's fuck me"], "meaning": "Wayne isn’t likely to start shit with somebody without a reason. However, if you start some shit with him, expect the argument to end swiftly and violently as the full weight of Weezy’s wrath befalls you.", "annotation_id": "7149938", "url": "https://genius.com/7149938", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "We got bitches, we got beer, we got Bobby Brown", "vault_lines": ["We got bitches, we got beer, we got Bobby Brown"], "meaning": "Bobby Brown is a famous R&B singer most notable for being the ex-husband of the iconic singer Whitney Houston, and his excessive cocaine habit. There’s nothing like relaxing with drinks, cocaine, music, and women.", "annotation_id": "4784471", "url": "https://genius.com/4784471", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Stack of hundred dollar bills in a scrunchie", "vault_lines": ["Stack of hundred dollar bills in a scrunchie"], "meaning": "A scrunchie is an elastic hair tie, and can be used just like a rubber band when it comes to tying money together.", "annotation_id": "4784467", "url": "https://genius.com/4784467", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Disrespect the caterpillar, rave about the butterfly", "vault_lines": ["Disrespect the caterpillar, rave about the butterfly"], "meaning": "Using a metaphor about the transformation of a caterpillar into a butterfly, Wayne has observed that people talk about others who are down/broke, but when they get up and start earning money, those same people change their tune to one of admiration instead.", "annotation_id": "4782759", "url": "https://genius.com/4782759", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Oh Lord, these niggas soft, these niggas fluffy Another one bites the dust ’til his gums bleed", "vault_lines": ["Another one bites the dust 'til his gums bleed"], "meaning": "To “bite the dust” is a term used for people who have been defeated, injured or killed. Wayne is picking off his enemies one by one. If one literally bites the dust, your mouth would start bleeding.\n\n“Another One Bites The Dust” is also a song by Queens.", "annotation_id": "4767734", "url": "https://genius.com/4767734", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Chop a cocaine brick like a sensei", "vault_lines": ["Chop a cocaine brick like a sensei"], "meaning": "“Brick” is another term for cocaine, and “chopping bricks” is a technique done in various martial arts. Ironically, Wayne was also featured on the “Karate Chop Remix.”", "annotation_id": "4760878", "url": "https://genius.com/4760878", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "It’s all about the Young fuckin’ Money", "vault_lines": ["It's all about the Young fuckin' Money"], "meaning": "This is a callback to the original song, “All About The Money,” where the hook states “It’s all about the motherfucking money.”\n\nWith Wayne’s recent label problems, he only cares about Young Money, his division of YMCMB.", "annotation_id": "4760539", "url": "https://genius.com/4760539", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "This that Sorry 4 the Wait 2 I’m so sorry, I feel terrible Yeah, I know I keep on telling you", "vault_lines": ["Oh Lord, I'm Sorry 4 the Wait, nigga"], "meaning": "This is the 2nd installment of his Sorry 4 The Wait mixtape series. He’s also apologetic fans have to wait for his new album, Tha Carter V. The album was expected to drop back in October of 2014, but issues with Cash Money forced album delays.", "annotation_id": "4760530", "url": "https://genius.com/4760530", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Oh Lord, one of the wildest B’s in my hive I’ll sting a bitch and die anytime", "vault_lines": ["Oh Lord, one of the wildest B's in my hive"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is affiliated with the Blood Gang, and Bloods are often referred to as B’s (bees). To “sting a bitch” refers to both shooting someone, and having sex with a woman. Whatever it is, Wayne is willing to put his life on the line for a moment of fun, making him the wildest in his gang (hive).\n\nMany people believe that bees will die after they sting someone, but honey bees are only type this is true for, while other bees (and wasps) will live to see another day. Honey bees have large stingers with backwards-facing barbs, and when stinging someone, their barbs will be stuck in the flesh. When the honey bee flies away their entire stinging apparatus will remain in your skin and they’ll die as a result of the rupture.", "annotation_id": "4759997", "url": "https://genius.com/4759997", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Oh Lord, Public Enemy, Chuck D", "vault_lines": ["Oh Lord, Public Enemy, Chuck D"], "meaning": "Chuck D is the leader of the rap group Public Enemy.", "annotation_id": "4759879", "url": "https://genius.com/4759879", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Got some tricks up my sleeves, I need some cufflinks", "vault_lines": ["Got some tricks up my sleeves, I need some cufflinks"], "meaning": "A cufflink is a button-type contraption that tightens sleeves on a button-down shirt. “Having a trick up your sleeve” is an idiom for having a secret strategy, and Wayne would metaphorically need cufflinks to make sure the tricks don’t fall out.", "annotation_id": "4758195", "url": "https://genius.com/4758195", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Get rid of the residue Get rid of all the white, like Selsun Blue", "vault_lines": ["Get rid of the residue"], "meaning": "Selsun Blue is a dandruff shampoo, and is used to treat tinea versicolor, (among other things), a type of fungus that has a white-like shade. The “white” Weezy is talking about is cocaine, and he wishes to get rid of any clue of him cooking it.", "annotation_id": "4757540", "url": "https://genius.com/4757540", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Selsun Blue", "line": "Motherfuckers better fuckin’ hide, I feel like Mr. Hyde", "vault_lines": ["Motherfuckers better fuckin' hide, I feel like Mr. Hyde"], "meaning": "In the story, Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde, Dr Jekyll has a split personality, with Mr.Hyde being his “evil” personality. Wayne is warning others that his krazy side coming out.", "annotation_id": "4757357", "url": "https://genius.com/4757357", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
