{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Screwed Up", "line": "Oh yeah these diamonds in my mouth, showing I rep the South", "vault_lines": ["Oh yeah these diamonds in my mouth, showing I rep the South"], "meaning": "As you may know to wear grills is an essential part of hip-hop culture in the south, even many rappers that don’t rep the dirty south are wearing grills now.\n\n\n\nThe line might be inspired by this song “From The South” by Z-Ro:\n\nFrom the South\nI got the diamonds in my mouth", "annotation_id": "4231438", "url": "https://genius.com/4231438", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Screwed Up", "line": "Whether the club or in the hood, I’m still gon make it rain", "vault_lines": ["Whether the club or in the hood, I'm still gon make it rain"], "meaning": "There are two meanings to “make it rain” here:\n\n\nWhen he is in the club he throws money.\nBut in the hood he “makes it rain” on people who approach him wrong by spraying bullets from his chopper.\n\n\n\nAlso note that together with Z-Ro he made a song called “Rain”:\n\nMotherfucker can you stand the rain?\nCause if we spray these K’s, we gon'shut ya block down\nTell me nigga can you stand the rain?", "annotation_id": "4184306", "url": "https://genius.com/4184306", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Screwed Up", "line": "I guess I’m fly, cause my do’s in the air and trunk is humming", "vault_lines": ["I guess I'm fly, cause my do's in the air and trunk is humming"], "meaning": "Trae got them speakers in the trunk and is after texan standards “draped out”, what means looking clean.\nHe also got them “butterfly doors” that are often confused with suicide doors.", "annotation_id": "4174533", "url": "https://genius.com/4174533", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
