{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Salute", "line": "Your highest title, numero uno", "vault_lines": ["Your highest title, numero uno"], "meaning": "Fab opened this song by calling himself the G-EN-ER-AL – the highest rank in the army.\n\n\n\nThis line is a direct reference to the opening lines of Special Ed’s I Got It Made, one of the most famous opening lines of any rap song.", "annotation_id": "2626920", "url": "https://genius.com/2626920", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
