{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "S On My Chest", "line": "I walk around like I got a “S” on my chest (Uh-huh) I walk, I walk around like I got a “S” on my chest (Yeah) I walk, I walk around like I got a “S” on my chest (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I walk around like I got a \"S\" on my chest (Uh-huh)"], "meaning": "Meanin' he’s actin like Superman, who has the letter “s” on his costume. Also a sample of this line from “What Up Gangsta” by 50 Cent", "annotation_id": "403268", "url": "https://genius.com/403268", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
