{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "I hear gunshots at my door, hold on, who is it?", "vault_lines": ["I hear gunshots at my door, hold on, who is it?"], "meaning": "Wayne could be assuming that one of his homies is shooting somebody outside and it’s so commonplace that his first instinct is to open the door. He could also be referring to an enemy outside and is challenging him to come inside", "annotation_id": "25401777", "url": "https://genius.com/25401777", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "On some DMX shit, we gon’ be like, “We right here, nigga”", "vault_lines": ["On some DMX shit, we gon' be like, \"We right here, nigga\""], "meaning": "In a heartwarming skit at the end of Kanye West’s “Life of the Party”, we hear audio of rapper DMX on an amusement park ride with his daughter. She starts crying and X responds by saying “It’s ok baby. Daddy’s here. Daddy’s gonna be right here.”\n\nWayne gives the line a more sinister twist by claiming that him and his team are gonna be ready for their enemies, before they even know what’s going on", "annotation_id": "25401775", "url": "https://genius.com/25401775", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "I be higher than the Solar System, get rich and control the system I was servin’ it like, Anna Kournikova From a Nissan Pathfinder, now I have to find a chauffer", "vault_lines": ["I be higher than the Solar System, get rich and control the system"], "meaning": "Having enough cash can allow you to really bypass the American judicial system; and get you out of any legal situation imaginable. Very poignant line coming from Tunechi, who was actually pardoned from firearms charges by none other than former US President Donald Trump. https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/politics-news/lil-wayne-pardoned-4118019/\n\nThe second line has a couple different interpretations. Given that Wayne has been arrested multiple times on weapon and drug charges, he could be boasting about how he has served the system by doing time. However, it could also refer to serving drugs, as a Nissan Pathfinder is a car that you can trap out of.\n\nAnna Kournikova is a former tennis player who won multiple Grand Slams with partner Martina Hingle, hence the sports term “serving”", "annotation_id": "25401722", "url": "https://genius.com/25401722", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "Good on both coasts like I’m LJ,", "vault_lines": ["Good on both coasts like I'm LJ,"], "meaning": "Basketball legend Lebron James started out on the Miami Heat and later moved on to the LA Lakers. He managed to hold his own on both teams, winning multiple awards and championships with each", "annotation_id": "25400022", "url": "https://genius.com/25400022", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "I’m gettin’ older, other day I told my soldiers Spare nothin’ except the strollers, but my heart used to be colder", "vault_lines": ["I'm gettin' older, other day I told my soldiers"], "meaning": "Wayne advises his shooters to kill everything except for babies and young kids because of their innocent nature. Somewhat recalls the “Scarface” scene where Tony refuses to detonate a car bomb because there is a woman and child inside:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZcQtUdZ5Afs", "annotation_id": "25399959", "url": "https://genius.com/25399959", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "And the coke got me sweatin’, keep a towel on my shoulder Like I used to coach the Georgetown Hoyas", "vault_lines": ["And the coke got me sweatin', keep a towel on my shoulder"], "meaning": "Legendary Former Georgetown Hoyas Basketball Coach John Thompson Jr. was often seen court side with a white town draped over his shoulder.", "annotation_id": "21241758", "url": "https://genius.com/21241758", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "Yeah, my shit’s bad like Lauryn, I ran into her On my last night tourin’, I’m a mack, like, hol’ up", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, my shit's bad like Lauryn, I ran into her"], "meaning": "Actor Mack Wilds was influenced to start his music career by Lauryn Hill.", "annotation_id": "20299614", "url": "https://genius.com/20299614", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "Got a key and a Glock, I took the paper route", "vault_lines": ["Got a key and a Glock, I took the paper route"], "meaning": "This is a reference to another rapper, Key Glock who is signed to Young Dolph’s label, PAPER ROUTE EMPIRE.", "annotation_id": "20047017", "url": "https://genius.com/20047017", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Russian Roulette", "line": "And your shooters better be some fuckin’ Golden State Warriors", "vault_lines": ["And your shooters better be some fuckin' Golden State Warriors"], "meaning": "The Golden State Warriors, led by Stephen Curry and Klay Thompson, are widely regarded as the greatest three-point shooting team in NBA history.\n\nWayne is saying that his opponent’s shooters better be as accurate with their guns as the Warriors are with a basketball.", "annotation_id": "20022857", "url": "https://genius.com/20022857", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
