{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run for It", "line": "You thank I’m playin’a somthin’ lil whodie I ain’t trippin’ Tha beef started last week and dem niggas still be hittin’ Two children got killed and a ol’ lady got hit Look I’m bout ta git tha fuck cause I ain’ got no time fo’ dis shit", "vault_lines": ["You thank I'm playin'a somthin' lil whodie I ain't trippin'"], "meaning": "The beef is causing innocent bystanders to get killed and or hit in the crossfire. It’s too much for Juvenile so he’s staying out the way.", "annotation_id": "27333710", "url": "https://genius.com/27333710", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run for It", "line": "Load it up and slide it in Cock it back pop it out we ridin’", "vault_lines": ["Load it up and slide it in"], "meaning": "These lines are a reference to “Blood Thicker” from the Hot Boys' debut album the year before,\n\n“(Juvenile)Load it up slide it in cock it back pop it out\nLoad it up slide it in yall die\n(Lil Wayne) Load it up slide it in cock it back pop it out\nCMB226 we all ride”.", "annotation_id": "17944926", "url": "https://genius.com/17944926", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
