{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run for It", "line": "My big brother Juvie Tol’ me not to eva letta nigga screw me Tol’ me if I eva did he would do me Gave me two guns and sent me round dey shootin’ And then they start runnin’", "vault_lines": ["My big brother Juvie"], "meaning": "This is Lil Wayne thanking Juvenile who gave Wayne some pretty good counsel to basically never be anyone’s doormat or take anyone’s shit.", "annotation_id": "4029222", "url": "https://genius.com/4029222", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run for It", "line": "Hardest niggas on tha block started actin like a woman", "vault_lines": ["Hardest niggas on tha block started actin like a woman"], "meaning": "Actin like a Woman – Exhibiting  more typical feminine qualities such as being scared or weak.\n\nWayne is saying that dudes can be hard as hell but once the shots get firing and the heat of battle ensues you never know how they are going to act.", "annotation_id": "2678693", "url": "https://genius.com/2678693", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run for It", "line": "Now if ya at dat second line and dem boyz gotta gun", "vault_lines": ["Now if ya at dat second line and dem boyz gotta gun"], "meaning": "A second line is a walk/dance following a brass band parade, most commonly found in the streets of New Orleans following a wedding, party, funeral or other celebration.\n\nJuve is saying to watch your back even during a fun celebration because you never know when someone has it out for you.", "annotation_id": "2678684", "url": "https://genius.com/2678684", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
