{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Run This Town", "line": "Man, I go crazy on the beat, I go nimrod", "vault_lines": ["Man, I go crazy on the beat, I go nimrod"], "meaning": "Nimrod – Noah’s great-grandson in the Bible – was a great king, credited by the Yahwist with the creation of the Tower of Babel and generalized “rebellion against G-d”\n\nBuilding a huge tower is a crazy thing to do, so to “go Nimrod” is to go crazy (the Tower is credited with fracturing human language, which gives added rap meaning)", "annotation_id": "9795", "url": "https://genius.com/9795", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
