{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rudeboi", "line": "That snake owe me two billion, don’t fuck with the reptilian", "vault_lines": ["That snake owe me two billion, don't fuck with the reptilian"], "meaning": "Wayne refers to his on-and-off beef with Birdman (the “snake/reptilian”), who Wayne has repeatedly claimed owes him a figure totaling in the hundreds of millions of dollars (or, in this case, $2 billion).\n\nBirdman, himself, has claimed that he made $2 billion from his work as the CEO of Cash Money Records. Wayne is telling Birdman that every one of these dollars is “owed” to Wayne.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-cGjo6DrBsE", "annotation_id": "34928433", "url": "https://genius.com/34928433", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
