{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rubber Burner", "line": "Beating up the block knocking pictures off the wall", "vault_lines": ["Beating up the block knocking pictures off the wall"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Houston rapper Yungstar’s hit song Knocking Pictures Off Da Wall.\n\nThe meaning of the line and Yungstar song is that the bass in the car is so loud, that as you drive down the block houses' walls shake and pictures fall off the wall.\n\nhttps://genius.com/779174", "annotation_id": "40928812", "url": "https://genius.com/40928812", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rubber Burner", "line": "Sittin’ sideways yea I’m leanin’", "vault_lines": ["Sittin' sideways yea I'm leanin'"], "meaning": "Where the original name for getting high off of cough syrup, or leaning, came from. It’ll have you so fucked up that you’ll be sitting sideways, or basically laying down on the couch.", "annotation_id": "11498241", "url": "https://genius.com/11498241", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
