{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rubber Burner", "line": "And no longer am I gonna pop tags off my clothes Dudes need to know I spent big cash on my clothes", "vault_lines": ["And no longer am I gonna pop tags off my clothes"], "meaning": "The phrase “popping tags” has been used by many rappers (Jay-Z, Future, Chief Keef to say that they’re buying expensive clothing and not caring about the price, but Juelz says he’s going to start leaving the tags on his clothes so people can see how much they really cost.", "annotation_id": "11498160", "url": "https://genius.com/11498160", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rubber Burner", "line": "Louis Vuitton sneaks on the pedal Do 100 for a mile like my feet went to sleep on the pedal", "vault_lines": ["Louis Vuitton sneaks on the pedal"], "meaning": "Usually when people are driving fast and expensive cars like Juelz is, they will show off and break the speed limit for a few seconds, but Juelz goes 100mph for a full mile, as if his foot had fallen asleep on the gas and he couldn’t move it. While wearing the Louis sneakers of course.", "annotation_id": "11498148", "url": "https://genius.com/11498148", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rubber Burner", "line": "Plus, U-turnin’ in that S550 Look like I’m U-turnin’ in a jet Why did he do that When he just came through Why did he come back I’m just frontin’ how you, how you?", "vault_lines": ["Plus, U-turnin' in that S550"], "meaning": "Juelz is driving in a Mercedes S550, which is about a $100,000 car. His car’s so flashy and futuristic that it looks like he’s in a Jet driving around the streets, and he’s doing U-turns to keep driving by and stunting on everyone.", "annotation_id": "11498125", "url": "https://genius.com/11498125", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
