{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ritual", "line": "Break the bank like I break the backboard, they call me Shaq", "vault_lines": ["Break the bank like I break the backboard, they call me Shaq"], "meaning": "Reference to former NBA player Shaquille “Shaq” O'Neal who was so big and strong that he would literally break basketball backboards with powerful dunks. The NBA even had to strengthen their goals because of Shaq.", "annotation_id": "38035124", "url": "https://genius.com/38035124", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ritual", "line": "My niggas built the empire off perch (Woo) That’s fish and my niggas had bricks of it (Ah)", "vault_lines": ["My niggas built the empire off perch (Woo)"], "meaning": "Conway is from Buffalo which borders Lake Erie, which is famous for its Yellow Perch fishery. Yellow perch is very good eating and its a flaky buttery flesh. High quality cocaine is known as fish scale because of its consistency.", "annotation_id": "25058690", "url": "https://genius.com/25058690", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ritual", "line": "Flooded Jesus in that grey coupe at the grittiest times", "vault_lines": ["Flooded Jesus in that grey coupe at the grittiest times"], "meaning": "A flooded Jesus is a Jesus chain. In his life’s worst moments, or more or less if someone may come to harm him, he’ll have faith with him.", "annotation_id": "24015767", "url": "https://genius.com/24015767", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
