{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ride or Die", "line": "So ride or die bitch Chop or get chopped ho B.G., split or get split Play the game how it go So ride or die bitch Chop or get chopped ho B.G., split or get split Play the game how it go So ride or die bitch Chop or get chopped ho B.G., split or get split Play the game how it go So ride or die bitch Chop or get chopped ho B.G., split or get split Play the game how it go", "vault_lines": ["So ride or die bitch"], "meaning": "The hook for this song is sampled from one of BG’s verses from his song “Let’s Get Funky” from his album Its All On U Volume 1.", "annotation_id": "2508417", "url": "https://genius.com/2508417", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ride or Die", "line": "Uptown is my home, thats where I do my dirt I either hurt or get hurt It’s me or you on that shirt", "vault_lines": ["Uptown is my home, thats where I do my dirt"], "meaning": "The beginning of B.G.’s verse on this song is used for part of the chorus of “Uptown My Home” on B.G.’s Chopper City in the Ghetto album.", "annotation_id": "2508356", "url": "https://genius.com/2508356", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
