{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ride With The Mack", "line": "The coupe I’m in say ”va va voom”, then it go pe’hune", "vault_lines": ["The coupe I'm in say \"va va voom\", then it go pe'hune"], "meaning": "His coupe is sexy and exciting. “Va va voom” is also a description of the sound a car makes, as is “pe'hune”.", "annotation_id": "1642660", "url": "https://genius.com/1642660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
