{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Ride With The Mack", "line": "Roll with duct tape and ride with the Mack Roll with duct tape and r-r-r-r-ride with the Mack Roll with duct tape and ride with the Mack Roll with duct tape and r-r-r-r-ride with the Mack", "vault_lines": ["Roll with duct tape and ride with the Mack"], "meaning": "This song is all about going hard in the hood. They drive around with duct tape in case they have to kidnap someone, and a Mac (a type of gun) in case trouble starts.\nIt also refers to Mack Maine, who Lil Wayne and Dizzy ride around the hood with.\n\n\n\nA Mac 10 sub-machine gun\n\n\n\nA Mack Maine", "annotation_id": "1640082", "url": "https://genius.com/1640082", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
