{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rich Niggaz", "line": "Then that’s when I pull up in the B-E-L", "vault_lines": ["Then that's when I pull up in the B-E-L"], "meaning": "B-E-L stands for Bubble eye Lex. The late 90s Lexus' looked like they had bubble eyes or frog eyes at least in the opinion of many cash money artists of the day and they reffered to them as such.", "annotation_id": "37235300", "url": "https://genius.com/37235300", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
