{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rich Niggaz", "line": "Loud pipes, big rims Nigga, that’s my life When I pull up at the club sorry that’s my night I know a lot of haters probably sayin’ that that’s not right Well, my diamonds so much bigger So, that’s my life", "vault_lines": ["Loud pipes, big rims"], "meaning": "On Lil Wayne’s “Loud Pipes”, Juvenile sings a variation of this phrase for the hook.\n\nLoud Pipes, big rims whodie that’s our life\nWhen we pull up at the club sorry that’s our night\nI know a lot haters out there sayin that’s not right\nBut our diamonds are much bigger, so that’s our life\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c6P3lnrFQ7Y", "annotation_id": "6310492", "url": "https://genius.com/6310492", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rich Niggaz", "line": "Bling Bling", "vault_lines": ["Now, I only carry big faces and you hear the ching, ching"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne joined a very short list of rappers to coin a term that would go on to be included in the Oxford dictionary with these two words.\n\nIn the Oxford, bling is defined as:\n\n“Denoting expensive, ostentatious clothing and jewelry, or the style or materialistic attitudes associated with them:”", "annotation_id": "2918993", "url": "https://genius.com/2918993", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rich Niggaz", "line": "Meet me in the casino, way in the back Losin’ money like a motherfucker, still shootin’ craps", "vault_lines": ["Meet me in the casino, way in the back"], "meaning": "If you are looking for Terius Gray he will be in the rear of the Casino at the craps table. Even though he is down he is still playing in hopes of winning some of his money back.", "annotation_id": "2829067", "url": "https://genius.com/2829067", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
