{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rich Niggaz", "line": "I got more ends than Bunny have in a factory", "vault_lines": ["I got more ends than Bunny have in a factory"], "meaning": "He has more money than Bunny Bread has bread in its factory.\n\nThis actually has multiple meanings. Juve is referring to the ends of each loaf of bread.  Bread and Ends also refer to money.", "annotation_id": "1322171", "url": "https://genius.com/1322171", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
