{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Revolver", "line": "I’m a sex pistol, my love should be illegal", "vault_lines": ["My sex is a killer"], "meaning": "The Sex Pistols were a British punk rock band who are praised as one of the greatest punk-rock acts of all time, despite only releasing one studio album.\n\nMadonna is implying that her sex is so good that it’s dangerous (or even killer), like a pistol.", "annotation_id": "14262887", "url": "https://genius.com/14262887", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
