{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Respect Us", "line": "Weezy Wee, let ’em burn, bring the fire truck in", "vault_lines": ["Weezy Wee, let 'em burn, bring the fire truck in"], "meaning": "This is the first appearance of the “Weezy Wee” nickname. This later becomes the name of his version of cranking that Soulja Boy\n\nHe spits flames, so you’re going to need someone to put them out. Honestly though, it’s too much fire for a fire extinguisher, you should just call the fire department", "annotation_id": "2162458", "url": "https://genius.com/2162458", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
