{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Respect My Conglomerate", "line": "Yeah, if you lucky I might hollow it", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, if you lucky I might hollow it"], "meaning": "A hollow-tipped bullet breaks apart during penetration, causing more tissue damage and blood loss or shock than a regular bullet. ‘Kiss is saying he’ll be short and sweet with your life, if you’re lucky.", "annotation_id": "602177", "url": "https://genius.com/602177", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
