{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Red Bandana", "line": "With my Red Chuck Taylors Skinny Jeans and my motherfuckin’ [Chorus: T-Streets] (Red bandana)", "vault_lines": ["I eat and sleep with my (Red bandana)"], "meaning": "The song is called Red Bandana, Wayne is a Blood, as he says, they wear a lot of red, Wayne’s saying his shoes and Jeans are red, the Blood gang color, so is his Bandana.", "annotation_id": "1065369", "url": "https://genius.com/1065369", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Red Bandana", "line": "T-shirt whiter than Hannah Montana", "vault_lines": ["T-shirt whiter than Hannah Montana"], "meaning": "Hannah Montana, really Miley Cyrus\n\n\n\nA white female singer, Who’s skin is very white, but Wayne’s T-shirt is whiter.", "annotation_id": "1065365", "url": "https://genius.com/1065365", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Red Bandana", "line": "Keep that click click, pow pow on the side like a mistress", "vault_lines": ["Keep that click click, pow pow on the side like a mistress"], "meaning": "He is referring to his gun, being on his waist.\n\nThis line can also go another way, as he says “on the side, like a mistress”, you have a main bitch, the main girl you talk to, then you have a mistress, the girl you keep on the side, get it?!\n\nQuite clever.", "annotation_id": "1065362", "url": "https://genius.com/1065362", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Red Bandana", "line": "I gotta red bitch, her name is Rose, I pull her thorns out", "vault_lines": ["I gotta red bitch, her name is Rose, I pull her thorns out"], "meaning": "Red Bitch, meaning RedBone, a very light skinned black girl. Rose is the comparison to his bitch. Roses have thorns, and thorns can be painful. Weezy intends to give her some relief.", "annotation_id": "1065354", "url": "https://genius.com/1065354", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Red Bandana", "line": "I can see these bitch niggas ain’t got no futures like they palms out", "vault_lines": ["I can see these bitch niggas ain't got no futures like they palms out"], "meaning": "Wayne is saying that he see’s bitch niggas future, through their palms,\n\n\n\n like he’s Psychic\n\nHaving one’s palms out also refers to being poor and looking for a handout.", "annotation_id": "1065343", "url": "https://genius.com/1065343", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
