{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "It’s kinda hard sayin’ this shit to your face So I do it over snares and bass", "vault_lines": ["It's kinda hard sayin' this shit to your face"], "meaning": "He has a hard time expressing his love to the woman in the song in person, so he prefers to do it in this song", "annotation_id": "30020521", "url": "https://genius.com/30020521", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "I haven’t hid nothin’ and you love everything", "vault_lines": ["I haven't hid nothin' and you love everything"], "meaning": "All things are out and open in the relationship and it is all love. That feeling when you can be yourself for however long when real love lingers.", "annotation_id": "16643756", "url": "https://genius.com/16643756", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "Work her, every time feel like the first one Perfect when a nigga stressin’ at work She take away all of the pain, make it lesser than dirt", "vault_lines": ["Work her, every time feel like the first one"], "meaning": "When Wayne comes home from a hard day of work, he can always count on her to be there to make him feel better. Whether it’s cooking for him, having sex with him, or simply being there to listen to his problems.\n\n\n\nHe values every moment they spend together and Wayne can always rely on her to take away relieve his pain and stress when they’re together.", "annotation_id": "2703053", "url": "https://genius.com/2703053", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "Young bull I know you love me like you never loved You know you couldn’t find a better thug", "vault_lines": ["I know you love me like you never loved"], "meaning": "Could possibly be referring to the mother of his first child, Toya Wright. They were together back in high school, therefore she was “peeping him” since he was young and “loved him like she never loved before”.\n\n\n\nFrom left to right: Toya Wright, Wayne, and their daughter Reginae.", "annotation_id": "2699070", "url": "https://genius.com/2699070", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "And you took another bitch husband, the other bitch wasn’t Doin’ shit for him She say she did too much, I say she did nothing She need to quit frontin’", "vault_lines": ["And you took another bitch husband, the other bitch wasn't"], "meaning": "He blossomed her, he matured her from what she was to what she has become and the fact that he made her a lover and not a club hopper he’s mad because now she has left him, his creation is gone.\n\nWayne isn’t mad at his girl or the man she’s currently with; but rather the man’s previous girlfriend who didn’t treat him properly and allowed him to become single.", "annotation_id": "1849586", "url": "https://genius.com/1849586", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "(I got to hold on, hold on to my receipt) It’s kinda hard sayin’ this shit to your face So I do it over snares and bass Music take me away (I got to hold on, hold on to my receipt) It’s kinda hard sayin’ this shit to your face So I do it over snares and bass Music take me away", "vault_lines": ["It's kinda hard sayin' this shit to your face"], "meaning": "Wayne wants to get back into a relationship with a past lover, that will make him feel better. He doesn’t know how to tell that to the girl personally, so he will just talk about it over this song.\n\nHence the “hold on to my receipt”. Wayne wants to hold on to the memories they had together and doesn’t want to forget about her. But at the same time he realizes that they are finished and there’s nothing he can do about it.", "annotation_id": "1039352", "url": "https://genius.com/1039352", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "She get high sometimes ‘cause I’m always doin’ it, yeah", "vault_lines": ["She get high sometimes 'cause I'm always doin' it, yeah"], "meaning": "Wayne’s girl get’s high occasionally when she’s around Wayne because he is always smoking weed.\n\nSo either she gets a second hand high (get high from all the smoke around) or she occasionally smokes with him, since it is so accessible and she’s always around it, so it is bound to happen.", "annotation_id": "1021757", "url": "https://genius.com/1021757", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "I’m married and divorced and my daughter is a woman And guess what? My daughter want another Sister or brother, and you lookin’ like a mother", "vault_lines": ["I'm married and divorced and my daughter is a woman"], "meaning": "Wayne is getting this girl caught up with his current life, and he wouldn’t mind making a baby with her.\n\nWayne already has a daughter (Reginae), however he divorced her mother (Toya Wright). So Wayne is saying that not only does he want to have a baby with this new woman, but his daughter is getting older and wants another sibling (either a sister or a brother).", "annotation_id": "1021747", "url": "https://genius.com/1021747", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Receipt", "line": "Destiny Child CD, song number three She cater to me ’til we fall asleep", "vault_lines": ["Destiny Child CD, song number three"], "meaning": "She fulfills Wayne’s sexual desires until they fall asleep together. Men are known to get tired after reaching their climax.\n\nThis is a reference to Destiny Child’s single “Cater 2 U” on their 2004 album Destiny Fulfilled. Wayne appeared on their song “Soldier”—another song off Destiny Fulfilled.", "annotation_id": "153413", "url": "https://genius.com/153413", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
