{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Realized", "line": "They know Weezy got more white than the Backstreet Boys", "vault_lines": ["They know Weezy got more white than the Backstreet Boys"], "meaning": "Wayne’s got more white (slang for cocaine) than the Backstreet Boys, a popular white boy band from the 90’s, had white members.", "annotation_id": "2645342", "url": "https://genius.com/2645342", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Realized", "line": "Sip the Coke mixed with Jack - Calico, clip to match", "vault_lines": ["Sip the Coke mixed with Jack - Calico, clip to match"], "meaning": "He’s drinking Coca-Cola mixed with Calico Jack; a rum titled after the infamous pirate of the same name.\n\n\n\nFun fact: At the time of this song’s release, Wayne wasn’t old enough to legally purchase or consume alcohol in the USA.", "annotation_id": "2645298", "url": "https://genius.com/2645298", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Realized", "line": "Yeah, y’all niggas faker than that boy (fill in the blank)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, y'all niggas faker than that boy (fill in the blank)"], "meaning": "“Master P” goes in the blank here (notice it rhymes with the previous line). There was an established New Orleans rivalry between Cash Money and No Limit at the time, so Wayne is taking some subtle shots at his opponents.", "annotation_id": "971227", "url": "https://genius.com/971227", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Realized", "line": "I’m raised in the slum where the bad grow", "vault_lines": ["I'm raised in the slum where the bad grow"], "meaning": "This is where Wayne was born and raised: the 17th Ward, New Orleans, Louisiana.\n\nHence, the number 17 on his stomach.", "annotation_id": "961553", "url": "https://genius.com/961553", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
