{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Real Shit (All On Me)", "line": "You’re homo’s, you’re not my homie First you was dickriding, now you riding on me", "vault_lines": ["You're homo's, you're not my homie"], "meaning": "In Kidd Kidd’s metaphor being homo (homosexual) is the opposite of being a homie.\nFirst the fake friends were dickriding him (= fucking with him and his music) to then ride on him (= exploit his success and money).", "annotation_id": "11512289", "url": "https://genius.com/11512289", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
