{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rax", "line": "Drop top Maybach on the way, yeah, that’s that new Landaulet", "vault_lines": ["Drop top Maybach on the way, yeah, that's that new Landaulet"], "meaning": "Weezy has an insane car collection, including a Mercedes-Maybach 62 Landaulet. In a report by Maybach Haus, Mercedes only built 18 pre-facelift 62 S Landaulet units and four facelifted variants before ending production in October 2012.\n\nFrom this article – https://www.slashgear.com/1178497/the-most-expensive-car-in-lil-waynes-collection/\n\n\nMercedes-Maybach 62 Landaulet\n\n\nWayne sticking out of the top of his Landaulet", "annotation_id": "40792766", "url": "https://genius.com/40792766", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rax", "line": "Two guns, I call ’em ”Kris Kross”; Kris Kross’ll make you jump", "vault_lines": ["Two guns, I call 'em \"Kris Kross\"; Kris Kross'll make you jump"], "meaning": "Kris Kross were a teenage rap duo from the 1990s, with their most commercially successful song being ‘Jump’", "annotation_id": "40792750", "url": "https://genius.com/40792750", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
