{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "Got a house on top the hill, I turn that bitch to Magic Mountain", "vault_lines": ["Got a house on top the hill, I turn that bitch to Magic Mountain"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne is boasting that not only does he live lavishly, but he also brings excitement and wild energy to that lifestyle—turning a luxury home into something as wild as an amusement park, similarly to how Six Flags: Magic Mountain encapsulates the feeling of wild fun.", "annotation_id": "35819575", "url": "https://genius.com/35819575", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "Ayy, ayy, crib in Calabasas Heard I live close by Iggy, I could send her some azaleas", "vault_lines": ["Ayy, ayy, crib in Calabasas"], "meaning": "Calabasas is a Californian city in the southwestern region of San Fernando Valley. Weezy claims that he heard he lives so close to rapper Iggy Azalea that he could send her some azalea flowers.\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/BqwsjfUCQAEVsnB?format=jpg&name=medium", "annotation_id": "35819516", "url": "https://genius.com/35819516", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "From me to Nipsey, I love Kross like I love Kameron, nigga", "vault_lines": ["From me to Nipsey, I love Kross like I love Kameron, nigga"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne and Lauren London have a son together named Kameron, featured on this song. Lauren London also has a son with Nipsey Hussle, named Kross.\n\nWayne is basically shouting out the blended family they all seem to have built together. There’s an interview (I can’t find it) where they ask Wayne what’s the first thing that comes to mind when he hears Nipsey’s name and he says “Father”. He explains that because of their sons his relationship with Nipsey was different than other rappers", "annotation_id": "35817457", "url": "https://genius.com/35817457", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "I’m goin’ back to Cali, nigga", "vault_lines": ["I'm goin' back to Cali, nigga"], "meaning": "This lyric nods to LL Cool J’s Going Back to Cali (1987) and The Notorious B.I.G.’s Going Back to Cali (1997), both iconic tracks that highlight the connection between East Coast and West Coast hip-hop.", "annotation_id": "35815869", "url": "https://genius.com/35815869", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "Gary Payton, on that glove", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' Gary Payton, on that glove"], "meaning": "Gary Payton’s nickname was the glove because of his defensive skills", "annotation_id": "35811854", "url": "https://genius.com/35811854", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "Sosa, not Sammy, nigga, m", "vault_lines": ["Sosa, not Sammy, nigga, m"], "meaning": "Sosa (Chief Keef) – Good teen artist\nSammy (“I like the way you move like that”) Fizzled out", "annotation_id": "35810179", "url": "https://genius.com/35810179", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "All my friends dead, rest in peace Matthew Perry", "vault_lines": ["All my friends dead, rest in peace Matthew Perry"], "meaning": "Matthew Perry was an actor best known for starring as Chandler Bing in the 1994 – 2004 sitcom Friends. He passed away in 2023 from accidental drowning.\n\n\n\nAdditionally, this could be a reference to Lil Uzi Vert’s viral track, “XO Tour Llif3”:\n\nAll my friends are dead, push me to the edge", "annotation_id": "35810081", "url": "https://genius.com/35810081", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rari", "line": "All eyes on me like I’m the new Makaveli", "vault_lines": ["All eyes on me like I'm the new Makaveli"], "meaning": "Weezy is referencing 2Pac’s 1996 album All Eyez on Me. Pac also went by the name “Makaveli” throughout his career, which was inspired by Italian diplomat and philosopher Niccolò Machiavelli.", "annotation_id": "35810007", "url": "https://genius.com/35810007", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
