{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rappapompom", "line": "Now he only got one eye like the pyramid", "vault_lines": ["Now he only got one eye like the pyramid"], "meaning": "A reference to the pyramid engraved on the back of the U.S. $1 bill.\n\n\n\nThe pyramid first appeared on the dollar bill in 1935. The single eye atop it is intended to represent the all-seeing eye of divine providence.", "annotation_id": "14248771", "url": "https://genius.com/14248771", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
