{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rap City Freestyle [2001]", "line": "Try to get my loot up In Cuba with a translator, get the coke newer Plus the prices is cooler, I come back to the hood with that dirty Tell ’em I’m like Tiger Woods, all I got is birdies", "vault_lines": ["Plus the prices is cooler, I come back to the hood with that dirty"], "meaning": "All these lines refer to the dope Lil Wayne got. He says he got cocaine from Cuba which has high quality coke for good price. He came back to his hood with it, and is making loot (money) from it.\n\nA birdie is a high score or par in golf. And Tiger is a golf superstar. Birds and Dirty are slang words for coke as well.", "annotation_id": "24832568", "url": "https://genius.com/24832568", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rap City Freestyle [2001]", "line": "Got women’s in they thirties calling Weezy papa But Weezy not daddy ma ’cause Weezy in and out chea Weezy never spouse ya, Weezy give sh*t bout’ cha Weezy don’t master suite, Weezy living room couch ya How bout you be a good girl, take these pies I just cooked up Take me to those tiger paws on your thighs", "vault_lines": ["Got women’s in they thirties calling Weezy papa"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne (aka Weezy) at 20 or 21 is getting middle aged women hollerin' at him.\n\nHowever, he isn’t invested in these women, he’ll get in to their tiger paws (the cooch) and smash on the couch, but that’s it.", "annotation_id": "24832473", "url": "https://genius.com/24832473", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rap City Freestyle [2001]", "line": "Sip the Crissy clear out my head", "vault_lines": ["Sip the Crissy clear out my head"], "meaning": "Cristal-Champagne, sometime referred to as Cris\nthe 90s and 2000s were characterized with being able to causally buy Cristal. (Jay-Z etc).", "annotation_id": "18761963", "url": "https://genius.com/18761963", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Rap City Freestyle [2001]", "line": "Type of life I live, Gotti would love it", "vault_lines": ["Homie we don’t get in the slam dunk contest no mo, you know how that go dog"], "meaning": "John Gotti-New York gangster synonymous with the Ozone Park neighborhood in Queens and operating as boss of the Gambino Crime Family.", "annotation_id": "18761954", "url": "https://genius.com/18761954", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
