{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUNAWAY", "line": "Stan", "vault_lines": ["Turn a hater to a stan"], "meaning": "“Stan” is a reference to my old scoutmaster, Stan Cuppomilk. He was so fucking annoying, here’s the thing. He took my 3ds, my FUCKING 3ds, and he snapped it in half. like over his knee, no lie. He then spat into my face and told me to die in 1 or 2 holes. 3 stars.", "annotation_id": "34623821", "url": "https://genius.com/34623821", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUNAWAY", "line": "Baby, you not in this race Me and myself, I do not imitate", "vault_lines": ["Baby, you not in this race"], "meaning": "Rohan is saying that he is not African American, and therefore does not do Blackface, unlike other prominent Canadian leaders.", "annotation_id": "34623816", "url": "https://genius.com/34623816", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUNAWAY", "line": "Huh", "vault_lines": ["I got a lot to say, huh"], "meaning": "This is not, in fact, a lot to say", "annotation_id": "34623795", "url": "https://genius.com/34623795", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUNAWAY", "line": "Kid, why you droppin’ all the music, man?", "vault_lines": ["Kid, why you droppin' all the music, man?"], "meaning": "A sly reference to “The Music Man,” a musical that premiered on December 19, 1957 on Broadway that had a limited return to the stage in early 2022.", "annotation_id": "34623767", "url": "https://genius.com/34623767", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUNAWAY", "status": "done", "targets": 6, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Kid-rohan-runaway-lyrics", "genius_title": "RUNAWAY", "genius_id": 10668082, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, run it, aye", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, run it, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813148", "url": "https://genius.com/12813148", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, run it", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, run it"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813145", "url": "https://genius.com/12813145", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813143", "url": "https://genius.com/12813143", "state": "verified", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813140", "url": "https://genius.com/12813140", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813138", "url": "https://genius.com/12813138", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813134", "url": "https://genius.com/12813134", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Run it up, aye, run it, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, aye, run it, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813132", "url": "https://genius.com/12813132", "state": "verified", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "I want a thot, I want a model with a bubble butt A double cup of some codeine and my slushy slush", "vault_lines": ["I want a thot, I want a model with a bubble butt"], "meaning": "He said that and it was just like that bar was just like, “He didn’t have to say that.” But he just wanted to say it. So, that was my favorite one. Probably my favorite bar.", "annotation_id": "12813124", "url": "https://genius.com/12813124", "state": "verified", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "We gon’ run it up, Cartier bracelet I could make a princess chick out of basic", "vault_lines": ["Run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "I look better now with money. Because I can take care of myself better. So, if I have a woman that’s like just a simple woman, I can—I don’t want to say dress her up, because I don’t do women like that—but if I can elevate her lifestyle and her wardrobe and how well she can take care of her self, too, I can take any woman and make a princess out of her. She’ll be my princess instead of just some random chick. I have that ability, is basically what I was saying.", "annotation_id": "12813113", "url": "https://genius.com/12813113", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Closed another deal, hunnid mill’, uh, page flip", "vault_lines": ["Closed another deal, hunnid mill', uh, page flip"], "meaning": "I got a shoe deal. A deal with my team. So that was just kind of another flex. It was simple. All of them ain’t that deep. But if somebody is here, they might say, “What happened now?” But it’s really simple. That’s just another flex.", "annotation_id": "12813109", "url": "https://genius.com/12813109", "state": "verified", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "I see the hatred, how that paint drip", "vault_lines": ["I see the hatred, how that paint drip"], "meaning": "Talking about the whip. Everybody don’t like to see you able to have access to everything that you want. When I buy a new car, and I got it how I like it… It don’t matter what’s in style or nothing like that, people have an issue when you’re getting to what you want to get to. And I don’t deal with that directly, all the time, but these are real life situations. This happens. People don’t like to see other people have what they want, if they can’t have it their way. So, that was kind of the direction of that line.\n\nI got a Bentley truck. And everybody always asks me why I got it in the color that I got it. And they say what color I should’ve got it in, because it’s not a common color. It’s not gold, but it’s like between gold and brown. I don’t know what the color is, but it’s like right there in the middle.", "annotation_id": "12813100", "url": "https://genius.com/12813100", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Baby, if it’s real, then it’s no discussion I ain’t tryna hear what you tryna tell me (uh-uh) I ain’t tryna buy what you tryna sell me, uh", "vault_lines": ["Baby, if it's real, then it's no discussion"], "meaning": "That meant a few things. I think we’ve all been in that moment where we’re in a fun environment, it’s women around. On both sides, men and women talk a good game in that type of environment. Everybody saying what sounds good at the moment. And that’s more of “actions speak louder than words.” Don’t tell me that, “Oh I’m not like this. I’m not like that,” and I’m not gonna sit here and tell you that I’m not like this, but I’m like that. I ain’t gonna go into no further details, but that’s just what it is.", "annotation_id": "12813097", "url": "https://genius.com/12813097", "state": "verified", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Know what time it is, they don’t frisk my cousins", "vault_lines": ["Know what time it is, they don't frisk my cousins"], "meaning": "That was a baby flex. Because, we all know that when you somebody… I don’t go nowhere by myself, like that. I always got a few of my cousins with me. My brother. It’s to the point now where if we go somewhere, it’s like, “Dame, who with you?” And I’m like, “Right here.” And we move on through and we get to where we going. Ain’t no issues.", "annotation_id": "12813089", "url": "https://genius.com/12813089", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "All of this is hustle, none of this is love", "vault_lines": ["All of this is hustle, none of this is love"], "meaning": "“All of this is hustle, none of this is love” means I had to earn every piece of my success. Everything that I have, wasn’t nobody giving me no handouts or nobody wasn’t looking out trying to make nothing easier for me. Nobody can ever take nothing away and say, “Man, yo dad was in the NBA. Yo cousin took care of you. You never had to…” You know, you can’t take nothing away from the grind and the process that I had to go through to be where I am. So that’s kind of what it is.", "annotation_id": "12813085", "url": "https://genius.com/12813085", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "D.O.L.L.A. with the movement, the party go, “ugh”", "vault_lines": ["D.O.L.L.A. with the movement, the party go, \"ugh\""], "meaning": "When I was in college, a lot of my teammates and my roommates was calling me Dolla. They would always say that, just because I think it’s common for people named Dame to say Dame Dolla. So when I was trying to figure out what I was gonna call myself as a rapper, I didn’t want to just be Dame Dolla. Anybody can come up with that name. So I made an acronym of it. I sat there and I was like, “What would make sense? What could I make of it?” And I came up with Different on Levels the Lord Allowed. I felt like that fit perfect. Because I really feel way about myself.", "annotation_id": "12813083", "url": "https://genius.com/12813083", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "All this game I’m givin’ is prolly gon’ be a caption", "vault_lines": ["All this game I'm givin' is prolly gon' be a caption"], "meaning": "I have seen my lines as Instagram captions. I’m not gonna say I see it all the time, or I get on Instagram and everybody’s doing it, but I’ve seen it. A lot of times, when I see it, it’s like people who are trying to get my attention. Fans that want me to see that they know my stuff. Or they’ll tweet it. Somebody would have like a meme or something and then they’ll quote one of my lines to match up with the meme or something like that. I’ve seen it. But I’ve also seen it on real pictures where a lot of times, it’s a college basketball player or basketball player overseas or something and they’ll have lyrics from a song on my first album, “Wasatch Front,“ because that song was about coming up as a basketball player from a tough situation. So, I’ve seen it.", "annotation_id": "12813080", "url": "https://genius.com/12813080", "state": "verified", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "I’m the Daddy Mac, Mac Daddy with hoop and rappin’ Y’all be on your Kris Kross, uh, hustlin’ backwards", "vault_lines": ["I'm the Daddy Mac, Mac Daddy with hoop and rappin'"], "meaning": "Kriss Kross with the overalls backwards and one strap on and one strap off. The jersey backwards. The hat backwards. All that whole thing. The “Daddy Mac, Mac Daddy,” that was just a twist to go with the “Y'all be on your Kris Kross, uh, hustlin' backwards.” That’s how it be.", "annotation_id": "12813076", "url": "https://genius.com/12813076", "state": "verified", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "I’m from where Golden State at But Portland where I lay at", "vault_lines": ["I'm from where Golden State at"], "meaning": "That was a stronger bar that was kind of hidden, because it was simple. But, it was just one of those things where I got such a huge impact on the community in Portland and the way the fans and all the people of Portland have embraced me, it’s almost like that’s another home for me. But at the same time, when I’m acknowledging a place that I’ve lived or I’ve been, I feel like, well first things first, you gotta make sure that you acknowledge home. So that was kind of a twist to kind of give a nod to home but also give a nod to another place that I’ve been embraced heavily and accepted as well. If I was gonna say that, I had to show love in both ways.", "annotation_id": "12813072", "url": "https://genius.com/12813072", "state": "verified", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Ain’t no secret money on my mind", "vault_lines": ["Ain't no secret money on my mind"], "meaning": "When I said, “Ain’t no secret money on my mind,” it’s like I don’t represent… Even my name. My rap name is Dame Dolla, but it’s not about the dollar sign. I don’t live a flashy life. I don’t talk about the kind of money I make. But I’ve been on record plenty of times saying the best thing about the financial side is that I can do whatever I want, whenever I want. I can take care of my family. When people have issues that I love, I can help them out. So, obviously, everything I do, I want to be compensated for it. So when I say that, I mean money on my mind. It probably ain’t the thing that I’m spitting out to y'all, all the time, but y’all know that’s what’s on my mind.", "annotation_id": "12813069", "url": "https://genius.com/12813069", "state": "verified", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Tried to give me scraps, I made ’em pieces to the puzzle I grind", "vault_lines": ["Tried to give me scraps, I made 'em pieces to the puzzle"], "meaning": "When I came up with those bars, I said, “They tried to give me scraps,” and I didn’t know where to go from there. I thought about a puzzle before it gets put together. It’s pieces all over the place. Like, you gotta make it fit. This fit right here, this fit right there. It’s hard. That’s what I felt like my situation was in real life. Everything wasn’t together. I went to three different high schools and it was a lot that I had to figure out just to make stuff happen. To get a scholarship and stuff like that. I wasn’t presented with golden opportunity after golden opportunity. I kind of had to find my way. So that’s kind of what that line was and you know, the next best thing was “I grind.” You know, it’s a grind to have to pick up the pieces and put it together and and make something of it and that’s really my life. That was the thinking behind it.", "annotation_id": "12813063", "url": "https://genius.com/12813063", "state": "verified", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye", "vault_lines": ["Aye, run it up, run it, aye, run it up, aye"], "meaning": "Run it up means a lot of things. It can go over so many different ways, whether it’s going to a party and running up a bill or going shopping and buying clothes with my people and running up the bill for that. It’s a lot of things you can do. My lifestyle. It can be so many things. With this, it was kind of like it was not aiming at one specific thing. Even in my verses, I touched on a lot of different topics. A lot of different situations. So it wasn’t about one thing, it was more about… Just run it up. You can do this. You can do that. You can run it up in every way.", "annotation_id": "12813059", "url": "https://genius.com/12813059", "state": "verified", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RUN IT UP", "line": "All of this is hustle, none of this is love", "vault_lines": ["All of this is hustle, none of this is love"], "meaning": "“All of this is hustle” Means that all Lillard and Wayne’s accomplishments happened through hard work. “Now this is love” means love for the basketball and rap game.", "annotation_id": "12781155", "url": "https://genius.com/12781155", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
