{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "RNB", "vault_lines": ["Ayo, real nigga bitch, call me RNB"], "meaning": "The first 3 letters of “Real nigga bitch” is RNB, but Nicki is also teasing her fans with this.\n\nRNB is used and was created by fans in hope that the Holy Trinity would collab and make one of the greatest moments in music history.\n\nThe Holy Trinity (RNB) consists of:\nRihanna\nNicki\nBeyoncé\n\n\n            Rihanna Nicki Beyoncé", "annotation_id": "30561329", "url": "https://genius.com/30561329", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "Pop that pussy for a real nigga", "vault_lines": ["Pop that pussy for a real nigga"], "meaning": "Throwback line to Lil Wayne featuring Drake song “She Will”. \n\n EDIT!! \nJuicy J’s song “Bandz A Make Her Dance (Remix)” which features Lil Wayne who says…\n\n“Pop That pussy for a real nigga,\nPull out that black card, that’s my lil nigga” (see below)", "annotation_id": "30297495", "url": "https://genius.com/30297495", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "Freak, I throw it deep, then put that ass to sleep", "vault_lines": ["Freak, I throw it deep, then put that ass to sleep"], "meaning": "This references Ice Cube’s ‘It Was a Good Day’ where he raps ‘And my dick runs deep, so deep, so deep, Put her ass to sleep.'", "annotation_id": "30296379", "url": "https://genius.com/30296379", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "We don’t make love, we be fuckin’, that’s G shit If he gotta put a opp down, I don’t see shit I keep his secrets, I let him beast it", "vault_lines": ["We don't make love, we be fuckin', that's G shit"], "meaning": "“Putting somebody down” is slang for killing somebody, so, if Nicki’s husband has to kill some enemy she won’t tell the cops, she’ll be loyal to him.\n“To beast” means to crave somebody or something really badly so it’s a double entendre meaning that:\n-A.  As said before, she won’t do anything to stop his husband to kill some opp\n-B. Playing from the line before “We don’t make love, we be fuckin'”, and the following lines she lets him crave her body.", "annotation_id": "30288645", "url": "https://genius.com/30288645", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "She a real nigga bitch, I call her RNB, yeah (On me)", "vault_lines": ["She a real nigga bitch, I call her RNB, yeah (On me)"], "meaning": "Double entendre considering RNB (music genre) is sometimes considered feminine music alternative for men and the initial lets of the phrase “real nigga bitch” “RNB”", "annotation_id": "30287024", "url": "https://genius.com/30287024", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "I just need you ’bout it, ’bout it like you Master P (Master P)", "vault_lines": ["I just need you 'bout it, 'bout it like you Master P (Master P)"], "meaning": "This line is a reference to Master P’s song “I’m Bout It, Bout It.”", "annotation_id": "30287014", "url": "https://genius.com/30287014", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "I just wanna watch him do his push-ups with his sweats on Every time he hit it, he gon’ nail it like a press-on When I ride his dick, the only time he gettin’ flexed on Hit it from the back with my pumps and my dress on (Ooh)", "vault_lines": ["I just wanna watch him do his push-ups with his sweats on"], "meaning": "This is a triple entendre as nicki is referring to different pieces of gym equipment (push ups, press, flex and pump) and also press on nails, riding her man and sex from the back.", "annotation_id": "30286580", "url": "https://genius.com/30286580", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "Kissin’ on my thighs and my breast, he two-pieced it", "vault_lines": ["Kissin' on my thighs and my breast, he two-pieced it"], "meaning": "A tongue-in-cheek sexual innuendo, that serves as a punchline and a visual to stitch her partner kissing her in intimate places.", "annotation_id": "30286548", "url": "https://genius.com/30286548", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
