{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "RNB", "line": "Body a work of art like the Mona Li’ (Grrt)", "vault_lines": ["Body a work of art like the Mona Li' (Grrt)"], "meaning": "The Mona Lisa is a famous painting by Leonardo da Vinci, known for its beauty and artistic significance. By saying her body is a “work of art like the Mona Li,” Nicki Minaj is expressing confidence in her physical appearance and suggesting that her body is as captivating and valuable as a masterpiece like the Mona Lisa.", "annotation_id": "30286029", "url": "https://genius.com/30286029", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
