{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Put Some Keys On That", "line": "Boy, I got more green than the Bishop Don Juan,", "vault_lines": ["Boy, I got more green than the Bishop Don Juan,"], "meaning": "Green refers to cannabis and money.\n\nBishop Don Juan is a former pimp and known to primarily wear them flashy green suits which look like shiiii.", "annotation_id": "39447595", "url": "https://genius.com/39447595", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Put Some Keys On That", "line": "Bitch, I’m fly like a magic carpet", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm fly like a magic carpet"], "meaning": "A magic carpet, or flying carpet, is a legendary rug featured in fantasy fiction, particularly Oriental tales, capable of transporting people  through the air via flying\n\nFly is a adjective refers stylish, fashionable, attractive, or cool. The phrase flying refers to being high. Flysky is also a mixture of heroin and medetomidine.\n\nA cool idomatic double meaning is “On the fly” means doing something quickly, and a magic carpet travels rapidly in notable stories like Prince Ahmed and the Fairy Pari Banu.", "annotation_id": "39447522", "url": "https://genius.com/39447522", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Put Some Keys On That", "line": "My eyes so low, I look like I’m from Hong Kong", "vault_lines": ["My eyes so low, I look like I'm from Hong Kong"], "meaning": "It is the addition of epicanthal folds, not the reduction of eyes that creates a slim eye perception in Asians.\n\n“Low” or “droopy” eyes (ptosis) accompanied by small “pinpoint” pupils after drug intake often indicate the use of opioids, such as heroin, fentanyl, or oxycodone. This occurs because these drugs severely depress the central nervous system, leading to drowsy, heavy eyelids and constricted pupils that do not react to light", "annotation_id": "39447501", "url": "https://genius.com/39447501", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
