{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Put My Money", "line": "Oh, push perico if I need to for the Root of Evil", "vault_lines": ["Oh, push perico if I need to for the Root of Evil"], "meaning": "Perico = classic slang for raw cocaine.\nRoot of Evil = misogynists might say it’s women, but Money is the true root of all evil.\n\nSo HOV’s saying he’ll sling cocaine (perico) if he needs to make money (Root of Evil), but he’d rather rap.", "annotation_id": "2594316", "url": "https://genius.com/2594316", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Put My Money", "line": "I ball for real: y’all niggas is Sam Bowie", "vault_lines": ["I ball for real: y'all niggas is Sam Bowie"], "meaning": "Sam Bowie was a former basketball player who, due to injuries and other setbacks, could not live up to expectations. Jay-Z is saying that, unlike Bowie, he is successful.", "annotation_id": "918590", "url": "https://genius.com/918590", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
