{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pusha (Remix)", "line": "Cobain, Cobain She blows my brain", "vault_lines": ["She blows my brain"], "meaning": "An eerie metaphor. Lloyd is comparing the effect this woman’s love has on him to the feeling of a gunshot to the brain. Hence the “Cobain Cobain” line.\n\nHe could be various interpretations:\n1. Her love astounds him\n2. Her love stirs emotions of uncertainty\n\nThis is a reference to legendary grunge rockers Kurt Cobain’s suicide. It is said that he shot himself in the head (she blows my brain).", "annotation_id": "4289471", "url": "https://genius.com/4289471", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
