{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pure Colombia", "line": "You shell-shocked like Adidas", "vault_lines": [", you shell-shocked like Adidas"], "meaning": "Shell shocked is a type of material that goes into the Adidas shoes. When his gun shells hit your body you’ll most likely go into shock.", "annotation_id": "2171096", "url": "https://genius.com/2171096", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pure Colombia", "line": "I love Benjamin Franklin more than his own mother", "vault_lines": ["I love Benjamin Franklin more than his own mother"], "meaning": "Wayne loves his money (specifically $100 bills).\n\nBenjamin Franklin is on the $100 bill. Therefore, Wayne loves his money more than Benjamin Franklin’s own mother loved him.", "annotation_id": "2170642", "url": "https://genius.com/2170642", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pure Colombia", "line": "5 blunts of that strong, call that strength in numbers", "vault_lines": ["5 blunts of that strong, call that strength in numbers"], "meaning": "Weezy adds a playful look on the phrase “there is strength in numbers” by explaining he smokes 5 blunts of strong weed. Since the weed is strong and there are 5 blunts then there is literally strength in Weezy’s numbers.", "annotation_id": "2167084", "url": "https://genius.com/2167084", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pure Colombia", "line": "I can’t trust these niggas, throw some water on ’em", "vault_lines": ["I can't trust these niggas, throw some water on 'em"], "meaning": "One possible meaning could be that Weezy doesn’t trust anyone to the point he has to literally throw water on them just to make sure they are not wired and working with the feds. Water will usually damage microphones and/or recording devices(Which are commonly used by the Feds to record conversations) if a sufficient amount is absorbed by it.", "annotation_id": "2165215", "url": "https://genius.com/2165215", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pure Colombia", "line": "AK’s with Chiquitas", "vault_lines": ["Wayne raps over Young Scooter’s Colombia. Off his new mixtape, Dedication 5."], "meaning": "Ak-47 Assault Rifles with banana clip magazines.", "annotation_id": "2162928", "url": "https://genius.com/2162928", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
