{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pump That Bass", "line": "All in the strip club, never get a boner Only get hard for D’oh! I’m Homer", "vault_lines": ["All in the strip club, never get a boner"], "meaning": "A triple entendre\n\n\nEven though Wayne likes women, he’s able to control himself around them.\nA play on words, Homer Simpson likes to eat doughnuts and most likely gets “exited” when he sees them.\nD'oh also being Homer’s catchphrase.\n\n\n\n\n\nHere’s another example of a triple entendre.", "annotation_id": "8024184", "url": "https://genius.com/8024184", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pump That Bass", "line": "(Pump that bass)", "vault_lines": ["Offer me to manage, not takin off ya panties"], "meaning": "This sample is from Original Concept’s “Pump That Bass”\n\nhttp://youtu.be/x0AOGCcPsy4\n\nSample appears at 0:05", "annotation_id": "7907038", "url": "https://genius.com/7907038", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pump That Bass", "line": "And you’re a simp son, and I’m a pimp son", "vault_lines": ["And you're a simp son, and I'm a pimp son"], "meaning": "A play on the last line. Simpson is Homer’s last name.\n\nA simp is defined as “A guy who acts all tough like he doesn’t care about his girlfriend around his friends but acts all whipped in front of his girlfriend”\n\nThis means that Wayne is a real playa and you’re a fake.", "annotation_id": "7902999", "url": "https://genius.com/7902999", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pump That Bass", "line": "Ay, whatchu know about jeans from Japan Hand made with the brand on the seam of the pants", "vault_lines": ["Ay, whatchu know about jeans from Japan"], "meaning": "Weezy is wearing Evisu , high quality Japanese designer jeans", "annotation_id": "1787268", "url": "https://genius.com/1787268", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
