{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Promise", "line": "We can get together, I can help you with that homework Take your ass to school too, boo Teach you all the rules you never knew", "vault_lines": ["We can get together, I can help you with that homework"], "meaning": "On the original song, Ciara says:\n\nYou can be my teacher, I’ll do homework\nYou can give me extra credit baby, I’ll do more work", "annotation_id": "912171", "url": "https://genius.com/912171", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Promise", "line": "And I know that you be dancin’ ’til your toes hurt But I can make your toes curl", "vault_lines": ["And I know that you be dancin' 'til your toes hurt"], "meaning": "Ciara is known for her incredible dancing skills as much as her singing abilities.  She trains hard and has been a dancer for most of her life. Typically, dancers have foot and toe difficulties because of the strain they put their bodies through.\n\nHe’s also alluding to having sex with him will cause a woman to curl her toes in pleasure.", "annotation_id": "302671", "url": "https://genius.com/302671", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Promise", "line": "Shit, Hov got Bey and I just want Ci’ See, I just wan’ see if you’re taller than me", "vault_lines": ["Shit, Hov got Bey and I just want Ci'"], "meaning": "Jay-Z (Hov) has Beyonce (B) and Wayne wants Ciara (CiCi).\n\nHe tricked people using word play, he tied CC into making it seem like he was trying to get out the word “see” but really he was saying he want Ciara.", "annotation_id": "302631", "url": "https://genius.com/302631", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
