{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pretty Lil’ Heart", "line": "[Verse 2: Robin Thicke]", "vault_lines": ["This is for the lovers and the sexy mother, mothers"], "meaning": "In this verse Robin Thicke is playing the role of every girlfriend. They all get worried and insecure sometimes so she is asking her love interest to comfort her by saying nice things and reassuring her which he then proceeds to do in the hook.\n\nThis happens to most women, even the hot ones.\n\n\n\nRobin Thicke’s wife!", "annotation_id": "1440833", "url": "https://genius.com/1440833", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
