{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pretty Lil’ Heart", "line": "Cate, late night, lights dim, candles lit", "vault_lines": ["Cate, late night, lights dim, candles lit"], "meaning": "The previous line begins with “Love is in the air.”\nA romantic session deals with delicacies/food-for-foreplay also known as “Cate.” A late night, dimmed down lights and the candles lit to create a romantic atmosphere. These are the essentials for love making if you want to do it the right way.", "annotation_id": "632708", "url": "https://genius.com/632708", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
