{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "President Carter", "line": "Uh, detrimental on any instrumental", "vault_lines": ["Uh, detrimental on any instrumental"], "meaning": "Yes, he most certainly is. For proof, listen to his mixtapes where he raps on beats rapped on by other rappers.", "annotation_id": "20698082", "url": "https://genius.com/20698082", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
