{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Popular", "line": "Bust that open, suck that pussy like the Dracula", "vault_lines": ["Bust that open, suck that pussy like the Dracula"], "meaning": "Dracula is a famous monster in pop culture, one of the most iconic fictional vampires. He was created by Bram Stoker for his 1897 book appropriately titled “Dracula.” Dracula is known to suck the blood out of his victim’s neck, so this is where the sucking part comes in.\n\n\n\nGary Oldman and Winona Ryder in the 1992 movie adaptation of “Dracula.”", "annotation_id": "17485704", "url": "https://genius.com/17485704", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Popular", "line": "She got that good, good, she Michael Jackson bad I’m attracted to her for her attractive ass", "vault_lines": ["She got that good, good"], "meaning": "Just Wayne repeating the lines to the chorus. Which was originally featured on Young Money’s BedRock, click here for an explanation!", "annotation_id": "2603454", "url": "https://genius.com/2603454", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Popular", "line": "And it’s always wet, don’t know if she the best I ever had But she’s the best I had yet", "vault_lines": ["And it's always wet, don't know if she the best I ever had"], "meaning": "She’s amazing, the best he knows of but he wouldn’t go as far as Drake and Nicki’s Best I Ever Had, besides who know’s how the next one could be?", "annotation_id": "43062", "url": "https://genius.com/43062", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
