{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Popular", "line": "Yeah! She got that good, good She Michael Jackson bad I’m attracted to her wit’ her attractive ass She got that good, good She Michael Jackson bad I’m-I’m attracted to her", "vault_lines": ["She got that good, good"], "meaning": "Weezy is quoting himself from the radio sensation “Bedrock.”\n\n\n\nCheck the original explanation here", "annotation_id": "43046", "url": "https://genius.com/43046", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
