{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poppin Them Bottles", "line": "I be in A-Town, livin’ la vida, la loca (Yeah) Throwin’ that money on cho’cha (Yeah), spendin’ a stack up in Strokers (Chyeah)", "vault_lines": ["I be in A-Town, livin' la vida, la loca (Yeah)"], "meaning": "A reference to Strokers strip club in Atlanta, Georgia. Chocha is American English slang for pussy.", "annotation_id": "32027852", "url": "https://genius.com/32027852", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poppin Them Bottles", "line": "Shine so hard, like the fucking sun facing me—basically", "vault_lines": ["Shine so hard, like the fucking sun facing me—basically"], "meaning": "Weezy is shining, as in he is a star and he is successful, as if the sun was facing him.", "annotation_id": "20439195", "url": "https://genius.com/20439195", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poppin Them Bottles", "line": "Yes, I’m a ani-mal (Ani-mal); to be frank, I’m a dog", "vault_lines": ["Yes, I'm a ani-mal (Ani-mal); to be frank, I'm a dog"], "meaning": "A frank is a name for a hot dog, and Lil Wayne cleverly says he is a dog in the same sentence as using the phrase “to be frank”", "annotation_id": "15655270", "url": "https://genius.com/15655270", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
