{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pop Off", "line": "Leave eighteen holes on his corner, now I’m golfing Rickie Fowler, Arnold Palmer, get my shot off", "vault_lines": ["Leave eighteen holes on his corner, now I'm golfing"], "meaning": "As Wayne refers to firing eighteen shots from a gun, a typical golf course also features eighteen holes. Rickie Fowler is a professional American golfer, while Arnold Palmer, who passed away in 2016, has been regarded as one of the best players of the game.", "annotation_id": "21658624", "url": "https://genius.com/21658624", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pop Off", "line": "Go sicko mode, hungry hippo mode", "vault_lines": ["Go sicko mode, hungry hippo mode"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne references Travis Scott’s 2018 hit “SICKO MODE,” which features his own Young Money signee, Drake. This term is used to describe one’s diligent work ethic.\n\nHungry Hippos is a classic toy game where players compete to acquire the most marbles. Wayne compares the competitive, hustle-based mentality of playing Hungry Hippos to being in “sicko mode.”", "annotation_id": "21658592", "url": "https://genius.com/21658592", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pop Off", "line": "These diamonds invaded my grill, got me from ear to ear, smiling like I’m Draymond for real", "vault_lines": ["These diamonds invaded my grill, got me from ear to ear, smiling like I'm Draymond for real"], "meaning": "Draymond Green is a professional basketball player for the Golden State Warriors. Draymond can thank SmileDirectClub for his pearly whites—in 2015, he invested $150 million in the orthodontics company and made an approximated $600 million from this action.", "annotation_id": "21658578", "url": "https://genius.com/21658578", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
