{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Pop Bottles", "line": "Sittin’ in a cell,", "vault_lines": ["Went from sittin' in a cell,"], "meaning": "As far as we can tell, Birdman has spent all of 1 night in jail, for (what else) marijuana possession\n\nIncidentally, the “Birdman of Alcatraz” is one of the most famous prisoners of all time (which makes it very difficult to Google this Birdman’s jail history)", "annotation_id": "6835", "url": "https://genius.com/6835", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
