{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Politics (Lethal Injection)", "line": "Prostitution, drug distribution, war contribution, all for the love of the constitution Yeah", "vault_lines": ["Prostitution, drug distribution, war contribution, all for the love of the constitution"], "meaning": "Wayne is just making apparent that the U.S. Government participates in:\n\n\nProstituting and trafficking people.\nDistributing and controlling the drug trade.\nBeing involved in a vast amount of military conflicts and wars.", "annotation_id": "2070235", "url": "https://genius.com/2070235", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Politics (Lethal Injection)", "line": "Question, what the fuck is you go do, when that new world come for you When that new world come for you,", "vault_lines": ["Question, what the fuck is you go do, when that new world come for you"], "meaning": "When the New World Order comes to take you to a FEMA camp, take your life, or arrives in general, what shall you do? Defend yourself and take a stand, or lie down to the authorities and take any injustices cast upon you and your loved ones?", "annotation_id": "2070197", "url": "https://genius.com/2070197", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
