{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poke Her Face", "line": "She love the way I spit, so I made the pussy gleek", "vault_lines": ["She love the way I spit, so I made the pussy gleek"], "meaning": "She love the way I rap so…Gleeking occurs when an accumulation of saliva in the sublingual gland is propelled out in a stream when the gland is compressed by the tongue. The stream of saliva is released in the general direction of the front of the mouth. If the mouth is open the jet may project several feet. Gleeking may occur spontaneously due to accidental tongue pressure on the sublingual gland while talking, eating, yawning, or cleaning the teeth. Gleeking can also be induced, for instance, by pressing the underside of the tongue upwards against the palate, then pushing the tongue forward while simultaneously moving the jaw slightly forward; or by yawning deeply and pressing the tongue against the palate. Practice is usually required to induce gleeking consistently, and induction is more likely to be successful under conditions of salivary stimulation.", "annotation_id": "20175166", "url": "https://genius.com/20175166", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poke Her Face", "line": "(I poke her so much, I deserve a bracelet)", "vault_lines": ["P-P-Poker face (I poke her so much, I deserve a bracelet)"], "meaning": "The World Series of Poker (WSOP) bracelet is considered the most coveted non-monetary prize a poker player can win. Since 1976, a bracelet has been awarded to the winner of every event at the annual WSOP. Even if the victory occurred before 1976, WSOP championships are now counted as “bracelets”.", "annotation_id": "20175099", "url": "https://genius.com/20175099", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poke Her Face", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Lil-wayne-poke-her-face-lyrics", "genius_title": "Poke Her Face", "genius_id": 1598, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Styrofoam cup, stackin’ ’em, inside, I put the poison in", "vault_lines": ["Styrofoam cup, stackin' 'em, inside, I put the poison in"], "meaning": "Here Lil Wayne is referring to drinking lean (the poison), which is typically drank in a styrofoam cup.", "annotation_id": "28967972", "url": "https://genius.com/28967972", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "I wanna pull up and flaunt you and take some pics for Getty Images", "vault_lines": ["I wanna pull up and flaunt you and take some pics for Getty Images"], "meaning": "Getty Images is a visual media company and supplier of stock images. They also contain photos of celebrities and public figures taken by the press and/or paparazzi.\n\nJack wants to flaunt this girl off in public and have photos taken of them for Getty Images.\n\n\nThe image above is of Jack Harlow at the Met Gala in 2023.\nPhoto from Getty Images.", "annotation_id": "28966609", "url": "https://genius.com/28966609", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "You went and got that wax for nothin’", "vault_lines": ["You went and got that wax for nothin'"], "meaning": "She got her body hair waxed off just for herself, not for another person.", "annotation_id": "28966599", "url": "https://genius.com/28966599", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "You had a man that had a plan, but he ain’t have it in him", "vault_lines": ["You had a man that had a plan, but he ain't have it in him"], "meaning": "Jack is alluding to this girl’s ex-boyfriend, stating that her ex had a plan for their relationship, but didn’t have the courage to follow through with it.", "annotation_id": "28961151", "url": "https://genius.com/28961151", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
