{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Lil Tune’,", "vault_lines": ["They call you quiet, but they don't know where you come from"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne has many other nicknames, one being Tunechi.", "annotation_id": "25898550", "url": "https://genius.com/25898550", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Cyanide, arsenic", "vault_lines": ["That girl is poison, poisonous, cyanide, arsenic"], "meaning": "Cyanide (CN-) and arsenic (As) are two toxic chemicals, cyanide is a compound while arsenic is an element. Cyanide prevents the cells of the body from using oxygen. When this happens, the cells die. Arsenic can cause lung and skin cancers and may cause other cancers. Due to this, Lil Wayne compares the girl to these two toxic substances or “poisons”.", "annotation_id": "25821005", "url": "https://genius.com/25821005", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Girl, you could pick your poison like fruit up in the garden", "vault_lines": ["Girl, you could pick your poison like fruit up in the garden"], "meaning": "A biblical reference, Wayne is talking about picking your poison like Eve did when she picked forbidden fruit from the Garden of Eden", "annotation_id": "25760175", "url": "https://genius.com/25760175", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "I need MTV Cribs back", "vault_lines": ["I need MTV Cribs back"], "meaning": "MTV Cribs is a television show which started in 2000. On the show, viewers get a tour of a celebrity’s lavish homes given by the celebrity themselves. Many hip hop artists have appeared on the show, some of them being Snoop Dogg, 50 Cent and even Lil Wayne himself.\n\nThe show went off air after running for 9 years, making brief comebacks on television in 2010 and 2011, and on Snapchat Discover in 2016.\n\nMTV announced that it was making a comeback on July 2021, maybe we can expect to get a sneak peek into Jack’s home in the coming seasons.", "annotation_id": "25757722", "url": "https://genius.com/25757722", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "I’m Ewing in the Garden", "vault_lines": ["I'm Ewing in the Garden"], "meaning": "Patrick Ewing is a Basketball Hall of Famer that played Center for the New York Knicks from 1985 to 2000. His number 33 jersey is retired by the Knicks and hanging at the (Madison Square) Garden.", "annotation_id": "25757691", "url": "https://genius.com/25757691", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Yeah, I eat so much shrimp, I got iodine poisoning", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I eat so much shrimp, I got iodine poisoning"], "meaning": "This is a direct interpolation of Pimp C’s lyrics on Three 6 Mafia’s classic 2000 track “Sippin' on Some Syrup”:\n\nWe eat so many shrimp, I got iodine poisoning\nF–k n–s make me sick with all that pinching and bargaining\n\nCuriously enough, during a 2011 interview with Nardwuar, Lil Wayne revealed that his first stage name was actually “Shrimp Daddy,” which he created both to homage his idol, Pimp Daddy, and humourously refer to his own short height.", "annotation_id": "25757338", "url": "https://genius.com/25757338", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "Got some Scarlett Johansson, whip it to a black widow", "vault_lines": ["Got some Scarlett Johansson, whip it to a black widow"], "meaning": "Scarlett Johansson is the actress that plays Black Widow in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.\n\nA black widow is also known to be a highly poisonous spider.", "annotation_id": "25756538", "url": "https://genius.com/25756538", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Poison", "line": "I might have to jack your bitch ’cause I be on my Harlow shit", "vault_lines": ["I might have to jack your bitch 'cause I be on my Harlow shit"], "meaning": "Hollow bullets are a type of bullet that explode on impact, therefore making them more deadly than traditional bullets. Wayne uses Jack’s surname, Harlow, as an entendre for this type of bullet as hollow and Harlow sound very similar.\n\nThis plays into the first part of this line where Wayne uses Jack’s name as a substitute for the word steal, e.g. carjack means to steal a car.\n\nThis line could also be taken in the literal sense as Jack Harlow is a ladies' man and can seemly get any woman he desires. Wayne is effectively saying that he can get any woman he pleases, just as Jack can, as he is armed with hollow bullets so there’s no stopping him.", "annotation_id": "25756427", "url": "https://genius.com/25756427", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
