{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "Take a nigga’s shit, sell a nigga’s shit Make some extra money for the holidays Merry Christmas nigga", "vault_lines": ["Take a nigga's shit, sell a nigga's shit"], "meaning": "Double Meaning. Wayne talks making fast money right before Christmas time.  At the same time, breaking into somebody’s house in the middle of the night like Santa Clause in order to do so.", "annotation_id": "11351237", "url": "https://genius.com/11351237", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "No, I double dare you to leave your chair I’m gon’ leave you there, I don’t even care", "vault_lines": ["Family affair, don't you even dare"], "meaning": "A reference to the classic film Pulp Fiction. The infamous scene where Samuel L Jackson says that he “double dares” him.  He ends up killing him where he sat, hence the words “leave your chair I’m gon' leave you there.”.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9wEnb9yIoes", "annotation_id": "11351221", "url": "https://genius.com/11351221", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "No Ceilings Dos, this is that", "vault_lines": ["No Ceilings Dos, this is that"], "meaning": "“Dos” is Spanish for “two”. This mixtape is titled No Ceilings 2.\n\nSo yeah, this is that.", "annotation_id": "10011316", "url": "https://genius.com/10011316", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "I’m comin’ with the street sweeper Like a motherfuckin’ witch nigga", "vault_lines": ["I'm comin' with the street sweeper"], "meaning": "A “street sweeper” is a particular shotgun that can easily clear out anything in sight, due to it’s spread of fire. He then uses it in a simile to compare the street sweeper to a witch’s broom.", "annotation_id": "10011265", "url": "https://genius.com/10011265", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "Alright, we don’t fuck with switch hittas", "vault_lines": ["Alright, we don't fuck with switch hittas"], "meaning": "In baseball, switch hitters bat from both sides. This metaphor could mean a couple things.\n1. People that play both sides a.k.a. having no loyalty to your crew. (set trippin)\n2. Play both sides as in a male that is bisexual.", "annotation_id": "9227954", "url": "https://genius.com/9227954", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "Combat like Johnny Cage", "vault_lines": ["Combat like Johnny Cage"], "meaning": "Johnny Cage is a character from the Mortal Kombat video game franchise, a fighting game.", "annotation_id": "8607379", "url": "https://genius.com/8607379", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "Gun on my shoulder like Tinker Bell", "vault_lines": ["Gun on my shoulder like Tinker Bell"], "meaning": "Tinker Bell is a fictional Disney fairy from the kids story Peter Pan.\n\nShe hangs around Peter, though not on his shoulder as she can fly, doling out advice and helping him fix things. She is prone to violent outbursts of jealousy, a trait not usually favoured by Wayne.\n\nHis gun is clearly large, as he rests it on his shoulder.", "annotation_id": "8466903", "url": "https://genius.com/8466903", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Plastic Bag", "line": "Niggas get caught and tell everything With the Weeknd vocals, I’ll never sing", "vault_lines": ["Niggas get caught and tell everything"], "meaning": "Jae is talking about people who get caught by police and snitch in order to get out of jail time. He compares them to Rnb/Pop singer The Weeknd, who is known for his unique voice (well, and his hair). Unlike these people, Jae will never “sing”; which is slang for snitching; because he claims to be a real G.\n\nNotice the wordplay, as Jae says he will never “sing”, after comparing everyone else to The Weeknd.", "annotation_id": "8284614", "url": "https://genius.com/8284614", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
