{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "Like Noriega got a lot of guns, like Las Vegas I’m pimping", "vault_lines": ["Like Noriega got a lot of guns, like Las Vegas I'm pimping"], "meaning": "Noriega is a big time drug dealer with a lot of guns. He’s staying pimping like Las Vegas because Las Vegas has a lot of hoes and pimps watching over them\n\nNoriega:", "annotation_id": "1086729", "url": "https://genius.com/1086729", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
