{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "My dick feel like a prisoner cause this bitch got lockjaw", "vault_lines": ["My dick feel like a prisoner cause this bitch got lockjaw"], "meaning": "Lockjaw is when your mouth is stiff. So his dick feels tightly secured like a prisoner in her mouth while it’s locked down on his dick. This is also a play on words, because his dick feels like a “prisoner” being locked in her “lock\"jaw", "annotation_id": "1078725", "url": "https://genius.com/1078725", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "I get up in that ass and hit it as fast as Chinese ping-pong", "vault_lines": ["I get up in that ass and hit it as fast as Chinese ping-pong"], "meaning": "Have you ever seen 2 professional Chinese men playing ping-pong and how fast they hit the ping-pong ball? If so then you’ll know what Weezy means by hitting it fast.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0gkxTQGR6zI", "annotation_id": "1078716", "url": "https://genius.com/1078716", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
