{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "A Big Tymer nigga", "vault_lines": ["Hustler, shining, a Big Tymer nigga"], "meaning": "Birdman and Mannie Fresh were once known as the ‘Big Tymers’", "annotation_id": "1077985", "url": "https://genius.com/1077985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "But I tell ’em put it away or you could get punched like a Hawaiian", "vault_lines": ["But I tell 'em put it away or you could get punched like a Hawaiian"], "meaning": "Referencing Hawaiian Punch here, a popular kid’s drink.\n\nWayne was charged with gun possession and isn’t trying to get him, or his homie, into any trouble regarding weapons (iron). He tells his boys to put away their guns and use their fists, and punch, like the Hawaiian drink.", "annotation_id": "1077944", "url": "https://genius.com/1077944", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Picture Perfect", "line": "Pockets fat as Saint Nick", "vault_lines": ["Pockets fat as Saint Nick"], "meaning": "Saint Nick, aka SANTA!\n\nNotoriously a rather large man, blame it on the cookies and milk left by children to thank him for leaving them presents.\n\nHe’s saying that all the cash in his pockets are making them pretty fat!", "annotation_id": "1077932", "url": "https://genius.com/1077932", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
