{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Permission", "line": "Love that booty tender, never get aggressive That booty got insurance, that booty got progressive", "vault_lines": ["Love that booty tender, never get aggressive"], "meaning": "Insurance companies offer plans which compensate customers who receive damage to assets such as cars or homes with large sums of money to repair and recover said assets.\n\nMetaphorically saying a girl has Progressive Insurance, Wayne is offering his love and moral support as a compensation, acknowledging he isn’t of a damaging nature but instead plans to protect said woman.", "annotation_id": "15772901", "url": "https://genius.com/15772901", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Permission", "line": "Pull up, stay ready, appreciate your lady Like a tramp with spaghetti, yeah, yeah, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Pull up, stay ready, appreciate your lady"], "meaning": "Future is telling the listener to arrive timely and appreciate your woman. He compares this to Disney film Lady And The Tramp suggesting you comfort and cherish your loved one like Tramp from the film had treated Lady.", "annotation_id": "15772845", "url": "https://genius.com/15772845", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
