{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "I’m the wrong elephant to fuck with", "vault_lines": ["I'm the wrong elephant to fuck with"], "meaning": "Okay so,\n\nIf the rest of the verse says that niggas is peanuts\nAnd Wayne is an elephant\nAnd the niggas are fucking with Wayne\nDont that mean peanuts are fucking elephants?\n\nAssuming peanuts and elephants have a relationship, is it possible that this is incest?\n\nWayne’s lyrical sandwhiches are unmatched here.", "annotation_id": "36156271", "url": "https://genius.com/36156271", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "The gun go—", "vault_lines": ["Tunechi on the track and I'ma have to go Dumbo, they gon' go, \"Uh-oh\""], "meaning": "After this line, a loud elephant noise plays in the background.\n\nEffectively, his gun is extremely loud and overwhelming, perhaps maintaining a power or volume similar to that of an elephant.", "annotation_id": "36059864", "url": "https://genius.com/36059864", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Sharp like my etiquette, a sword, or machete shit", "vault_lines": ["Sharp like my etiquette, a sword, or machete shit"], "meaning": "Being “sharp” implies a great deal of intelligence, and Weezy’s etiquette has notably lived up to those standards over his longstanding career.\n\nWhile a sword would be an obvious comparison, given its intended use in combat, directly juxtaposing this is its comparison to a machete, an unwieldy chopping tool used to cut branches and harvest crops.\n\nHe can be precise and calculated when he needs to be, but his sharpness is just as likely to ruthlessly cut through everything in its path.", "annotation_id": "36059780", "url": "https://genius.com/36059780", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "But I still act a donkey like ha, what’s up?", "vault_lines": ["But I still act a donkey like ha, what's up?"], "meaning": "This is supposed to contrast the previous line, because while Republicans are represented by an elephant as their mascot, Democrats are represented by a donkey as their mascot", "annotation_id": "35958774", "url": "https://genius.com/35958774", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
