{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "But I still act a donkey", "vault_lines": ["But I still act a donkey"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne may be an elephant (the animal used to represent The Republican Party, of which Donald Trump is a member), but he still act a donkey (the animal used to represent the Democratic Party). A little politics-related wordplay from Wayne who implies he embodies both ends of the political spectrum.", "annotation_id": "35874381", "url": "https://genius.com/35874381", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
