{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "All-red elephant, bitch, Donald Trump", "vault_lines": ["All-red elephant, bitch, Donald Trump"], "meaning": "Donald Trump is the president of the USA and the leader of the republican party – whose representative color is the color red.\n\nA red elephant could also insinuate the Bloods gang (their color is also red) which Lil Wayne is a member of.\n\nAnd the republican party’s mascot is an elephant.", "annotation_id": "35865944", "url": "https://genius.com/35865944", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
