{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Bands on bands in my pants, that’s a drumroll", "vault_lines": ["Bands on bands in my pants, that's a drumroll"], "meaning": "A drumroll is a quick succession of beats hit on a drum. Bands on bands refers to bands that may play drumrolls, such as marching bands or big bands.\n\nBands also stands for 1,000$ in cash, hence, he has a lot of money in his pants.", "annotation_id": "35865915", "url": "https://genius.com/35865915", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
