{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Numbers don’t lie ’less it’s ’bout her measurements", "vault_lines": ["Numbers don't lie 'less it's 'bout her measurements"], "meaning": "“Numbers don’t lie” is a common saying that means objective criteria better reflect the reality of a situation than do subjective beliefs.\n\nHowever, Wayne says this principle does not hold true when a woman describes “her measurements” because the numbers themselves are lies.", "annotation_id": "35828111", "url": "https://genius.com/35828111", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "You know I’m the type to pop the trunk quick, yeah", "vault_lines": ["You know I'm the type to pop the trunk quick, yeah"], "meaning": "Like an elephant, Wayne uses his “trunk” as an attack and self-defense tool.\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/c9c0ab93b02166324f5e7512110fb24170f7158fa357dc8b83258216767300e1%2Fg648mx79aur\n\nUnlike an elephant, Wayne’s “trunk” refers to an automobile’s rear compartment which, after being “popped\" open, provides him access to firearms.", "annotation_id": "35828040", "url": "https://genius.com/35828040", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Niggas with the mad face, smash face, snub nose", "vault_lines": ["Niggas with the mad face, smash face, snub nose"], "meaning": "This double entendre illustrates what Wayne does to people who look at him “with the mad face.” He will smash their face then whip out a snub-nose firearm.\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/2fd97ecb27e4691e1e3f20b43243c981fdd2461809e1fcee854e4a45cd9e9ed3%2Ffumdq00fs3m\n\nAdditionally, he will smash their face with such force that, afterward, their nose changes shape into a “snub nose,” a short nose with the tip pointing upward.\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/c9c0ab93b02166324f5e7512110fb24170f7158fa357dc8b83258216767300e1%2Fjbl38q06j8", "annotation_id": "35827966", "url": "https://genius.com/35827966", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "My bitch got an elephant booty, not a rump roast", "vault_lines": ["My bitch got an elephant booty, not a rump roast"], "meaning": "A rump roast is a tough, inexpensive cut of beef from the hindquarters of a cow, an animal that is significantly smaller than an elephant.\n\nhttps://filepicker-images.genius.com/c9c0ab93b02166324f5e7512110fb24170f7158fa357dc8b83258216767300e1%2Fvyt3dlpd0zb", "annotation_id": "35827942", "url": "https://genius.com/35827942", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Tunechi on the track and I’ma have to go Dumbo, they gon’ go, “Uh-oh”", "vault_lines": ["Tunechi on the track and I'ma have to go Dumbo, they gon' go, \"Uh-oh\""], "meaning": "Wayne references the famous cartoon elephant Dumbo as a way of saying that he is going to “go [dumb],” or rap mindlessly, on the track.", "annotation_id": "35827898", "url": "https://genius.com/35827898", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
