{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "I ain’t Snuffleupagus, but you could get snuffed, though", "vault_lines": ["I ain't Snuffleupagus, but you could get snuffed, though"], "meaning": "Wayne name-drops Snuffleupagus to draw a line between himself and the big, gentle Sesame Street elephant. He’s saying he’s not soft or harmless — if anything, he’s the opposite. The word “snuffed” hanging right after the line adds a quiet threat, turning a childhood reference into something a lot more cold-blooded.", "annotation_id": "35815873", "url": "https://genius.com/35815873", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Monkey on her back like Michael Jackson and Bubbles", "vault_lines": ["Monkey on her back like Michael Jackson and Bubbles"], "meaning": "Wayne references Michael Jackson’s famous chimpanzee Bubbles. Bubbles was born in April 1983 at a Texas biomedical research facility and purchased by Jackson around 1985–86. Bubbles quickly became a fixture in Jackson’s day-to-day life, living at his Encino home and later at Neverland Ranch. He even slept in a crib, ate candy in the private theater, wore a diaper, and used Jackson’s toilet.", "annotation_id": "35811008", "url": "https://genius.com/35811008", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Pop the trunk, pop the trunk All-red elephant, bitch, Donald Trump", "vault_lines": ["Pop the trunk, pop the trunk"], "meaning": "the terms “red state” and “blue state” have referred to US states whose voters vote predominantly for one party—the Republican Party in red states and the Democratic Party in blue states—in presidential and other statewide elections.\n\nThe elephant is a widely recognized symbol of the Republican Party\n\nDonald John Trump is an American politician, media personality, and businessman who is the 47th president of the United States. A member of the Republican Party, he served as the 45th president from 2017 to 2021.\n\nLil Wayne has met him", "annotation_id": "35810108", "url": "https://genius.com/35810108", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanuts 2 N Elephant", "line": "Syrup in the double cup, fruit punch like Knuckles", "vault_lines": ["Syrup in the double cup, fruit punch like Knuckles"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne utilizes the iconic character from Sonic, Knuckles, to describe his lean. Like Knuckles, his lean is both the color red and has a kick, or a “punch” to it.", "annotation_id": "35809860", "url": "https://genius.com/35809860", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
