{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Peanut Butter", "line": "Empty the magazine, all the pages fall", "vault_lines": ["Empty the magazine, all the pages fall"], "meaning": "Emptying one’s “magazine” on a gun means firing off all of the bullets. Wayne takes the other meaning of magazine, one that is read, by saying that “all the pages” will be emptied out of it. They then fall to the ground out of the magazine just as shells would from a gun after being shot.", "annotation_id": "21663285", "url": "https://genius.com/21663285", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
