{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Party Like A Rockstar (Remix)", "line": "I have foursomes and I don’t have to force ’em", "vault_lines": ["I have foursomes and I don't have to force 'em"], "meaning": "A threesome (also called a menage a trois) is a sexual meeting between three people (usually a man and two women)\n\nWayne here is saying that he has foursomes, in which he fucks three girls at once (or by definition, it could also be two girls and a guy, a girl and two guys, or three guys.", "annotation_id": "48457", "url": "https://genius.com/48457", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
