{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Party Girl (Remix)", "line": "And definitely ain’t a lesbian but kisses other girls", "vault_lines": ["And definitely ain't a lesbian but kisses other girls"], "meaning": "Asher’s girl isn’t usually down for the ladies too, but once she gets some alcohol in her system that changes. Similar to the Kanye West line on the I Don’t Like Remix,\n\nGirls kissing girls, cause it’s hot, right?\nBut unless they use a strap-on then they not dykes\nThey ain’t about that life, they ain’t about that life", "annotation_id": "1981655", "url": "https://genius.com/1981655", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
