{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Paid2Party", "line": "Baby, I get money out the ass Tunechi said it first, I said it last", "vault_lines": ["Baby, I get money out the ass"], "meaning": "“I get money out the ass” is a refrence to the Lil Wayne song “You Ain’t Got Nuthin”.\n\n“Tunechi” comes from the nickname that was given to Lil wayne by his grandmother, which was Lil Tune.", "annotation_id": "27467324", "url": "https://genius.com/27467324", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Paid2Party", "line": "Molly on me, poppin’ Xanny for free", "vault_lines": ["Molly on me, poppin' Xanny for free"], "meaning": "Molly is another term for MDMA or ecstasy, which is a popular club drug that is known for flooding the brain with serotonin and enhancing empathy and the expression of feelings and emotions.\n\n“Xanny” refers to Xanax, an anxiolytic drug that is commonly abused for its relaxing effects as a strong sedative.", "annotation_id": "22635635", "url": "https://genius.com/22635635", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
