{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Outstanding (The Flyest)", "line": "I already know how to piss in the toilet I’m tryin to get the pot to piss in in the mornin’", "vault_lines": ["I already know how to piss in the toilet"], "meaning": "Lil Wayne has obviously been potty-trained. They line “I’m trying to get a pot to piss in in the morning” refers to his lack of money and commodities. Back in the day, families used to use urine to tan animal skins, so families used to all pee in a pot & then once a day it was taken & sold to the tannery.If you had to do this to survive you were “piss poor”.\n\nBut worse than that were the really poor folk who couldn’t even afford to buy a pot. They “didn’t have a pot to piss in” and were the lowest of the low. Lil Wayne is seeking to move on through the struggle. Furthermore, Weezy F is also using word-play from his following line,“I take a shit in the coffin” using both “shit(poop)” and “piss(urine)”", "annotation_id": "1199403", "url": "https://genius.com/1199403", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Outstanding (The Flyest)", "line": "My heart is in the dirty but the rest of me’s clean", "vault_lines": ["My heart is in the dirty but the rest of me's clean"], "meaning": "His heart resides in the “dirty” south (New Orleans), but he’s constantly on the road touring thus, he is elsewhere.", "annotation_id": "1166820", "url": "https://genius.com/1166820", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
