{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Outstanding (The Flyest)", "line": "Because I got power, just like a forward I come through the lane and straight dunk like Stoude- Mire, Amare reminds me of I, uh He’s a Phoenix Sun and I am fire", "vault_lines": ["Because I got power, just like a forward"], "meaning": "Amare Stoudemire is a perennial power forward in the NBA, who is known for his powerful dunks. He played for the Phoenix Suns from 2002-2010 and he currently plays for the New York Knicks. Lil Wayne plays on the words “sun” and “fire” and compares himself to Amare.", "annotation_id": "411055", "url": "https://genius.com/411055", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Outstanding (The Flyest)", "line": "Yeah, one circle, three fingers is the theme", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, one circle, three fingers is the theme"], "meaning": "When you do this action wit your hand, you end up wit a “B” which is the handsign for Bloods or Piru. Lil Wayne makes many references to being a blood in many of his songs\n\nHe’s not talking about a bowling ball…", "annotation_id": "411052", "url": "https://genius.com/411052", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
