{"type": "line", "artist": "Lil Wayne", "song": "Outro", "line": "It’s that Blood Gang five But green is the bottom line", "vault_lines": ["Blood, Bl-Blood Gang, five"], "meaning": "• The most commonly used Bloods symbols is the number “5”, the five-pointed star, and the five-pointed crown. These symbols are meant to show the Bloods' affiliation with the People Nation.\n\n\n\n•The Bloods represent the color Red but what Shyne meant with ‘'green’‘ is money (dollar). Money is their important factor. Money is a major source of conflict within gangs .Bloods  makes its income through various criminal activities.", "annotation_id": "13078329", "url": "https://genius.com/13078329", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
